msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/KeyAssertion|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "key assertion"
msgstr "键断言"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/KeyAssertion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A central record asserting that a class is identified by a KEY: the value of a single key property uniquely picks out the class instance, so two instances agreeing on the key value are the same individual — and two asserted distinct yet agreeing are a contradiction. It names the class with logic:keyClass and the key property with logic:keyProperty, the pair the native DL consistency gate joins to decide the key-agreement clash, and carries a logic:formalizes back-reference to the domain property whose prose it encodes. This is the canonical logic: carrier of a datatype/single-property key: minted standalone (the logic: analogue of an OWL 2 DL owl:hasKey axiom, which on a datatype property is the DL-safe alternative to an OWL 2 Full owl:InverseFunctionalProperty), so the key is a native reasoning obligation rather than a source owl:hasKey triple. The reasoning authority names and enforces it here; the OWL owl:hasKey axiom is its lossy DL view and the derived inverse sh:maxCount 1 its SHACL projection."
msgstr "一条核心记录,断言某个类由一个键(KEY)来标识:单一键属性的值唯一确定该类的实例,因此两个在键值上一致的实例即为同一个体——而两个被断言为不同却又一致的实例则构成矛盾。它用 logic:keyClass 命名该类,用 logic:keyProperty 命名键属性,原生DL一致性检查门正是通过这一对来判定键一致性冲突,并携带一个指向其所编码的领域属性的 logic:formalizes 反向引用。这是数据类型/单属性键的规范 logic: 载体:独立铸造(是 OWL 2 DL owl:hasKey 公理的 logic: 类比,该公理在数据类型属性上是 OWL 2 Full owl:InverseFunctionalProperty 的DL安全替代方案),因此该键是原生的推理义务,而非源头的 owl:hasKey 三元组。推理权威在此命名并强制执行它;OWL owl:hasKey 公理是其有损的DL视图,派生出的反向 sh:maxCount 1 是其SHACL投影。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An ordered slot in an atomic formula's logic:argument list, a function term's logic:argument list, or a quantifier's logic:quantifiedVariable block. It carries exactly one zero-based logic:termIndex and exactly one value kind: logic:termIri, logic:termVariable, logic:termLiteral, logic:termSequenceMarker, or logic:termApplication (a nested compound function term). It is not the term value itself; it is the RDF node that preserves the value's kind and position independently of triple order."
msgstr "原子公式的 logic:argument 列表、函数项的 logic:argument 列表或量词的 logic:quantifiedVariable 块中的一个有序槽位。它恰好携带一个从零开始的 logic:termIndex 和恰好一种值类型:logic:termIri、logic:termVariable、logic:termLiteral、logic:termSequenceMarker,或 logic:termApplication(一个嵌套的复合函数项)。它本身并非项值;而是独立于三元组顺序、保存该值的类型与位置的RDF节点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Requires every logic:TermCarrier to carry exactly one term-value kind: IRI, variable, literal, sequence marker, or compound function-term application. It does not constrain the carrier's ordinal; logic:termIndex and list-level contiguity are checked independently."
msgstr "要求每个 logic:TermCarrier 恰好携带一种项值类型:IRI、变量、字面量、序列标记,或复合函数项应用。它并不约束载体的序数;logic:termIndex 及列表层面的连续性是独立检查的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A carrier with both logic:termIri ex:a and logic:termVariable 'a' violates this constraint even though the spellings resemble one another; a carrier with both logic:termApplication and logic:termVariable violates it too."
msgstr "一个同时具有 logic:termIri ex:a 和 logic:termVariable 'a' 的载体会违反此约束,即便二者的拼写相似;一个同时具有 logic:termApplication 和 logic:termVariable 的载体同样违反此约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/acceptanceStatusFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:acceptanceStatus is functional: a gmeow:ArgumentEvaluation assigns its argument exactly one Dung label (in, out, or undecided), since one evaluation under one semantics settles on a single status and credulous multiplicity is carried by separate evaluations."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:acceptanceStatus 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:ArgumentEvaluation 恰好为其论证赋予一个邓氏标签(in、out 或 undecided),因为在一种语义下的一次评估会确定为单一状态,轻信式的多重性则由各自独立的评估来承载。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/accountServiceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:accountService is functional: an online account is held with exactly one service, so the account-to-service edge that places a handle on its network, forge, or federated instance carries a single value, and a moved account is modelled as a distinct OnlineAccount rather than a second service."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:accountService 是函数性的:一个在线账户恰好托管于一个服务,因此将某个账号置于其网络、代码托管平台或联邦实例上的账户到服务这条边只承载单一值,而迁移后的账户被建模为一个不同的 OnlineAccount,而非第二个服务。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/accountServiceHomepageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:accountServiceHomepage is functional: an account is held with a single service, so the homepage of that one held-with service — the FOAF accountServiceHomepage idiom — resolves to a single IRI per account rather than a set of competing homepages."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:accountServiceHomepage 是函数性的:一个账户托管于单一服务,因此该唯一托管服务的主页——即 FOAF 的 accountServiceHomepage 惯用法——每个账户只解析为单一IRI,而非一组相互竞争的主页。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/accountTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:accountType is functional: a financial account has exactly one canonical type — a single FinancialAccountType (bank, credit, investment, wallet), since an account with several types is modelled as several accounts."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:accountType 是函数性的:一个金融账户恰好具有一种规范类型——单一的 FinancialAccountType(银行、信贷、投资、钱包),因为具有多种类型的账户会被建模为多个账户。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/actionResourceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:actionResource is functional: an action schema declares exactly one consumable-or-required resource — the single supply that resource-competing goal conflict (logic:competesForResource) draws against — so the resource facet names one resource per schema, not a set."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:actionResource 是函数性的:一个动作模式恰好声明一种可消耗或所需的资源——即资源竞争型目标冲突(logic:competesForResource)所抽取的那唯一供给——因此资源这一方面每个模式只命名一种资源,而非一组。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/addressHolderFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:addressHolder is functional: an address-tenure situation concerns a single agent who held the contact point over its interval, so the tenure names one holder and a change of holder is a distinct tenure rather than a second holder on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:addressHolder 是函数性的:一个地址持有情境涉及在其区间内持有该联系点的单一主体,因此该持有情境只命名一个持有者,持有者的变更是一个独立的持有情境,而非在同一情境上出现第二个持有者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/addressValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:addressValue is functional: a first-class email address has one normalized addr-spec — the canonical whole from which its local and domain parts are derived — so it carries a single value rather than several rival spellings of the same address."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:addressValue 是函数性的:一个一等电子邮件地址具有一个规范化的 addr-spec——即派生出其本地部分与域名部分的规范整体——因此它只携带单一值,而非同一地址的多种相互竞争的拼写形式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/adequacyUnderStandardFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:adequacyUnderStandard is functional: a single reified gmeow:AdequacyAssessment judges its support against exactly one named gmeow:EpistemicStandard, so the assessment fixes one standard as the bar it measures against."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:adequacyUnderStandard 是函数性的:单一个具体化的 gmeow:AdequacyAssessment 恰好针对一个具名的 gmeow:EpistemicStandard 来评判其支持度,因此该评估将一个标准固定为其衡量的基准。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/againstIndexFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:againstIndex is functional: a retrieval event queries exactly one vector index, because federated retrieval is decomposed into several RetrievalEvents under one parent activity rather than one event fired against many indices."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:againstIndex 是函数性的:一个检索事件恰好查询一个向量索引,因为联合检索被分解为同一父活动下的多个 RetrievalEvent,而不是一个针对多个索引触发的事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/aggregationFunctionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:aggregationFunction is functional: a spatial aggregation applies exactly one statistical function — count, sum, average, density, minimum, maximum, or centroid — so computing a different function over the same region is a different aggregation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:aggregationFunction 是函数性的:一次空间聚合恰好应用一种统计函数——计数、求和、平均值、密度、最小值、最大值或质心——因此在同一区域上计算不同的函数即构成不同的聚合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/analysisFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:analysisFrame is functional: a single music-analysis claim expresses its result within exactly one music-theory reference frame, so an analysis stated against two frames is two distinct claims."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:analysisFrame 是函数性的:单一条音乐分析断言恰好在一个音乐理论参照框架内表达其结果,因此在两个框架下陈述的分析即为两条不同的断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/analysisPropertyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:analysisProperty is functional: each music-analysis claim asserts exactly one analytical dimension (key, harmony, meter, form function, motif identity, mode, tuning, groove, or schema), so a claim ranging over two dimensions is two claims."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:analysisProperty 是函数性的:每条音乐分析断言恰好断定一个分析维度(调性、和声、节拍、曲式功能、动机身份、调式、调音、律动或图式),因此涉及两个维度的断言即为两条断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/analysisResultFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:analysisResult is functional: a music-analysis claim carries exactly one result value for its asserted dimension, so a second result value is a second claim."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:analysisResult 是函数性的:一条音乐分析断言针对其所断定的维度恰好携带一个结果值,因此第二个结果值即构成第二条断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/analysisTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:analysisTarget is functional: a music-analysis claim is directed at exactly one musical target — one analysis, one target — so analysing a second entity is a separate claim."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:analysisTarget 是函数性的:一条音乐分析断言恰好针对一个音乐目标——一次分析,一个目标——因此分析第二个实体即构成一条独立的断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/anchorDegreeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:anchorDegree is functional: a PitchAnchor binds exactly one tuning-system degree to its frequency, so the degree it pins is single-valued per anchor."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:anchorDegree 是函数性的:一个 PitchAnchor 恰好将一个调音体系的音级绑定到其频率,因此每个锚点所固定的音级是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/anchorFrequencyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:anchorFrequency is functional: a PitchAnchor assigns exactly one physical frequency to its degree, so a degree pinned to two frequencies would be two anchors, not one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:anchorFrequency 是函数性的:一个 PitchAnchor 恰好为其音级指定一个物理频率,因此一个被固定到两个频率的音级将是两个锚点,而非一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/anchorRangeMaxFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:anchorRangeMax is functional: an anchored score range has exactly one upper bound, and a second maximum would leave the interval's ceiling ill-defined."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:anchorRangeMax 是函数性的:一个已锚定的乐谱范围恰好具有一个上界,若存在第二个最大值,该区间的上限将变得不确定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/anchorRangeMinFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:anchorRangeMin is functional: an anchored score range has exactly one lower bound, and a second minimum would leave the interval's floor ill-defined (the one lower bound that must never exceed the anchor's upper bound)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:anchorRangeMin 是函数性的:一个已锚定的乐谱范围恰好具有一个下界,若存在第二个最小值,该区间的下限将变得不确定(这唯一的下界绝不能超过该锚点的上界)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/annotationBodyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:annotationBody is functional: an annotation attaches exactly one note as its body, the single piece of content being attached — a highlight or bookmark simply has none."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:annotationBody 是函数性的:一条注释恰好附加一条笔记作为其正文,即被附加的单一内容——而高亮或书签则根本没有正文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/annotationMotivationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:annotationMotivation is functional: an annotation carries exactly one motivation, the single purpose for which its body is attached to its target."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:annotationMotivation 是函数性的:一条注释恰好携带一个动机,即其正文被附加到其目标的唯一目的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/annotationTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:annotationTarget is functional: an annotation binds exactly one target, the single entity being annotated."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:annotationTarget 是函数性的:一条注释恰好绑定一个目标,即被注释的单一实体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/antecedentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:antecedent is functional: a material-implication formula has exactly one antecedent — a single hypothesis formula — so the ordered, non-commutative implication reading is well-defined and never depends on serialization order."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:antecedent 是函数性的:一个实质蕴涵公式恰好具有一个前件——单一的假设公式——因此这种有序、非交换的蕴涵解读是良定义的,绝不依赖于序列化顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/appliedRuleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:appliedRule is functional: a gmeow:InferenceApplication invokes exactly one rule as its licence, since an application drawing on a second rule is a second inference step rather than one step with two warrants."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:appliedRule 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:InferenceApplication 恰好援引一条规则作为其许可,因为若一次应用还援引第二条规则,那便是第二个推理步骤,而非带有两个依据的同一步骤。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/appraisalOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:appraisalOf is functional: an appraisal cell is a reading of exactly one appraised subject — the single agent-state, work, event, or emotion it evaluates from the appraiser's vantage — so a second subject is a numerically distinct appraisal, never another value on this one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:appraisalOf 是函数性的:一个评价单元是对恰好一个被评价对象的解读——即评价者从其视角所评估的单一施动者状态、作品、事件或情感——因此第二个对象构成一个数目上不同的评价,而绝非在此评价上的另一个值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/appraisalScaleProfileFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:appraisalScaleProfile is functional: a dimensional appraisal reading is expressed against exactly one declared reference frame — a single range, midpoint, polarity, and transform — because the same bare magnitude read against two frames would carry two incompatible meanings."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:appraisalScaleProfile 是函数性的:一个维度性评价读数恰好相对于一个声明的参照框架来表达——单一的范围、中点、极性与变换——因为同一个裸量值若相对两个框架来解读,将承载两种不相容的含义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/arcFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:arcFrame is functional: a CharacterArc is interpreted within exactly one narrative reference frame, and the same trajectory read under a different continuity is a separate arc instance linked by counterpartOf rather than a second frame on the one arc."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:arcFrame 是函数性的:一个 CharacterArc 恰好在一个叙事参照框架内被解读,而同一轨迹在不同连续性下的解读则是通过 counterpartOf 关联的一个独立的弧实例,而非同一弧上的第二个框架。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/arcSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:arcSubject is functional: a CharacterArc describes the trajectory of exactly one subject entity, so an analysis spanning two characters is two arcs rather than one arc bearing two subjects."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:arcSubject 是函数性的:一个 CharacterArc 恰好描述一个主体实体的轨迹,因此涉及两个角色的分析是两条弧,而非一条承载两个主体的弧。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/arcTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:arcType is functional: a CharacterArc carries exactly one interpretive type from the open gmeow:ArcType vocabulary, so a trajectory read as both redemption and fall is two competing arc interpretations, not one arc holding two types."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:arcType 是函数性的:一个 CharacterArc 恰好携带来自开放词汇 gmeow:ArcType 的一种解读类型,因此一条同时被解读为救赎与堕落的轨迹是两种相互竞争的弧解读,而非一条弧承载两种类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/argumentConclusionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:argumentConclusion is functional: a gmeow:Argument establishes exactly one conclusion, since an argument concluding two claims is two arguments and the whole premise-to-conclusion structure is indexed to a single established claim."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:argumentConclusion 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Argument 恰好确立一个结论,因为得出两个论断的论证是两个论证,整个前提到结论的结构都索引到唯一确立的那个论断。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/argumentInferenceStepFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:argumentInferenceStep is functional: a gmeow:Argument wraps at most one Toulmin gmeow:InferenceCommitment, since a multi-step chain is modelled as several Arguments linked by gmeow:Support and each Argument therefore owns a single step."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:argumentInferenceStep 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Argument 至多包裹一个图尔敏式的 gmeow:InferenceCommitment,因为多步骤链条被建模为通过 gmeow:Support 相连的多个 Argument,因此每个 Argument 只拥有一个步骤。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/artifactMediaTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:artifactMediaType is functional: an attestation artifact is serialized in one wire format, so its IANA media-type string is a single value a consumer dispatches a parser on, distinct from the broader attestation kind that may sit alongside it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:artifactMediaType 是函数性的:一个证明文件以单一线路格式序列化,因此其 IANA 媒体类型字符串是消费方据以派发解析器的单一值,有别于可能与之并存的更广泛的证明类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/assertionFacetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:assertionFacet is functional: an accessibility assertion asserts exactly one facet, the single dimension of accessibility (wheelchair, step-free, visual, and so on) the relator is about."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:assertionFacet 是函数性的:一条无障碍断言恰好断定一个方面,即该关系元所涉及的单一无障碍维度(轮椅通行、无台阶、视觉等)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/assertionPolarityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:assertionPolarity is functional: an accessibility assertion carries exactly one polarity — feature, barrier, or limited — the single stance the relator takes on its facet."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:assertionPolarity 是函数性的:一条无障碍断言恰好携带一种极性——有利、障碍或受限——即该关系元在其所涉方面上所持的唯一立场。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/assertionSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:assertionSubject is functional: an accessibility assertion assesses exactly one subject, the single location or connection being evaluated."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:assertionSubject 是函数性的:一条无障碍断言恰好评估一个主体,即被评估的单一地点或连接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/assessedEventFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:assessedEvent is functional: a compliance assessment judges exactly one event — the single feature of interest whose compliance it reports — so weighing a second event is a separate assessment, not a further value here."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:assessedEvent 是函数性的:一次合规评估恰好评判一个事件——即其报告合规情况所针对的单一关注特征——因此权衡第二个事件是另一次独立的评估,而非此处的又一个值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/assessedNormFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:assessedNorm is functional: a compliance assessment weighs its event against exactly one norm, so judging the same event against a further norm is a distinct assessment rather than a second value on this one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:assessedNorm 是函数性的:一次合规评估恰好依据一项规范来衡量其事件,因此依据另一项规范来评判同一事件是一次独立的评估,而非此评估上的第二个值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/assessmentCriterionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:assessmentCriterion is functional: each assessment applies exactly one criterion — a twenty-one-axis scoring pass fans out into twenty-one assessments, one per axis — so a single assessment record names a single criterion."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:assessmentCriterion 是函数性的:每次评估恰好应用一个标准——一次二十一轴打分会展开为二十一次评估,每个轴一次——因此单条评估记录只命名一个标准。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/assessmentRubricFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:assessmentRubric is functional: an assessment is version-pinned to exactly one rubric, the single evaluation framework under which its score was produced."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:assessmentRubric 是函数性的:一次评估被版本锁定到恰好一份评分细则,即产生其分数所依据的单一评价框架。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/assessmentScoreValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:assessmentScoreValue is functional: an assessment yields exactly one numeric score on its declared scale — one cell holds one number, and even a zero is that single score rather than an absence."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:assessmentScoreValue 是函数性的:一次评估在其声明的量表上恰好产生一个数值分数——一个单元格容纳一个数字,即便是零,也是那唯一的分数,而非缺失。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/assessmentTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:assessmentTarget is functional: an assessment scores exactly one target — the single feature of interest whose granularity sets the scoring-density expectation — so a second target is a separate assessment."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:assessmentTarget 是函数性的:一次评估恰好为一个目标打分——即其粒度决定打分密度预期的单一关注特征——因此第二个目标构成一次独立的评估。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/assetTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:assetType is functional: a financial asset has exactly one canonical type — a single AssetType (stock, bond, cryptocurrency, real estate, commodity)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:assetType 是函数性的:一项金融资产恰好具有一种规范类型——单一的 AssetType(股票、债券、加密货币、房地产、大宗商品)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/assignedMeterFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:assignedMeter is functional: a MeterAssignment relator ties its carrier to exactly one MetricStructure over its span, so the assigned meter is single-valued per assignment."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:assignedMeter 是函数性的:一个 MeterAssignment 关系元在其跨度内恰好将其载体绑定到一个 MetricStructure,因此每次指派所分配的节拍是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/assignmentSpanFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:assignmentSpan is functional: a MeterAssignment holds over exactly one MusicalTimeSpan, so a meter applying across two disjoint spans is two assignments."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:assignmentSpan 是函数性的:一个 MeterAssignment 恰好在一个 MusicalTimeSpan 上成立,因此适用于两个不相交时间跨度的节拍即为两次指派。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/attackKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:attackKind is functional: a typed gmeow:Attack has exactly one kind (undermine, undercut, or rebut), since that kind must agree with the target's type and a single attack cannot be two kinds at once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:attackKind 是函数性的:一个类型化的 gmeow:Attack 恰好具有一种类型(削弱前提、反驳推理、反驳结论),因为该类型必须与目标的类型相符,且单次攻击不能同时是两种类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/attackTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:attackTarget is functional: a typed gmeow:Attack names exactly one target — a premise-use, an inference-application, or a conclusion — matching its single kind, so an attack on two things is two attacks."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:attackTarget 是函数性的:一个类型化的 gmeow:Attack 恰好命名一个目标——前提使用、推理应用或结论之一——与其单一类型相匹配,因此针对两个事物的攻击即为两次攻击。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/attestationIntervalFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:attestationInterval is functional: a usage attestation carries exactly one observation interval, the single corpus span, inscription period, or usage era over which the attested usage is asserted to have been seen."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:attestationInterval 是函数性的:一条使用证明恰好携带一个观察区间,即被断言观察到该用法的单一语料跨度、铭刻时期或使用年代。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/attestedFormFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:attestedForm is functional: a usage attestation observes exactly one lexical form, its single feature of interest — a distinct attestation is minted per form rather than piling several onto one relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:attestedForm 是函数性的:一条使用证明恰好观察一个词形,即其唯一的关注特征——每种词形都单独铸造一条证明,而不是把多个堆积在同一个关系元上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/attesterFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:attester is functional: within the attestation relator there is exactly one vouching party, so the WHO of the envelope names a single agent and jointly-issued vouching is modelled as several Attestations, one per attester, rather than two attesters on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:attester 是函数性的:在证明关系元内部恰好有一个担保方,因此该信封的谁(WHO)只命名单一主体,联合出具的担保被建模为多条 Attestation,每位担保人一条,而非在同一条上出现两个担保人。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/attributedKnowerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:attributedKnower is functional: one gmeow:KnowledgeAttribution credits exactly one agent with the knowing — the single knower it is about, which may equal the attributing agent for self-attribution but is never plural within one attribution."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:attributedKnower 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeAttribution 恰好将知晓归于一个主体——即其所涉及的唯一知晓者,在自我归属的情况下可能与归属主体相同,但在同一归属内绝不会是复数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/attributedPropositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:attributedProposition is functional: one gmeow:KnowledgeAttribution is about exactly one proposition attributed as known, so a single non-factive 'takes themselves to know' attribution names one propositional target and entails no truth of it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:attributedProposition 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeAttribution 恰好涉及一个被归属为已知的命题,因此单一条非实然的『自认为知道』('takes themselves to know')归属只命名一个命题目标,且不蕴含其为真。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/attributingAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:attributingAgent is functional: one gmeow:KnowledgeAttribution has exactly one agent making it — the single attributer whose standpoint the credited knowing is reported from, never two co-attributers within one attribution."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:attributingAgent 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeAttribution 恰好由一个主体作出——即从其立场报告所归功之知晓的唯一归属者,同一归属内绝不会有两个共同归属者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/attributionTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:attributionTarget is functional: a script/language attribution classifies exactly one target inscription, the single sign-bearing feature the relator is about (competing attributions of that inscription are separate relators, not extra targets)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:attributionTarget 是函数性的:一条文字系统/语言归属恰好对一个目标铭文进行分类,即该关系元所涉及的单一承载符号的特征(对该铭文的相互竞争的归属是各自独立的关系元,而非额外的目标)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/authMethodFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:authMethod is functional: an AuthenticationResult reifies a single RFC 8601 authentication check, and each such check tests exactly one method — dkim, spf, dmarc, arc, iprev, or auth — so the reified result names that one method."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:authMethod 是函数性的:一个 AuthenticationResult 具体化了单一次 RFC 8601 认证检查,而每一次此类检查恰好测试一种方法——dkim、spf、dmarc、arc、iprev 或 auth——因此该具体化结果只命名那一种方法。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/authResultFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:authResult is functional: the single method an AuthenticationResult evaluates yields exactly one verdict — pass, fail, none, softfail, neutral, temperror, or permerror — so the reified check carries one result."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:authResult 是函数性的:一个 AuthenticationResult 所评估的那唯一方法恰好产生一个判定结果——pass、fail、none、softfail、neutral、temperror 或 permerror——因此该具体化检查只携带一个结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/authServerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:authServer is functional: each AuthenticationResult records its check as stamped by a single authserv-id — the one authentication-serv-id that performed it — so the verifying server is one value."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:authServer 是函数性的:每个 AuthenticationResult 都将其检查记录为由单一个 authserv-id 所盖章——即执行该检查的唯一认证服务标识——因此验证服务器是单一值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/authorIdentityStringFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:authorIdentityString is functional: an AuthorIdentity records exactly one raw byte-string — the single 'Name <email>' line as it appeared in the commit object, an immutable historical assertion that is never re-recorded."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:authorIdentityString 是函数性的:一个 AuthorIdentity 恰好记录一条原始字节串——即提交对象中出现的那唯一一行『Name <email>』,是一条不可变的历史断言,永远不会被重新记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/availabilitySlotFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:availabilitySlot is functional: an availability statement holds over exactly one time interval — the single bounded free-busy slot across which its status applies uniformly."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:availabilitySlot 是函数性的:一条可用性声明恰好在一个时间区间内成立——即其状态统一适用的单一有界忙闲时段。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/awarenessSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:awarenessSubject is functional: each gmeow:AwarenessTenure reifies the awareness state of exactly one bearer agent, so this per-branch subject edge (Principle 4, deliberately not gufo:inheresIn) names a single experiencer for the mode-over-interval it records."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:awarenessSubject 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:AwarenessTenure 恰好具体化一个承载主体的意识状态,因此这条按分支划分的主体边(原则4,刻意区别于 gufo:inheresIn)为其所记录的区间上模式命名了唯一的体验者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/axisContextScopeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:axisContextScope is functional: each gmeow:QualityAxis is granted exactly one read-breadth coeffect — slice-local, dependency-closure, or merged-closure — so a second scope would leave the scope gate unable to decide how much graph the axis's primitive may read."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:axisContextScope 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:QualityAxis 恰好被授予一个读取广度协同效应——切片本地、依赖闭包或合并闭包——因此若存在第二个范围,作用域门将无法判定该轴的基元可以读取多大范围的图。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/axisWeightFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:axisWeight is functional: each gmeow:QualityAxis carries exactly one advice-ranking priority, so a second weight would make the advisor's remediation ordering ambiguous — and because the weight only orders advice (never the unweighted lattice-meet roll-up), one value per axis is all the ranking can consume."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:axisWeight 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:QualityAxis 恰好携带一个建议排序优先级,因此若存在第二个权重,顾问的整改排序将变得含糊——而且由于该权重仅用于排序建议(而绝不用于无权重的格交汇汇总),每个轴一个值正是排序所能消耗的全部。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/bearerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:bearer is functional: a persistent gmeow:Quality inheres in exactly one bearer — the single entity whose quality it is, the patient whose blood pressure or the road whose width, inherence being a one-owner relation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:bearer 是函数性的:一个持久性的 gmeow:Quality 恰好内在于一个承载者——即该性质所属的唯一实体,可能是血压所属的病患,也可能是宽度所属的道路,内在性是一种单一所有者的关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/blockHashFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:blockHash is functional: a ledger block has one content-addressed cryptographic identity, so its block hash is a single value that anchors the block independent of its sequential number."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:blockHash 是函数性的:一个账本区块具有一个按内容寻址的密码学身份,因此其区块哈希是独立于其顺序编号、用以锚定该区块的单一值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/blockNumberFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:blockNumber is functional: a ledger block occupies one position in the chain, so its height is a single integer against which confirmation depth is measured, never a set of competing ordinals."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:blockNumber 是函数性的:一个账本区块在链中占据一个位置,因此其高度是用以衡量确认深度的单一整数,绝非一组相互竞争的序数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/bodyStructureFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:bodyStructure is functional: the serialized JMAP EmailBodyStructure object is a single raw round-trip projection of a message's one MIME tree, so each message preserves exactly one such structure literal."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:bodyStructure 是函数性的:序列化的 JMAP EmailBodyStructure 对象是消息唯一MIME树的单一原始可往返投影,因此每条消息恰好保留一个这样的结构字面量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/buildConfigUriFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:buildConfigUri is functional: a build activity is driven by exactly one build-configuration or workflow file, whose single URI identifies the recipe that describes how the build ran."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:buildConfigUri 是函数性的:一次构建活动恰好由一个构建配置或工作流文件驱动,其单一URI标识了描述该构建如何运行的配方。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/calendarTimeZoneFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:calendarTimeZone is functional: a calendar collection has exactly one default time zone — the single fallback IANA offset its members are reckoned in when an individual event states no zone of its own."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:calendarTimeZone 是函数性的:一个日历集合恰好具有一个默认时区——即当某个具体事件未声明自身时区时,其成员据以计算的单一后备 IANA 偏移。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/calledByInvocationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:calledByInvocation is functional: a tool call is requested by at most one model invocation, the single requesting invocation that issued it (optional, because a recording harness may not expose it, but never plural)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:calledByInvocation 是函数性的:一次工具调用至多由一次模型调用发起请求,即发出该请求的唯一调用方(可选,因为记录用测试框架可能不会暴露它,但绝不会是复数)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateCategoryFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:candidateCategory is functional: a candidate's prose carried exactly one kind of force, so it resolves to a single logic:FormalizationCategory from the closed set — a candidate with none is a hard governance error, never silently bucketed."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:candidateCategory 是函数性的:一个候选项的表述恰好携带一种力度类型,因此它会解析为封闭集合中唯一的一个 logic:FormalizationCategory——不具备任何力度类型的候选项是一个严重的治理错误,绝不会被悄悄归类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateContractFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:candidateContract is functional: a candidate's proposed axiom is interpreted under exactly one logic:ReasoningContract — the single reasoning semantics that make the word 'sound' meaningful for it — so its soundness is judged against one contract, not several."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:candidateContract 是函数式的：候选者提出的公理仅在恰好一个 logic:ReasoningContract 下被解释——这是使 'sound' 一词对其有意义的唯一推理语义——因此其可靠性是针对一个契约而非多个契约来判定的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateExtractionProvenanceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:candidateExtractionProvenance is functional: a candidate was produced by exactly one extraction event, so it records a single provenance string naming what produced it — the one extractor, run, or model invocation whose automated origin keeps it at logic:CandidateProposed with no canonical force until reviewed."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:candidateExtractionProvenance 是函数式的：一个候选者仅由恰好一个抽取事件产生，因此它记录了唯一一条来源字符串，用以指明是什么产生了它——即那唯一的抽取器、运行或模型调用，其自动化来源使其在被审核之前始终停留在 logic:CandidateProposed，不具有规范效力。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateFormalizesFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:candidateFormalizes is functional: a harvested candidate keeps exactly one prose-bearing term coherent, so its harvest back-link names a single formalized term — present exactly when the source IS a term's annotation field, and paired with the single logic:candidateSourceField that pins which field."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:candidateFormalizes 是函数式的：一个被采集的候选者使恰好一个承载散文的术语保持一致，因此其采集回链指向唯一一个被形式化的术语——仅当来源正是某术语的注释字段时才存在，并与固定具体字段的唯一 logic:candidateSourceField 配对。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateLifecycleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:candidateLifecycle is functional: a candidate occupies exactly one governance lifecycle state at a time, so it carries a single logic:CandidateLifecycleState — a candidate cannot be both proposed and accepted, and logic:CandidateAccepted is legitimate only with a recorded logic:reviewedBy decision."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:candidateLifecycle 是函数式的：一个候选者在任一时刻仅处于一个治理生命周期状态，因此它携带唯一一个 logic:CandidateLifecycleState——候选者不能同时既是被提议的又是被接受的，且 logic:CandidateAccepted 只有在记录了 logic:reviewedBy 决定后才合法。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateProjectionBehaviorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:candidateProjectionBehavior is functional: a candidate's axiom survives down-projection to OWL/Datalog/SHACL with exactly one preservation polarity, so it carries a single logic:PreservationKind reused from the loss ledger rather than a set of conflicting notes."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:candidateProjectionBehavior 是函数式的：候选者的公理以恰好一种保留极性经受向 OWL/Datalog/SHACL 的下投影，因此它携带从损失账本中复用的唯一一个 logic:PreservationKind，而非一组相互冲突的注记。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateScopeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:candidateScope is functional: a candidate's proposed axiom has one intended scope — the single terms, slice, or context it is meant to constrain — so its reach is stated once, read together with the single logic:candidateContract it is interpreted under."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:candidateScope 是函数式的：候选者提出的公理只有一个预期范围——它意在约束的唯一术语、切片或上下文——因此其覆盖范围仅陈述一次，需与其被解释所依据的唯一 logic:candidateContract 一并解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateSemanticRiskFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:candidateSemanticRisk is functional: a candidate carries exactly one logic:SemanticRiskClass — how far a wrong formalization would propagate — because that single risk grade sets how strict the reviewer gate must be, and a candidate cannot occupy two risk grades at once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:candidateSemanticRisk 是函数式的：一个候选者携带恰好一个 logic:SemanticRiskClass——即错误的形式化会传播多远——因为正是这唯一的风险等级决定了审核关卡必须有多严格，而一个候选者不能同时处于两个风险等级。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateSourceFieldFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:candidateSourceField is functional: a candidate harvested from exactly one annotation field of its logic:candidateFormalizes term, so it names a single logic:ProseField from the closed set (definition, use-when, or avoid-when) — the one field that, with the formalized term, pins the harvested axiom to its exact source triple."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:candidateSourceField 是函数式的：候选者仅从其 logic:candidateFormalizes 术语的恰好一个注释字段中采集，因此它从封闭集合（`definition`、`use-when` 或 `avoid-when`）中指定唯一一个 logic:ProseField——正是这一个字段与被形式化的术语一起，将采集到的公理固定到其确切的来源三元组上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/candidateSourceHashFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:candidateSourceHash is functional: a candidate was extracted from one exact span of source text, so it anchors to a single content hash — the one fingerprint that ties the candidate back to that prose and detects drift the moment the prose changes."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:candidateSourceHash 是函数式的：候选者是从源文本的一个确切片段中抽取出来的，因此它锚定于唯一一个内容哈希——正是这一个指纹将候选者与该散文关联起来，并在散文发生变化的那一刻检测到漂移。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/capacityOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:capacityOf is functional: a capacity measurement is constitutively about exactly one location, so the single location it quantifies fixes the measurement's identity and a second location would be a distinct measurement."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:capacityOf 是函数式的：容量测量在构成上恰好关于一个位置，因此它所量化的唯一位置确定了该测量的身份，第二个位置将构成一次不同的测量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/cascadeFirstLinkFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:cascadeFirstLink is functional: a cascade has exactly one entry link, the single causal link at which a walk of the named failure chain begins."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:cascadeFirstLink 是函数式的：一个级联恰好有一个入口链接，即该命名故障链的遍历开始所在的唯一因果链接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/causalModalityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:causalModality is functional: a causal link claims exactly one force — necessitates, promotes, enables, or prevents — the single modality that is the very reason the link was reified."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:causalModality 是函数式的：一个因果链接恰好宣称一种作用力——必然导致、促进、使能或阻止——这唯一的模态正是该链接被具体化的根本原因。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ceilingCountFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:ceilingCount is functional: each per-(slice,vocabulary) gmeow:ProjectionCeilingCommitment pins exactly one committed maximum residue count, so a second count would make the lower-only regression ceiling the gate enforces ambiguous."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:ceilingCount 是函数式的：每个按(切片,词表)划分的 gmeow:ProjectionCeilingCommitment 固定恰好一个承诺的最大残余计数，若存在第二个计数，则会使关卡强制执行的仅可下降的回归上限变得含糊不清。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ceilingSliceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:ceilingSlice is functional: each gmeow:ProjectionCeilingCommitment names exactly one subject slice whose measured residue the ceiling guards, so a second slice would make the ratchet cell pin an ambiguous target."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:ceilingSlice 是函数式的：每个 gmeow:ProjectionCeilingCommitment 恰好指定一个主体切片，其被度量的残余由该上限所守护，若存在第二个切片，棘轮单元所固定的目标将变得含糊。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ceilingVocabularyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:ceilingVocabulary is functional: each gmeow:ProjectionCeilingCommitment caps exactly one guarded gmeow:ProjectionVocabulary, so a second vocabulary would leave the ceiling applying to no single guarded surface."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:ceilingVocabulary 是函数式的：每个 gmeow:ProjectionCeilingCommitment 恰好为一个受保护的 gmeow:ProjectionVocabulary 设定上限，若存在第二个词表，该上限将无法应用于任何单一的受保护表面。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/centsFromOriginFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:centsFromOrigin is functional: a PitchExpression has exactly one cents value, generated by fnRatioToCents from its single canonical ratio, so the derived cents measure is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:centsFromOrigin 是函数式的：一个 PitchExpression 恰好有一个音分值，由 fnRatioToCents 根据其唯一的规范比率生成，因此该派生的音分度量是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/certificationLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:certificationLevel is functional: a gmeow:Certification records exactly one care level for the single binding it attests, since one attestation cannot be simultaneously casual and positive."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:certificationLevel 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:Certification 为其证明的唯一绑定记录恰好一个谨慎程度，因为一次证明不能同时既是随意的又是确证的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/certifiedIdentityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:certifiedIdentity is functional: a gmeow:Certification binds its key to exactly one gmeow:Agent identity, since a claim binding the key to a different identity is a separate certification across standpoints rather than a second identity on this one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:certifiedIdentity 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:Certification 将其密钥绑定到恰好一个 gmeow:Agent 身份，因为将该密钥绑定到不同身份的主张属于跨立场的另一份证明，而非此证明上的第二个身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/certifiedKeyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:certifiedKey is functional: a gmeow:Certification vouches for exactly one gmeow:CryptographicKey, since the key half of the attested binding is singular and a different key is a different attestation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:certifiedKey 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:Certification 恰好为一个 gmeow:CryptographicKey 作担保，因为所证明绑定中「密钥」的那一半是单一的，不同的密钥意味着不同的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/certifierFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:certifier is functional: a gmeow:Certification is made by exactly one certifying gmeow:Agent, since a second signer's attestation of the same binding is a separate certification rather than a second certifier on this one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:certifier 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:Certification 恰好由一个进行认证的 gmeow:Agent 作出，因为第二位签署者对同一绑定的证明构成另一份证明，而非此证明上的第二个认证者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/chainIdFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:chainId is functional: a blockchain network is named by one CAIP-2 chain identifier, so the string that distinguishes it from every other chain is single-valued and on-chain hashes and addresses resolve against exactly one network."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:chainId 是函数式的：一个区块链网络由一个 CAIP-2 链标识符命名，因此将其与所有其他链区分开来的字符串是单值的，链上哈希和地址仅针对恰好一个网络进行解析。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/chunkOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:chunkOf is functional: a chunk is cut from exactly one source information object, so its parthood seam carries a single whole and any re-segmentation produces fresh Chunk individuals rather than re-pointing an existing one at a second source."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:chunkOf 是函数式的：一个片段恰好从一个源信息对象中切分而来，因此其部分关系的接缝携带唯一一个整体，任何重新切分都会产生全新的 Chunk 个体，而不是将现有个体重新指向第二个来源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/citationIntentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:citationIntent is functional: a gmeow:CitationAct is made with exactly one intent — a second intent means minting a second CitationAct, not overloading one relator with two values."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:citationIntent 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:CitationAct 恰好带有一个意图——第二个意图意味着铸造第二个 CitationAct，而不是让一个关系体承载两个值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/citedEntityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:citedEntity is functional: each gmeow:CitationAct relator points at exactly one cited creative work — the single WEMI-tier target the citation is directed at."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:citedEntity 是函数式的：每个 gmeow:CitationAct 关系体恰好指向一个被引用的创作作品——即该引用所指向的唯一 WEMI 层级目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/citingEntityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:citingEntity is functional: each gmeow:CitationAct relator has exactly one citing player — the single claim, work, module, or dataset that does the citing."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:citingEntity 是函数式的：每个 gmeow:CitationAct 关系体恰好有一个施引方——即执行引用行为的唯一主张、作品、模块或数据集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/claimAssertoricForceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:claimAssertoricForce is functional: a standpoint claim carries one speech-act force — assert, conjecture, assume, or retract — so the relator takes a single force (absent reading as assert) and a retracted assertion is closed as a retained act rather than gaining a rival force."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:claimAssertoricForce 是函数式的：一个立场主张携带一种言语行为效力——断言、推测、假定或撤回——因此关系体取唯一一种效力（缺省即读作 assert），被撤回的断言被封闭为一个被保留的行为，而不会获得一个相竞争的效力。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/claimCredenceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:claimCredence is functional: a standpoint claim carries one precise graded belief as an xsd:decimal in [0,1], so the advisory numeric surface is a single value that must lie within its authoritative credence band's threshold range rather than a set of competing decimals."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:claimCredence 是函数式的：一个立场主张携带一个精确的分级信念，以 [0,1] 区间内的 xsd:decimal 表示，因此该建议性数值层面是一个单一值，必须落在其权威可信度带的阈值范围之内，而非一组相互竞争的小数值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/claimCredenceLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:claimCredenceLevel is functional: a standpoint claim carries one qualitative credence band — the surface the lossless legacy projection keys on — so a claim's graded belief resolves to a single frame-relative band rather than several bands on one claim."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:claimCredenceLevel 是函数式的：一个立场主张携带一个定性的可信度带——这正是无损遗留投影所依赖的层面——因此一个主张的分级信念解析为唯一一个相对于框架的带，而不是在同一主张上存在多个带。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/claimModalForceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:claimModalForce is functional: a standpoint claim carries one alethic modal force in the □/◊ register, so the relator takes a single force (absent reading as necessary), kept orthogonal to credence and confidence rather than stacking rival modal values."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:claimModalForce 是函数式的：一个立场主张在 □/◊ 记法体系中携带一种真势模态力，因此关系体取唯一一种效力（缺省即读作 necessary），与可信度和置信度保持正交，而不是叠加相互竞争的模态值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/claimModalityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:claimModality is functional: a standpoint claim carries one five-value belief modality — unequivocal, probable, conceivable, refuted, or bullshit — the lossless projection of the six canonical axes, so this convenience twin resolves to a single frame-relative value (absent reading as unequivocal) rather than several modalities on one claim."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:claimModality 是函数式的：一个立场主张携带一个五值信念模态——unequivocal、probable、conceivable、refuted 或 bullshit——即六条规范轴的无损投影，因此这个便利化的孪生值解析为唯一一个相对于框架的值（缺省即读作 unequivocal），而不是在同一主张上存在多个模态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/claimOfBeliefFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:claimOfBelief is functional: one gmeow:DoxasticStandpointClaim reports exactly one held gmeow:DoxasticState — the single believing mode the claim is the vantage-indexed report of, so the reporting claim binds to one underlying belief."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:claimOfBelief 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:DoxasticStandpointClaim 恰好报告一个所持有的 gmeow:DoxasticState——即该主张作为立场索引式报告所对应的唯一信念模式——因此该报告性主张绑定于唯一一个基础信念。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/claimPolarityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:claimPolarity is functional: a standpoint claim takes one affirm / deny / suspend direction, so the relator carries a single polarity (absent reading as affirm) and deny stays the frame-relative carrier of the legacy refuted rather than one claim holding several polarities."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:claimPolarity 是函数式的：一个立场主张取唯一一个 affirm / deny / suspend 方向，因此关系体携带唯一一种极性（缺省即读作 affirm），deny 仍是遗留 refuted 的相对于框架的载体，而不是一个主张同时持有多种极性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/claimResultFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:claimResult is functional: a topology claim wraps exactly one computed topology result, the single TopologyResult it makes a standpoint-relative claim about."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:claimResult 是函数式的：一个拓扑主张恰好包裹一个已计算的拓扑结果，即该主张就其做出相对于立场之陈述所针对的唯一 TopologyResult。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/claimSupportStatusFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:claimSupportStatus is functional: a standpoint claim carries one Belnap evidential status — supported, opposed, both, or neither — so a witnessed glut or gap is recorded as the single admissible status of the claim rather than being split into rival status values on one claim."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:claimSupportStatus 是函数式的：一个立场主张携带一个 Belnap 证据状态——supported、opposed、both 或 neither——因此所观察到的过剩（glut）或空缺（gap）被记录为该主张唯一可采纳的状态，而不是在同一主张上被拆分为多个相互竞争的状态值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/claimTruthDirectednessFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:claimTruthDirectedness is functional: a standpoint claim carries one orientation toward truth — truth-aimed, indifferent, or strategic — so the relator takes a single orientation (absent reading as truth-aimed) and indifferent remains the sole carrier of the legacy bullshit rather than co-existing orientations on one claim."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:claimTruthDirectedness 是函数式的：一个立场主张携带一种对真理的取向——`truth-aimed`、`indifferent` 或 `strategic`——因此关系体取唯一一种取向（缺省即读作 `truth-aimed`），indifferent 仍是遗留 bullshit 的唯一载体，而不是在同一主张上共存多种取向。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/closesAtFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:closesAt is functional: a gmeow:OpeningHoursSpecification window has exactly one closing time, a single xsd:time that bounds where the window ends."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:closesAt 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:OpeningHoursSpecification 时间窗恰好有一个关闭时间，即界定该窗口结束位置的唯一一个 xsd:time。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/coarsenToFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:coarsenTo is functional: a coarsening mark points at exactly one gmeow:GranularityLevel, the single coarsest level a value may be disclosed at, so multiple possibly-conflicting floors would be ill-formed."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:coarsenTo 是函数式的：一个粗化标记恰好指向一个 gmeow:GranularityLevel，即一个值可被披露的唯一最粗粒度层级，因此多个可能相互冲突的下限将是形式不良的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/codecClassFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:codecClass is functional: a gmeow:TransformCodec has exactly one capability class — the single kind of thing a reader must hold to reverse it, a library or a key, never both at once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:codecClass 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:TransformCodec 恰好有一个能力类别——读取者要将其还原所必须持有的唯一一种事物，即一个库或一把密钥，而绝不会同时是两者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/collectionKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:collectionKind is functional: a PitchCollection is of exactly one kind (scale, mode, maqam, raga, pitch-class set, etc.), with contested or hybrid categorisations modelled as coexisting standpoints rather than as multiple kinds on one collection."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:collectionKind 是函数式的：一个 PitchCollection 恰好属于一种类型（scale、mode、maqam、raga、pitch-class set 等），存在争议或混合的分类被建模为并存的多个立场，而不是同一集合上的多个类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/collectionPartOrderFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:collectionPartOrder is functional: a pitch collection occupies exactly one zero-based position within its primary parent collection, so its part order is single-valued, and reuse under other parents at different orders uses per-parent part individuals."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:collectionPartOrder 是函数式的：一个音高集合在其主要父集合中恰好占据一个从零开始的位置，因此其部分顺序是单值的，若在不同顺序下被其他父集合复用，则使用各父集合专属的部分个体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/commitAuthorIdentityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:commitAuthorIdentity is functional: a commit object records exactly one author-identity line — the single raw historical byte-string naming who wrote the patch, distinct from the canonical agent it may be understood to refer to."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:commitAuthorIdentity 是函数式的：一个 commit 对象恰好记录一行作者身份信息——即指明是谁编写了该补丁的唯一原始历史字节串，它不同于该信息可能被理解为指代的规范主体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/commitCommitterIdentityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:commitCommitterIdentity is functional: a commit object records exactly one committer-identity line — the single raw historical byte-string naming who applied the commit to the repository, distinct from its author identity."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:commitCommitterIdentity 是函数式的：一个 commit 对象恰好记录一行提交者身份信息——即指明是谁将该提交应用到仓库的唯一原始历史字节串，它不同于其作者身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/commitInRepositoryFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:commitInRepository is functional: a commit belongs to exactly one repository, since a fork is a separate repository carrying its own independent history rather than a second home for the same commit."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:commitInRepository 是函数式的：一个提交恰好属于一个仓库，因为一个分支（fork）是一个承载其自身独立历史的独立仓库，而不是同一提交的第二个归属地。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/commitTreeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:commitTree is functional: a commit records exactly one root source tree — the single directory snapshot it captures at that point in the repository's history."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:commitTree 是函数式的：一个提交恰好记录一个根源代码树——即它在仓库历史该时间点所捕获的唯一目录快照。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/committedAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:committedAgent is functional: a gmeow:Commitment binds exactly one committed agent, mutual promises being modelled as two directed Commitments so that withdrawal, breach, and tenure stay independent per direction."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:committedAgent 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:Commitment 恰好绑定一个被约束的主体，相互承诺被建模为两个有方向的 Commitment，从而使撤回、违约和存续期在各自方向上保持独立。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/comparesLeftTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:comparesLeftTarget is functional: a pairwise similarity observation scores exactly one operand pair, so it names exactly one left operand row — the single gmeow:VectorTarget whose vector its gmeow:similarityScore is a proximity of; a second left row would be a second, distinct observation, not one claim with two left operands."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:comparesLeftTarget 是函数式的：一次成对相似度观测恰好为一对操作数评分，因此它恰好指定一行左操作数——即其 gmeow:similarityScore 所度量的邻近关系所针对向量的唯一 gmeow:VectorTarget；第二个左行将构成第二次、不同的观测，而不是一个带有两个左操作数的主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/comparesRightTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:comparesRightTarget is functional: a pairwise similarity observation scores exactly one operand pair, so it names exactly one right operand row — the single gmeow:VectorTarget whose vector its gmeow:similarityScore is a proximity of; a second right row would be a second, distinct observation, not one claim with two right operands."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:comparesRightTarget 是函数式的：一次成对相似度观测恰好为一对操作数评分，因此它恰好指定一行右操作数——即其 gmeow:similarityScore 所度量的邻近关系所针对向量的唯一 gmeow:VectorTarget；第二个右行将构成第二次、不同的观测，而不是一个带有两个右操作数的主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/complianceVerdictFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:complianceVerdict is functional: a compliance assessment records exactly one verdict from its single assessor, and a divergent judgement is a separate coexisting assessment cell rather than a second verdict on this one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:complianceVerdict 是函数式的：一次合规评估恰好记录来自其唯一评估者的一个裁定，不同的判断构成一个并存的独立评估单元，而不是在同一评估上的第二个裁定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/computationOverCompilationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:computationOverCompilation is functional: a topology computation runs over exactly one complex compilation, since a federated computation spanning several compilations is several computations under a parent activity."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:computationOverCompilation 是函数式的：一次拓扑计算恰好在一个复合编译上运行，因为跨越多个编译的联合计算是在一个父活动之下的多次计算。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/conceptHoldsForFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:conceptHoldsFor is functional: one gmeow:ConceptTenure records the intension of exactly one concept, so the tenure binds to a single concept even though a concept may accrue many tenures over time."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:conceptHoldsFor 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:ConceptTenure 恰好记录一个概念的内涵，因此该存续期绑定于唯一一个概念，尽管一个概念随时间可能积累许多个存续期。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/conclusionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:conclusion is functional: a gmeow:InferenceCommitment establishes one gmeow:StandpointClaim as its conclusion, since a commitment with two conclusions is two commitments and SHACL derived from this record enforces exactly one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:conclusion 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:InferenceCommitment 确立唯一一个 gmeow:StandpointClaim 作为其结论，因为带有两个结论的承诺实为两个承诺，而从该记录派生的 SHACL 强制要求恰好一个结论。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/conditionTextFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:conditionText is functional: a condition has exactly one canonical prose statement — the single authoritative form every machine formalization must approximate — so a second prose body would install a rival canon within one condition."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:conditionText 是函数式的：一个条件恰好有一个规范散文陈述——即每一种机器形式化都必须逼近的唯一权威形式——因此第二段散文文本将在同一条件内树立一个相互竞争的正典。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/configurationEmbodimentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:configurationEmbodiment is functional: a gmeow:InhabitationConfiguration has exactly one active core embodiment, the single gmeow:EmbodimentAssignment that holds constant across the configuration sub-interval."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:configurationEmbodiment 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:InhabitationConfiguration 恰好有一个活跃的核心体现，即在该配置子区间内保持恒定的唯一 gmeow:EmbodimentAssignment。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/configurationInstrumentTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:configurationInstrumentType is functional: an InstrumentConfiguration relator applies to exactly one kind of instrument, so the instrument type it targets is single-valued per relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:configurationInstrumentType 是函数式的：一个 InstrumentConfiguration 关系体恰好适用于一种乐器类型，因此每个关系体所针对的乐器类型是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/configurationIntervalFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:configurationInterval is functional: an InstrumentConfiguration is described by at most one characterising interval, so the interval it names is single-valued per relator (optional, since some modifications alter timbre without a named interval)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:configurationInterval 是函数式的：一个 InstrumentConfiguration 至多由一个表征性音程来描述，因此其所指定的音程在每个关系体上是单值的（可选，因为某些改动会改变音色而没有可命名的音程）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/configurationOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:configurationOf is functional: an InstrumentConfiguration relator applies to exactly one specific instrument item, so the item it configures is single-valued per relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:configurationOf 是函数式的：一个 InstrumentConfiguration 关系体恰好适用于一个具体的乐器项，因此其所配置的项在每个关系体上是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/configurationOfTenureFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:configurationOfTenure is functional: each gmeow:InhabitationConfiguration is a constant-configuration sub-interval of exactly one gmeow:InhabitationTenure that it partitions."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:configurationOfTenure 是函数式的：每个 gmeow:InhabitationConfiguration 都是恰好一个 gmeow:InhabitationTenure 的恒定配置子区间，并对其进行划分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/configurationTuningFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:configurationTuningFrame is functional: an InstrumentConfiguration is expressed relative to exactly one tuning frame, so its reference frame is single-valued per relator (Principle 11)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:configurationTuningFrame 是函数式的：一个 InstrumentConfiguration 相对于恰好一个调音框架来表达，因此其参照框架在每个关系体上是单值的（原则 11）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/conflictStrategyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:conflictStrategy is functional: a rights statement settles a permission-versus-prohibition clash over the same action by exactly one resolution rule — permission wins, prohibition wins, or the policy is void — because two competing strategies would themselves conflict over how the conflict is to be settled, leaving the policy's outcome undefined."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:conflictStrategy 是函数式的：权利声明通过恰好一条解决规则来裁定针对同一行为的许可与禁止之间的冲突——许可胜出、禁止胜出，或该策略无效——因为两条相互竞争的策略本身会就如何裁定冲突产生冲突，从而使该策略的结果不确定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/conjectureFormulaFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:conjectureFormula is functional: a conjecture names exactly one formula, so it carries a single alpha-normalized content-key of the full first-order AST — the one canonical identity under which two conjectures naming the same formula up to bound-variable renaming share a key and cannot be double-counted."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:conjectureFormula 是函数式的：一个猜想恰好指定一个公式，因此它携带完整一阶抽象语法树的唯一 alpha 规范化内容键——正是在这个唯一的规范身份下，两个在约束变量重命名意义上指代同一公式的猜想共享同一个键，不会被重复计数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/conjectureLifecycleStateFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:conjectureLifecycleState is functional: a conjecture occupies exactly one epistemic state — open, corroborated, refuted-in-standpoint, or withdrawn — at a time, a single value orthogonal to the governance logic:candidateLifecycle it inherits, so the two axes are never collapsed (Principle 9)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:conjectureLifecycleState 是函数式的：一个猜想在任一时刻恰好处于一种认识论状态——open、corroborated、refuted-in-standpoint 或 withdrawn——这是一个与其继承的治理性 logic:candidateLifecycle 正交的单一值，因此这两条轴线绝不会被混为一谈（原则 9）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/conjectureStandpointFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:conjectureStandpoint is functional: a conjecture's verdict is scoped to exactly one reified standpoint, so it names a single gmeow:Standpoint IRI — the verdict is 'refuted FROM THIS standpoint', never a global-false claim (Principle 9), and a conjecture with no single standpoint has an ill-scoped verdict and is a hard governance error."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:conjectureStandpoint 是函数式的：一个猜想的裁定被限定于恰好一个具体化的立场，因此它指定唯一一个 gmeow:Standpoint IRI——该裁定是「从这一立场而言被反驳」，绝非全局性的虚假主张（原则 9），若一个猜想没有唯一的立场，其裁定就是范围不当的，构成严重的治理错误。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/connectionSourceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:connectionSource is functional: a reified Connection has exactly one source endpoint, so a link departing from several things is several Connections rather than one Connection with many sources."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:connectionSource 是函数式的：一个具体化的 Connection 恰好有一个源端点，因此从多个事物出发的链接是多个 Connection，而不是一个具有多个来源的 Connection。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/connectionTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:connectionTarget is functional: a reified Connection has exactly one target endpoint, so a link arriving at several things is several Connections rather than one Connection with many targets."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:connectionTarget 是函数式的：一个具体化的 Connection 恰好有一个目标端点，因此到达多个事物的链接是多个 Connection，而不是一个具有多个目标的 Connection。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/consequentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:consequent is functional: a material-implication formula has exactly one consequent — a single conclusion formula — which, paired with the single logic:antecedent, marks the node an ordered implication distinct from the commutative logic:iff."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:consequent 是函数式的：一个实质蕴涵公式恰好有一个后件——唯一一个结论公式——它与唯一的 logic:antecedent 配对，将该节点标记为一个有序蕴涵，不同于可交换的 logic:iff。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/constraintAppliesToFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:constraintAppliesTo is functional: a TraversalConstraint applies to exactly one work, expression, or performance, so the entity it constrains is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:constraintAppliesTo 是函数式的：一个 TraversalConstraint 恰好适用于一个作品、表达或表演，因此它所约束的实体是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/constraintLogicFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:constraintLogic is functional: a logical constraint combines its members under exactly one boolean operator — AND, OR, XONE, or ordered AND-sequence — because a single member set folded under two different operators would yield two incompatible truth conditions for the one constraint."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:constraintLogic 是函数式的：一个逻辑约束在恰好一个布尔运算符下组合其成员——AND、OR、XONE 或有序 AND 序列——因为同一个成员集合若在两个不同运算符下折叠，会为同一约束产生两组不相容的真值条件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/constraintOperatorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:constraintOperator is functional: an atomic constraint is a single leftOperand-operator-rightOperand comparison, so it applies exactly one operator between its two operands; a second operator would make it two comparisons rather than one atom, which is properly modelled as a gmeow:LogicalConstraint over several members."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:constraintOperator 是函数式的：一个原子约束是唯一一个 leftOperand-operator-rightOperand 比较，因此它在其两个操作数之间恰好应用一个运算符；第二个运算符会使其变成两个比较而非一个原子，这种情况应恰当地建模为一个覆盖多个成员的 gmeow:LogicalConstraint。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/containmentChildFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:containmentChild is functional: a containment tenure records the nesting of exactly one contained place within a parent, so the child place is uniquely determined by the tenure and several children mean several tenures."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:containmentChild 是函数式的：一个包含存续期恰好记录一个被包含地点在父地点内的嵌套关系，因此子地点由该存续期唯一确定，多个子地点意味着多个存续期。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/containmentParentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:containmentParent is functional: a single containment tenure fixes one containing place, and disputed parallel parents are modelled as separate standpoint-indexed tenures rather than multiple parents on one (Principle 9)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:containmentParent 是函数式的：单一个包含存续期确定一个包含地点，存在争议的平行父地点被建模为按立场索引的各自独立的存续期，而不是同一存续期上的多个父地点（原则 9）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/contractAddressFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:contractAddress is functional: a smart contract lives at one deployment location on its chain, so the on-chain address at which its program is invoked is a single value, unambiguous only together with its chain id."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:contractAddress 是函数式的：一个智能合约在其所在链上恰好位于一个部署位置，因此其程序被调用所依据的链上地址是一个单一值，只有与其链标识符一起时才不含糊。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/contradictionKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:contradictionKind is functional: a contradiction carries one flavour of conflict — factual, temporal, numeric, or framing — so a genuinely multi-flavour conflict is split into separate Contradiction individuals rather than stacking several kinds on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:contradictionKind 是函数式的：一个矛盾携带一种冲突类型——factual、temporal、numeric 或 framing——因此真正跨多种类型的冲突被拆分为各自独立的 Contradiction 个体，而不是在同一个体上叠加多种类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/contributionDegreeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:contributionDegree is functional: a contribution carries at most one degree weight — lead, equal, or supporting — so the relator takes a single degree (or none when unknown) and disputed credit orderings live on the statement layer rather than as rival degrees on one Contribution."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:contributionDegree 是函数式的：一份贡献至多携带一个程度权重——lead、equal 或 supporting——因此关系体取唯一一个程度（未知时则不取），存在争议的贡献排序存在于陈述层面，而不是作为同一 Contribution 上相互竞争的多个程度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/contributionRoleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:contributionRole is functional: a Contribution relator names the one role the contributor played, so an agent acting in two roles is recorded as two Contributions rather than one relator bearing several roles."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:contributionRole 是函数性的：一个 Contribution 关系体指明贡献者所扮演的唯一角色，因此以两种角色行事的主体会被记录为两个 Contribution，而不是一个关系体承载多个角色。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/contributionTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:contributionTarget is functional: a Contribution relator credits exactly one WEMI entity at the tier that matches the credit, so a credit spanning two works is recorded as two Contributions rather than one relator pointing at several targets."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:contributionTarget 是函数性的：一个 Contribution 关系体在与该贡献相匹配的层级上仅归功于一个 WEMI 实体，因此涉及两部作品的贡献会被记录为两个 Contribution，而不是一个关系体指向多个目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/contributorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:contributor is functional: a Contribution relator names the single agent who contributed, so co-contributors each get their own Contribution rather than several agents being stacked on one relator role."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:contributor 是函数性的：一个 Contribution 关系体指明唯一做出贡献的主体，因此每个共同贡献者都拥有各自的 Contribution，而不是将多个主体堆叠在同一个关系体角色上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/controlPointOfTrajectoryFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:controlPointOfTrajectory is functional: a PitchTrajectoryControlPoint belongs to exactly one PitchTrajectory, so its owning trajectory is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:controlPointOfTrajectory 是函数性的：一个 PitchTrajectoryControlPoint 恰好属于一个 PitchTrajectory，因此其所属轨迹是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/controlPointOrderFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:controlPointOrder is functional: a control point occupies exactly one zero-based ordinal position within its PitchTrajectory, so its order index is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:controlPointOrder 是函数性的：一个控制点在其 PitchTrajectory 中恰好占据一个从零开始的序数位置，因此其顺序索引是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/controlPointPitchFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:controlPointPitch is functional: a control point carries exactly one frame-relative PitchValue, so the pitch it fixes is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:controlPointPitch 是函数性的：一个控制点恰好携带一个相对于参照系的 PitchValue，因此其所固定的音高是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/controlPointTimeFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:controlPointTimeFrame is functional: a control point's time position is expressed in exactly one MusicalTimeFrame, so the time frame it is read against is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:controlPointTimeFrame 是函数性的：控制点的时间位置恰好在一个 MusicalTimeFrame 中表达，因此据以读取该位置的时间参照系是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/controlPointTimePositionDenominatorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:controlPointTimePositionDenominator is functional: the rational time position of a control point has exactly one denominator, so this component of its position is single-valued per control point."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:controlPointTimePositionDenominator 是函数性的：控制点的有理时间位置恰好有一个分母，因此每个控制点该位置分量是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/controlPointTimePositionNumeratorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:controlPointTimePositionNumerator is functional: the rational time position of a control point has exactly one numerator, so this component of its position is single-valued per control point."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:controlPointTimePositionNumerator 是函数性的：控制点的有理时间位置恰好有一个分子，因此每个控制点该位置分量是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/coordinateFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:coordinateFrame is functional: a SpatialCoordinates value has meaning only relative to the single reference frame it is stated in, so exactly one frame expresses it and coordinates in another frame are a different value (Principle 11)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:coordinateFrame 是函数性的：一个 SpatialCoordinates 值只有相对于其所陈述的单一参照系才有意义，因此恰好有一个参照系表达它，在另一参照系中的坐标则是不同的值（原则 11）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/coordinateMatrixFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:coordinateMatrixFrame is functional: a coordinate matrix is expressed in exactly one reference frame, frame transformation being a solver concern rather than a second asserted frame on the same matrix."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:coordinateMatrixFrame 是函数性的：一个坐标矩阵恰好在一个参照系中表达，参照系变换是求解器关注的事项，而不是在同一矩阵上断言第二个参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/copyrightNoticeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:copyrightNotice is functional: a copyright relator carries one canonical ready-to-display © notice string, since a single Copyright about one work, holder, and year has exactly one formatted human-readable notice; two divergent notice lines on the same relator would present contradictory copyright claims."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:copyrightNotice 是函数性的：一个版权关系体携带一条可直接显示的规范 © 声明字符串，因为针对某一作品、某一权利人和某一年份的单个 Copyright 只有一条格式化的可读声明；同一关系体上两条不同的声明行会呈现相互矛盾的版权主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/copyrightStatusFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:copyrightStatus is functional: a work stands in exactly one copyright condition at a time — in-copyright, public-domain, no-known-copyright, or not-evaluated — because these RightsStatements.org / PREMIS states are mutually exclusive and a work cannot be both protected and free of copyright at once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:copyrightStatus 是函数性的：一部作品在同一时刻恰好处于一种版权状态——受版权保护、公有领域、无已知版权或未评估——因为这些 RightsStatements.org / PREMIS 状态是互斥的，一部作品不可能同时既受保护又不受版权约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/copyrightWorkFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:copyrightWork is functional: a copyright relator reifies the protection of a single work, so it points at exactly one information object; a second protected work is modelled as its own gmeow:Copyright relator rather than as a second work bound to the same one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:copyrightWork 是函数性的：一个版权关系体将单一作品的保护具象化，因此它恰好指向一个信息对象；第二部受保护的作品应建模为其自身的 gmeow:Copyright 关系体，而不是绑定到同一关系体上的第二部作品。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/copyrightYearFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:copyrightYear is functional: a copyright relator records the single year the copyright was asserted, since one Copyright is about one work and its assertion has one first-assertion year; a span of years across editions belongs to distinct works with their own Copyright relators, not to two years on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:copyrightYear 是函数性的：一个版权关系体记录版权主张成立的唯一年份，因为一个 Copyright 只涉及一部作品，其主张只有一个首次主张年份；跨版本的年份跨度应归属于各自拥有独立 Copyright 关系体的不同作品，而不是在同一关系体上记录两个年份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/coreAxisIndexFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:coreAxisIndex is functional: each core-affect dimension occupies exactly one fixed zero-based row/column position in the metric Gram matrix, so a second index would break the deterministic correspondence between an axis and its single coordinate in the exact-rational metric."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:coreAxisIndex 是函数性的：每个核心情感维度在度量 Gram 矩阵中恰好占据一个固定的、从零开始的行/列位置，因此第二个索引会破坏一个轴与其在精确有理度量中唯一坐标之间的确定性对应关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/correspondingSourceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:correspondingSource is functional: a gmeow:Correspondence maps exactly one source-domain element, since the source half of a mapped pair is singular and a second source element constitutes a distinct correspondence."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:correspondingSource 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:Correspondence 恰好映射一个源域元素，因为映射对中源的一半是单一的，第二个源元素构成一个不同的对应关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/correspondingTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:correspondingTarget is functional: a gmeow:Correspondence maps to exactly one target-domain element, since the target half of a mapped pair is singular just as its source is, and a second target constitutes a distinct correspondence."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:correspondingTarget 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:Correspondence 恰好映射到一个目标域元素，因为映射对中目标的一半与其源一样是单一的，第二个目标构成一个不同的对应关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/credentialIssuerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:credentialIssuer is functional: one issuing organization is constitutive of a gmeow:Credential's identity, so a different issuer yields a different credential even for the same subject matter."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:credentialIssuer 是函数性的：唯一的颁发机构构成 gmeow:Credential 身份的组成部分，因此即便针对同一主题，不同的颁发机构也会产生不同的凭证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/currencyCodeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:currencyCode is functional: a currency reference frame has one canonical short code — the ISO 4217 alphabetic code for fiat or the conventional ticker for crypto — so a single code uniquely designates the frame."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:currencyCode 是函数性的：一个货币参照系拥有一个规范的简短代码——对于法定货币是 ISO 4217 字母代码，对于加密货币是通用的代码符号——因此单一代码唯一地标识该参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/currencyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:currency is functional: a gmeow:MonetaryAmount is expressed in exactly one currency reference frame — a single amount is denominated in one currency, the same value in another currency being a distinct amount."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:currency 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:MonetaryAmount 恰好以一个货币参照系表达——单一金额以一种货币计价，同一数值以另一种货币表示则构成不同的金额。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/decidedLabelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:decidedLabel is functional: a single-label argmax decision yields exactly one categorical winner — the mode over a mutually-exclusive partition — so a decision carrying two decided labels is not a single-label decision at all."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:decidedLabel 是函数性的：单标签 argmax 决策恰好产生一个类别获胜者——即在互斥划分上的众数——因此携带两个已决定标签的决策根本就不是单标签决策。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/decisionConstraintFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:decisionConstraint is functional: a PerformanceDecision satisfies the rules of exactly one TraversalConstraint, so the constraint it answers is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:decisionConstraint 是函数性的：一个 PerformanceDecision 恰好满足一个 TraversalConstraint 的规则，因此其所响应的约束是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/decisionCrossedThresholdFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:decisionCrossedThreshold is functional: a decision records exactly one boolean verdict on whether its argmax cleared the claim threshold, so two verdicts on the same decision would be contradictory rather than additional readings."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:decisionCrossedThreshold 是函数性的：一个决策恰好记录一个布尔判定，说明其 argmax 是否越过了主张阈值，因此同一决策上的两个判定将是相互矛盾的，而不是额外的读数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/decisionMarginFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:decisionMargin is functional: a decision has at most one top1−top2 score gap — the single derived confidence of its one argmax call — so it never carries more than one margin (and none at all when a lone top-1 score leaves no runner-up to subtract)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:decisionMargin 是函数性的：一个决策至多有一个 top1−top2 得分差——即其唯一一次 argmax 调用所导出的唯一置信度——因此它绝不会携带一个以上的边际值（当仅有一个 top-1 分数、没有次名可供相减时，则完全没有边际值）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/decisionPerformanceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:decisionPerformance is functional: a PerformanceDecision is made within exactly one performance event, so the performance in which it occurred is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:decisionPerformance 是函数性的：一个 PerformanceDecision 恰好在一个演出事件中作出，因此其发生所在的演出是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/decisionSequenceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:decisionSequence is functional: a PerformanceDecision records exactly one chosen fragment-traversal order for one performance, so its sequence record is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:decisionSequence 是函数性的：一个 PerformanceDecision 恰好为一场演出记录一个所选的片段遍历顺序，因此其序列记录是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/degreeCountFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:degreeCount is functional: a TuningSystem has exactly one count of pitch degrees available per period, so its degree count is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:degreeCount 是函数性的：一个 TuningSystem 每个周期恰好有一个可用音高级数的数目，因此其级数是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/demonstratedByCompetencyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:demonstratedByCompetency is functional: a gmeow:FlagshipScenario is pinned by exactly one competency question — the single gmeow:CompetencyQuestion IRI whose gmeow:cqExpectRow expectation the native flagship cross-check confirms for that scenario."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:demonstratedByCompetency 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:FlagshipScenario 恰好由一个能力问题固定——即原生旗舰交叉核查为该场景确认其 gmeow:cqExpectRow 预期的唯一 gmeow:CompetencyQuestion IRI。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/demonstratedByExampleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:demonstratedByExample is functional: a gmeow:FlagshipScenario is realized by exactly one worked example — a single slice-relative *.ttl path the discharge harness validates clean, never more than one per scenario."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:demonstratedByExample 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:FlagshipScenario 恰好由一个已完成示例来实现——即由履行测试框架验证为干净无误的单一 slice 相对 *.ttl 路径，每个场景绝不超过一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/demonstratedByProducerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:demonstratedByProducer is functional: a gmeow:FlagshipScenario names exactly one native producer entrypoint — the single path-like identifier the execution-discharge harness dispatches, runs, and pins the output of to discharge the acceptance bar."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:demonstratedByProducer 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:FlagshipScenario 恰好指明一个原生生产者入口点——即执行履行测试框架所调度、运行并固定其输出以满足验收门槛的唯一路径式标识符。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/deonticModalityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:deonticModality is functional: a norm carries exactly one deontic force, since a prescription that both permits and obliges is two distinct norms rather than one norm bearing two modalities."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:deonticModality 是函数性的：一条规范恰好携带一种道义力，因为既允许又强制的规定其实是两条不同的规范，而不是一条规范承载两种情态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/depictionContextFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:depictionContext is functional: a gmeow:DepictionUsage relator records exactly one context — the single work, family, childhood, portrait, or candid setting in which the image depicts its subject."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:depictionContext 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:DepictionUsage 关系体恰好记录一个语境——即图像描绘其主体所处的作品、家庭、童年、肖像或抓拍等唯一场景。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/depictionImageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:depictionImage is functional: a gmeow:DepictionUsage relator binds exactly one image — the single gmeow:MediaObject that depicts the subject in that reified depiction."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:depictionImage 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:DepictionUsage 关系体恰好绑定一张图像——即在该具象化描绘中描绘主体的唯一 gmeow:MediaObject。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/depictionSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:depictionSubject is functional: a gmeow:DepictionUsage relator names exactly one depicted entity — the single subject shown in that reified depiction."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:depictionSubject 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:DepictionUsage 关系体恰好指明一个被描绘的实体——即在该具象化描绘中呈现的唯一主体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/deploymentArtifactFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:deploymentArtifact is functional: a model deployment realizes exactly one served model artifact, the single WHAT at which the execution → deployment → artifact de-conflation join bottoms out."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:deploymentArtifact 是函数性的：一次模型部署恰好实现一个所服务的模型工件——即执行→部署→工件去合流连接最终归结到的唯一「是什么」。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/deploymentHostFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:deploymentHost is functional: a model deployment serves on exactly one host or runtime entity, the single placement facet — a region, a cluster, or a device — that the deployment binds."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:deploymentHost 是函数性的：一次模型部署恰好在一个宿主或运行时实体上提供服务——即该部署所绑定的唯一部署位置面（区域、集群或设备）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/deploymentServiceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:deploymentService is functional: a model deployment presents exactly one acting service agent, the single gmeow:SoftwareAgent identity that acts and bears the serving-mode awareness tenure."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:deploymentService 是函数性的：一次模型部署恰好呈现一个行动服务主体——即执行行动并承载服务模式认知任期的唯一 gmeow:SoftwareAgent 身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/derivationProductFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:derivationProduct is functional: a CreativeDerivation relator names the one product work that resulted, at the honest tier, so it carries a single derived work rather than several products on one derivation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:derivationProduct 是函数性的：一个 CreativeDerivation 关系体在诚实层级上指明由此产生的唯一产物作品，因此它只携带一部衍生作品，而不是在一次派生上承载多个产物。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/derivationSourceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:derivationSource is functional: a CreativeDerivation relator names the one source work the product was derived from, so a mashup of two sources is recorded as two derivations or segment pins rather than several sources on one relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:derivationSource 是函数性的：一个 CreativeDerivation 关系体指明产物所派生自的唯一源作品，因此融合两个来源的混编作品应记录为两次派生或片段定位，而不是在一个关系体上列出多个来源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/derivationTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:derivationTarget is functional: an etymological derivation names exactly one descendant lexical item or form, the single target derived from the etymon."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:derivationTarget 是函数性的：一个词源派生恰好指明一个后代词项或词形——即从该词源派生出的唯一目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/describesModelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:describesModel is functional: a model card documents exactly one model agent, so the description-to-model link resolves to a single gmeow:SoftwareAgent and two documented agents demand two cards rather than a second target on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:describesModel 是函数性的：一份模型卡恰好记录一个模型主体，因此描述与模型之间的链接归结为唯一一个 gmeow:SoftwareAgent，两个被记录的主体需要两份模型卡，而不是在一份卡上设置第二个目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/determinacyModelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:determinacyModel is functional: a reference frame carries a single frame-level default determinacy model, with per-value overrides riding on gmeow:hasDeterminacy, so exactly one default determinacy attaches to the frame."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:determinacyModel 是函数性的：一个参照系恰好携带一个帧级默认确定性模型，逐值的覆盖则通过 gmeow:hasDeterminacy 承载，因此恰好有一个默认确定性附着于该参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/diffFromFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:diffFrom is functional: a diff has exactly one base commit — the single 'before' state it measures the change away from."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:diffFrom 是函数性的：一个 diff 恰好有一个基准提交——即它据以衡量变化起点的唯一「之前」状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/diffToFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:diffTo is functional: a diff has exactly one target commit — the single 'after' state it measures the change toward."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:diffTo 是函数性的：一个 diff 恰好有一个目标提交——即它据以衡量变化终点的唯一「之后」状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/dimensionCountFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:dimensionCount is functional: a reference frame spans a single, well-defined number of dimensions, so the count is a unique non-negative integer property of the frame."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:dimensionCount 是函数性的：一个参照系跨越单一且明确定义的维度数，因此该数目是该参照系唯一的非负整数属性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/dimensionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:dimension is functional: a gmeow:Magnitude is a magnitude of exactly one generic quality — a single frame-independent quality kind such as pressure, length, or mass."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:dimension 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:Magnitude 恰好是某一种通用性质的量值——即诸如压力、长度或质量之类的独立于参照系的唯一性质种类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/discourseTimeOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:discourseTimeOf is functional: a discourse-time frame coordinatizes the telling order of exactly one creative work, and a re-segmenting edition or translation owns its own discourse frame rather than sharing this one — one frame, one telling."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:discourseTimeOf 是函数性的：一个话语时间参照系恰好为一部创作作品的叙述顺序建立坐标，而重新分段的版本或译本拥有各自独立的话语参照系，而不是共用这一个——一个参照系对应一次叙述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/distanceMetricFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:distanceMetric is functional: an embedding or index is meaningful under exactly one similarity/distance function, because cosine and euclidean disagree about what counts as 'near', so a carrier commits to a single metric rather than blending incomparable notions of nearness."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:distanceMetric 是函数性的：一个嵌入或索引仅在恰好一种相似度/距离函数下才有意义，因为余弦与欧几里得对何为「相近」意见不一，因此一个载体只能采用单一度量，而不是混合不可比较的相近概念。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/dividedIntervalDenominatorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:dividedIntervalDenominator is functional: the interval that an equal-division tuning divides has exactly one denominator, so this component of the divided interval is single-valued per tuning system."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:dividedIntervalDenominator 是函数性的：等分调律所划分的音程恰好有一个分母，因此每个调律系统中该被划分音程的这一分量是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/dividedIntervalNumeratorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:dividedIntervalNumerator is functional: the interval that an equal-division tuning divides has exactly one numerator, so this component of the divided interval is single-valued per tuning system."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:dividedIntervalNumerator 是函数性的：等分调律所划分的音程恰好有一个分子，因此每个调律系统中该被划分音程的这一分量是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/divisionCountFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:divisionCount is functional: an equal-division tuning makes exactly one count of equal divisions of its period, so its division count is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:divisionCount 是函数性的：一个等分调律恰好确定其周期的一个等分数目，因此其分割数是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/dofExpressionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:dofExpression is functional: a DegreeOfFreedom relator declares the parameter determination of at most one Expression, so the expression it scopes is single-valued (exactly one of dofWork or dofExpression holds per relator)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:dofExpression 是函数性的：一个 DegreeOfFreedom 关系体最多声明一个 Expression 的参数确定性，因此其所限定的 Expression 是单值的（每个关系体恰好满足 dofWork 或 dofExpression 二者之一）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/dofParameterFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:dofParameter is functional: a DegreeOfFreedom declares the determination status of exactly one musical parameter (pitch, duration, order, tempo, dynamics, timbre, etc.), so the parameter it scopes is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:dofParameter 是函数性的：一个 DegreeOfFreedom 恰好声明一个音乐参数（音高、时值、顺序、速度、力度、音色等）的确定状态，因此其所限定的参数是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/dofStatusFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:dofStatus is functional: a DegreeOfFreedom relator carries exactly one determination status for its parameter, so its status is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:dofStatus 是函数性的：一个 DegreeOfFreedom 关系体恰好为其参数携带一个确定状态，因此其状态是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/dofWorkFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:dofWork is functional: a DegreeOfFreedom relator declares the parameter determination of at most one Work, so the work it scopes is single-valued (exactly one of dofWork or dofExpression holds per relator, Principle 4)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:dofWork 是函数性的：一个 DegreeOfFreedom 关系体最多声明一个 Work 的参数确定性，因此其所限定的作品是单值的（每个关系体恰好满足 dofWork 或 dofExpression 二者之一，原则 4）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/domainPartFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:domainPart is functional: an email address parses to a single domain part after the @, so the component that reveals the provider and underlies the personal-domain role is one value derived deterministically from the address's addr-spec."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:domainPart 是函数性的：一个电子邮件地址在 @ 之后恰好解析出一个域名部分，因此揭示服务提供方并支撑个人域名角色的这一组成部分，是从地址的 addr-spec 中确定性推导出的单一值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/doxasticClaimFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:doxasticClaim is functional: one gmeow:DoxasticState carries its qualitative belief value through exactly one gmeow:StandpointClaim — the single bridge whose claimModality supplies the state's modality without domain-clashing claimModality onto DoxasticState."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:doxasticClaim 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:DoxasticState 恰好通过一个 gmeow:StandpointClaim 承载其定性信念值——即由其 claimModality 提供该状态情态的唯一桥梁，从而避免 claimModality 与 DoxasticState 发生域冲突。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/doxasticContentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:doxasticContent is functional: one gmeow:DoxasticState is constitutively directed at exactly one gmeow:Proposition — the single truth-apt content the believing mode is about, so a state directed at two propositions would be two distinct believings."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:doxasticContent 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:DoxasticState 在构成上恰好指向一个 gmeow:Proposition——即该信念模式所关涉的唯一可真可假的内容，因此指向两个命题的状态将是两个不同的信念。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/durationValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:durationValue is functional: a gmeow:Duration has exactly one length expressed as an xsd:duration literal, of which the TEO normalized-duration string is a projection."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:durationValue 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:Duration 恰好有一个以 xsd:duration 字面量表达的长度，TEO 规范化时长字符串是其投影。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/duringIntervalFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:duringInterval is functional: a gmeow:TimeScopedRelation is delimited by exactly one gmeow:TimeInterval, since a relation true across two disjoint spans is two distinct scoped situations rather than one situation bearing two scopes."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:duringInterval 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:TimeScopedRelation 恰好由一个 gmeow:TimeInterval 限定，因为一个在两个互不相交的时间段上都成立的关系是两个不同的限定情境，而不是一个情境承载两个限定范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/edtfValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:edtfValue is functional: an instant or interval has at most one EDTF expression of its own value, since a second EDTF string would state a competing value for the same point rather than an alternate label for it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:edtfValue 是函数性的：一个瞬间或区间至多有一个表达其自身值的 EDTF 表达式，因为第二个 EDTF 字符串会为同一点陈述一个相互竞争的值，而不是为其提供一个替代标签。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/effectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:effect is functional: an action schema introduces exactly one effect — the single ins/del supersession change executing an occurrence records — with alternative results carried instead by the multi-valued logic:nondeterministicOutcome, so the deterministic change stays one edge while nondeterminism lives on a different facet."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:effect 是函数性的：一个动作模式恰好引入一个效果——即执行一次发生所记录的唯一 ins/del 替换变化——而其他可能结果则由多值的 logic:nondeterministicOutcome 承载，因此确定性变化始终是单一条边，非确定性则存在于另一个方面。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/effectiveOfFamilyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:effectiveOfFamily is functional: an effective vector space is a space of exactly one embedding family, so its identity digest folds in exactly one family digest and a prefix space resolves to the single stored matrix it shares; two families would be two distinct effective spaces, never one contract bound to both."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:effectiveOfFamily 是函数性的：一个有效向量空间恰好是一个嵌入族的空间，因此其身份摘要恰好折叠进一个族摘要，一个前缀空间会归结为其共享的唯一存储矩阵；两个族将构成两个不同的有效空间，绝不会是一个契约同时绑定两者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/embeddingModelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:embeddingModel is functional: an embedding is produced by exactly one model agent, since two models' embeddings of the same chunk are two distinct Embedding individuals rather than one embedding crediting two models (P9 attribution)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:embeddingModel 是函数性的：一个嵌入恰好由一个模型主体生成，因为两个模型对同一分块生成的嵌入是两个不同的 Embedding 个体，而不是一个嵌入同时归功于两个模型（P9 归属）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/embeddingOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:embeddingOf is functional: an embedding represents exactly one information object under one model, so a single vector is never made to stand for two different objects."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:embeddingOf 是函数性的：一个嵌入在一个模型下恰好表示一个信息对象，因此单一向量绝不会被用来代表两个不同的对象。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/emotionBearerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:emotionBearer is functional: an emotion is an intrinsic affective mode that inheres in exactly one agent (the intentBearer pattern), so it cannot be borne by two — a second agent's feeling is a numerically distinct mode, not another bearer of this one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:emotionBearer 是函数性的：一种情感是一种恰好内在于一个主体的内禀情感样态（intentBearer 模式），因此不能由两个主体承载——另一个主体的感受是一个在数量上不同的样态，而不是这一样态的另一个承载者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/employmentOccupationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:employmentOccupation is functional: an employment maps to exactly one canonical occupation, so an agent holding several occupations is recorded as several employment records rather than one employment carrying many occupations."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:employmentOccupation 是函数性的：一份雇佣关系恰好对应一个规范职业，因此从事多种职业的主体会被记录为多条雇佣记录，而不是一条雇佣记录承载多个职业。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/employmentRoleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:employmentRole is functional: an employment bears exactly one canonical role at a time, so a change of role is a new employment record or a standpoint-indexed claim rather than a second concurrent role on the same employment."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:employmentRole 是函数性的：一份雇佣关系在同一时刻恰好承载一个规范角色，因此角色变更应记录为一条新的雇佣记录或按视角索引的主张，而不是在同一雇佣关系上并存第二个角色。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/employmentSeniorityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:employmentSeniority is functional: an employment has exactly one canonical seniority level at a time, so a promotion is a new employment record or a standpoint-indexed claim rather than two simultaneous ranks on one employment."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:employmentSeniority 是函数性的：一份雇佣关系在同一时刻恰好拥有一个规范资历级别，因此晋升应记录为一条新的雇佣记录或按视角索引的主张，而不是在同一雇佣关系上并存两个级别。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/employmentTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:employmentType is functional: an employment has exactly one canonical type at a time, so a change of type is a new employment record rather than one employment that is both full-time and contract at once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:employmentType 是函数性的：一份雇佣关系在同一时刻恰好拥有一个规范类型，因此类型变更应记录为一条新的雇佣记录，而不是让同一份雇佣关系同时既是全职又是合同制。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/endedAtTimeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:endedAtTime is functional: a gmeow:TimeInterval closes at a single instant, since two distinct end timestamps would describe two different intervals and an open interval omits the value entirely rather than carrying several."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:endedAtTime 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:TimeInterval 恰好在一个瞬间结束，因为两个不同的结束时间戳将描述两个不同的区间，而一个开放区间是完全省略该值，而不是携带多个值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/environmentAtLocationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:environmentAtLocation is functional: a sensory environment concerns exactly one location, which is constitutive of its identity as the ambient conditions of that place."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:environmentAtLocation 是函数性的：一个感官环境恰好关涉一个地点，而这正构成了其作为该地点周遭条件的身份要素。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/epistemicAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:epistemicAgent is functional: one gmeow:DoxasticState constitutively inheres in exactly one gmeow:Agent — the single believer whose believing mode it is, since a mental moment inheres in one bearer and cannot be shared across agents."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:epistemicAgent 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:DoxasticState 在构成上恰好内在于一个 gmeow:Agent ——即该信念模式所属的唯一信念持有者，因为一个心理时刻内在于单一承载者，无法在多个主体之间共享。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/etymonSourceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:etymonSource is functional: an etymological derivation names exactly one ancestor lexical item or form (the etymon), a multi-source etymology being modeled as several derivations rather than one relator carrying many sources."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:etymonSource 是函数性的：一个词源推导恰好指名一个祖先词汇项或词形（即词源），多来源的词源被建模为多个推导，而不是由一个关系体承载多个来源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/evaluatedConditionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:evaluatedCondition is functional: a condition evaluation reports on exactly one condition, its single observed feature, and the members of a condition group each receive their own evaluation rather than sharing one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:evaluatedCondition 是函数性的：一次条件评估恰好针对一个条件，即其唯一被观察的特征，条件组中的每个成员各自获得自己的评估，而不是共享同一个评估。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/evaluatesArgumentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:evaluatesArgument is functional: a gmeow:ArgumentEvaluation assesses exactly one gmeow:Argument under one semantics, since evaluating a second argument, or the same argument in another extension, is a separate evaluation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:evaluatesArgument 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:ArgumentEvaluation 在一种语义下恰好评估一个 gmeow:Argument，因为评估第二个论证，或在另一扩展中评估同一论证，都属于另一次独立的评估。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/evaluatesFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:evaluates is functional: one gmeow:ClaimEvaluation assesses exactly one target gmeow:ClaimToken — the single assertion act it judges under its context — even though that one token may in turn be assessed by many coexisting evaluations."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:evaluates 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:ClaimEvaluation 恰好评估一个目标 gmeow:ClaimToken ——即它在其语境下所判定的唯一断言行为——尽管该同一令牌反过来可能被许多并存的评估所评估。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/evaluationModeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:evaluationMode is functional: a reasoning program selects exactly one logic:EvaluationMode strategy to resolve its clause set, never a mix — one procedure resolves the same authored clauses, and an unrecognized mode is a hard compile-time fail rather than a silent fallback."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:evaluationMode 是函数性的：一个推理程序恰好选择一种 logic:EvaluationMode 策略来求解其子句集，绝不混用——同一套已编写的子句由单一过程求解，无法识别的模式会导致编译期的硬失败，而不是静默回退。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/evaluationVerdictFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:evaluationVerdict is functional: an evaluation returns exactly one outcome — held, not held, or undetermined — and a differing verdict from another evaluator is a separate coexisting observation, not a second value on this evaluation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:evaluationVerdict 是函数性的：一次评估恰好返回一个结果——成立、不成立或未决——另一评估者给出的不同裁定属于另一并存的独立观察，而不是本次评估上的第二个值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/eventTemporalFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:eventTemporalFrame is functional: a gmeow:Event's date or interval is expressed in exactly one temporal frame (Principle 11), a single reference frame that disambiguates the event's timing."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:eventTemporalFrame 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:Event 的日期或区间恰好以一个时间参照系表达（原则 11），即消除该事件时间歧义的单一参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/eventTimeZoneFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:eventTimeZone is functional: an event's temporal placement is expressed in exactly one time zone — the single civil offset its wall-clock time is read in, overriding the calendar default."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:eventTimeZone 是函数性的：一个事件的时间定位恰好以一个时区表达——即其挂钟时间据以读取的唯一民用偏移量，覆盖日历的默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/exceptionOriginalDateFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:exceptionOriginalDate is functional: a schedule exception overrides exactly one generated occurrence, pinned by the single original date/time the recurrence rule would have produced — its RFC 5545 RECURRENCE-ID anchor."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:exceptionOriginalDate 是函数性的：一个日程例外恰好覆盖一个生成的发生实例，由该重复规则本应生成的唯一原始日期/时间锚定——即其 RFC 5545 RECURRENCE-ID 锚点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/exceptionReplacementEventFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:exceptionReplacementEvent is functional: a rescheduled occurrence moves to exactly one replacement event — the single new placement standing in for the one at the original date (absent entirely for a pure cancellation)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:exceptionReplacementEvent 是函数性的：一个被改期的发生实例恰好迁移到一个替代事件——即替代原日期那一次发生的唯一新安排（在纯粹取消的情况下则完全缺失）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/exceptionScheduleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:exceptionSchedule is functional: a schedule exception applies to exactly one event schedule — the single recurring series whose one occurrence it overrides."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:exceptionSchedule 是函数性的：一个日程例外恰好适用于一个事件日程——即它所覆盖的那一次发生所属的唯一重复系列。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/exceptionTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:exceptionType is functional: a schedule exception is exactly one kind — either a cancellation or a rescheduling of its occurrence, never both at once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:exceptionType 是函数性的：一个日程例外恰好属于一种类型——要么是取消，要么是对其发生实例的改期，绝不能两者兼具。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/exemplarPolarityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:exemplarPolarity is functional: an exemplar points in exactly one direction — positive, negative, or cautionary — because an exemplar that could not say whether to emulate or avoid would collapse back into a bare citation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:exemplarPolarity 是函数性的：一个范例恰好指向一个方向——正面、负面或警示性——因为一个无法说明应效仿还是应避免的范例，将退化为一条单纯的引用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/exemptionDateFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:exemptionDate is functional: each gmeow:AxisExemption was minted on exactly one date, so a second date would make the exemption's audit age — by which long-standing gaps are surfaced — ambiguous."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:exemptionDate 是函数性的：每个 gmeow:AxisExemption 恰好在一个日期被铸造，若存在第二个日期，该豁免用以揭示长期存在缺口的审计年限就会变得含糊不清。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/exifTagIdFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:exifTagId is functional: a gmeow:ExifTag carries exactly one tag identifier — the single machine key, such as 'FNumber' or 'ExposureTime', naming which EXIF field the record captures."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:exifTagId 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:ExifTag 恰好携带一个标签标识符——即诸如 'FNumber' 或 'ExposureTime' 这样唯一的机器键，用以指明该记录捕获的是哪个 EXIF 字段。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/exifTagValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:exifTagValue is functional: a gmeow:ExifTag holds exactly one value — the single reading, such as 'f/2.0' or 'sRGB', recorded for that one tagged field."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:exifTagValue 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:ExifTag 恰好持有一个值——即为该被标记字段记录的唯一读数，例如 'f/2.0' 或 'sRGB'。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/existenceEntityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:existenceEntity is functional: a gmeow:EntityExistence concerns exactly one entity, a binding that is constitutive of the situation's own identity, so a separate EntityExistence is minted per entity."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:existenceEntity 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:EntityExistence 恰好涉及一个实体，这一绑定构成了该情境自身身份的组成部分，因此每个实体都会铸造一个独立的 EntityExistence。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/existentialOrdinalFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:existentialOrdinal is functional: a chase-invented gmeow:InventedWitness discharges exactly one existential head-variable of its firing rule, so it carries a single 0-based ordinal that is one of the three components of its content-addressed identity."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:existentialOrdinal 是函数性的：由 chase 过程发明的 gmeow:InventedWitness 恰好消解其触发规则中的一个存在性头变量，因此它携带一个从零开始的唯一序号，这是其内容寻址身份三个组成部分之一。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/existsFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:exists is functional: an existential-quantifier formula binds exactly one body formula — the single scope the binder ranges over — while its bound variables ride on logic:quantifiedVariable, so the node pins one binder and one body, not a set of bodies."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:exists 是函数性的：一个存在量词公式恰好绑定一个主体公式——即该约束算子作用范围的唯一辖域——其约束变量则搭载于 logic:quantifiedVariable，因此该节点固定了一个约束算子和一个主体，而非一组主体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/experiencerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:experiencer is functional: a mental occurrent inheres in exactly one agent, so a gmeow:MentalProcess has a single experiencer — two agents reasoning about the same subject are two distinct processes."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:experiencer 是函数性的：一个心理发生项恰好内在于一个主体，因此一个 gmeow:MentalProcess 只有唯一的体验者——两个主体就同一话题进行推理，构成两个不同的过程。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/expressionLanguageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:expressionLanguage is functional: a condition expression is written in exactly one named language, so its verbatim source sits in a single dialect and a formalization in another language is a separate expression."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:expressionLanguage 是函数性的：一个条件表达式恰好以一种命名语言写成，因此其逐字源文本仅属于单一方言，若以另一种语言进行形式化，则构成另一个独立的表达式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/expressionTextFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:expressionText is functional: a condition expression carries exactly one verbatim source body — one expression, one string of source in its declared language."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:expressionText 是函数性的：一个条件表达式恰好携带一个逐字源文本主体——一个表达式，对应其所声明语言中的一段源字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/expressionValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:expressionValue is functional: a gmeow:GenderExpression facet asserts exactly one expression-style value — varying presentations are modelled as several facets, and this object edge is deliberately the sole path to the value."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:expressionValue 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:GenderExpression 侧面恰好断言一个表达风格值——各种不同的呈现方式被建模为多个侧面，而该对象边被刻意设计为通往该值的唯一路径。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/feasibilityStatusFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:feasibilityStatus is functional: a goal evaluation carries exactly one logic:FeasibilityStatus — the feasibility axis of the factored outcome — a single value that varies independently of the satisfaction, lifecycle, and goal-evaluation axes but is itself one-valued per evaluation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:feasibilityStatus 是函数性的：一次目标评估恰好携带一个 logic:FeasibilityStatus——即分解结果中的可行性维度——这是一个独立于满足度、生命周期与目标评估维度而变化的单一值，但就每次评估而言其自身仍是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/feedPostingKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:feedPostingKind is functional: a feed posting has exactly one kind drawn from the open gmeow:FeedPostingKind vocabulary, and that single flavour deterministically drives the schema projection — a social posting to schema:SocialMediaPosting, a blog posting to schema:BlogPosting — which two competing flavours on one posting would leave ambiguous."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:feedPostingKind 是函数性的：一条动态发布恰好具有一种取自开放词表 gmeow:FeedPostingKind 的类型，该唯一类型以确定的方式驱动模式投影——社交类发布投影到 schema:SocialMediaPosting，博客类发布投影到 schema:BlogPosting——若一条发布上存在两种相互竞争的类型，该投影就会变得含糊不清。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/filenameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:filename is functional: an Attachment is a single non-inline body part whose Content-Disposition names one file, so it bears exactly one filename."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:filename 是函数性的：一个附件是单一的非内联正文部分，其 Content-Disposition 指名一个文件，因此它恰好携带一个文件名。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/filledFromFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:filledFrom is functional: a concrete prompt instantiates a single prompt-template version, so an output traces to exactly one published template and never spreads its provenance across several template sources."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:filledFrom 是函数性的：一个具体提示词实例化单一版本的提示词模板，因此一项输出恰好可追溯到一个已发布的模板，其来源绝不会分散于多个模板源之间。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/findContextTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:findContextTarget is functional: an archaeological find context describes exactly one physical carrier, the single object whose stratigraphy, find-spot, dating, and documentation event the relator binds together."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:findContextTarget 是函数性的：一个考古发现语境恰好描述一个物理载体，即该关系体将其地层学、发现地点、断代与记录事件绑定在一起的唯一对象。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/findingCodeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:findingCode is functional: a gmeow:Finding carries exactly one stable rule identifier, serving as its SARIF ruleId and the single key by which findings are grouped and suppressed."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:findingCode 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:Finding 恰好携带一个稳定的规则标识符，作为其 SARIF ruleId，也是用于对发现项进行分组与抑制的唯一键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/findingMessageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:findingMessage is functional: a gmeow:Finding carries exactly one human-readable message describing that occurrence, distinct from its single stable code."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:findingMessage 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:Finding 恰好携带一条描述该发生实例的、人类可读的消息，它不同于其唯一的稳定代码。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/findingSeverityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:findingSeverity is functional: a gmeow:Finding has exactly one verdict grade, a single gmeow:DiagnosticSeverity that is its observation result."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:findingSeverity 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:Finding 恰好具有一个裁定等级，即作为其观察结果的唯一 gmeow:DiagnosticSeverity。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/floorAxisFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:floorAxis is functional: each gmeow:AxisFloorCommitment guards exactly one measured gmeow:QualityAxis, so a second axis would make the per-axis regression floor apply to no single measured dimension."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:floorAxis 是函数性的：每个 gmeow:AxisFloorCommitment 恰好守护一个被测量的 gmeow:QualityAxis，若存在第二个维度，该按维度设定的回归下限就无法应用于任何单一的被测维度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/floorSliceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:floorSlice is functional: each gmeow:AxisFloorCommitment or gmeow:SliceTierFloor is committed against exactly one subject slice, so a second slice would make the ratchet cell guard an ambiguous target."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:floorSlice 是函数性的：每个 gmeow:AxisFloorCommitment 或 gmeow:SliceTierFloor 恰好针对一个主题切片作出承诺，若存在第二个切片，棘轮单元所守护的目标就会变得含糊不清。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/floorTierFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:floorTier is functional: each gmeow:SliceTierFloor pins exactly one minimum roll-up rung over the lattice order, so a second tier would make the raise-only tier-regression bar ambiguous."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:floorTier 是函数性的：每个 gmeow:SliceTierFloor 在格序上恰好钉住一个最低汇总等级，若存在第二个等级，仅允许上调的等级回归门槛就会变得含糊不清。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/floorValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:floorValue is functional: each gmeow:AxisFloorCommitment pins exactly one committed minimum decimal score, so a second value would make the raise-only regression floor the gate enforces ambiguous."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:floorValue 是函数性的：每个 gmeow:AxisFloorCommitment 恰好钉住一个已承诺的最低十进制分数，若存在第二个值，该关卡所强制执行的仅允许上调的回归下限就会变得含糊不清。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/forallFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:forall is functional: a universal-quantifier formula binds exactly one body formula — the single scope the binder ranges over across individuals in the domain of discourse — while its bound variables ride on logic:quantifiedVariable, so the node pins one binder and one body."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:forall 是函数性的：一个全称量词公式恰好绑定一个主体公式——即该约束算子在话语域个体上作用范围的唯一辖域——其约束变量则搭载于 logic:quantifiedVariable，因此该节点固定了一个约束算子和一个主体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/formRepresentationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:formRepresentation is functional: a lexical form carries exactly one surface string or value, since a different representation is by definition a different form."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:formRepresentation 是函数性的：一个词汇形式恰好携带一个表层字符串或值，因为按定义，不同的表征即是不同的形式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/frameCalendarSystemFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:frameCalendarSystem is functional: a gmeow:TemporalFrame reckons its dates in at most one gmeow:CalendarSystem, since a frame that mixed Gregorian and Hebrew reckoning would be two frames rather than one (the property is optional for scale-only frames but never multi-valued)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:frameCalendarSystem 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:TemporalFrame 至多在一个 gmeow:CalendarSystem 中推算其日期，因为混用格里高利历与希伯来历推算的参照系将是两个参照系而非一个（该属性对仅有刻度的参照系而言是可选的，但绝不可多值）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/frameKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:frameKind is functional: a reference frame has one structural form — the geometric/representational shape (cartesian, cylindrical, grid, geocoding, scalar, …) that determines how its coordinates are laid out — so exactly one gmeow:FrameKind classifies it, orthogonal to and never conflated with its realm."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:frameKind 是函数性的：一个参照系具有一种结构形式——即决定其坐标如何排布的几何/表征形状（笛卡尔、柱面、网格、地理编码、标量等等）——因此恰好由一个 gmeow:FrameKind 对其分类，该分类与其所属领域正交，绝不可与之混淆。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/frameRealmFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:frameRealm is functional: a reference frame belongs to a single domain of discourse — the realm (terrestrial, celestial, currency, biological, robotic, …) that fixes what kind of value it measures or locates — so exactly one gmeow:FrameRealm applies, orthogonal to and never conflated with its structural frame kind."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:frameRealm 是函数性的：一个参照系恰好属于一个话语域——即决定其所测量或定位数值类型的领域（地面、天体、货币、生物、机器人等等）——因此恰好适用一个 gmeow:FrameRealm，该领域与其结构性参照系类型正交，绝不可与之混淆。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/frameReferencePositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:frameReferencePosition is functional: a gmeow:TemporalFrame is anchored to at most one gmeow:ReferencePosition, since a single frame cannot fix its time to two timezones or observatories at once, so a second locus makes a second frame (the property is optional for position-independent frames but never multi-valued)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:frameReferencePosition 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:TemporalFrame 至多锚定到一个 gmeow:ReferencePosition，因为单一参照系不能同时将其时间固定在两个时区或两个天文台上，若存在第二个位置就意味着第二个参照系（该属性对与位置无关的参照系而言是可选的，但绝不可多值）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/frameTimeScaleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:frameTimeScale is functional: a gmeow:TemporalFrame runs on exactly one gmeow:TimeScale, since the mandatory 'which clock' component is singular and a frame ticking on both TAI and UT1 would be two frames."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:frameTimeScale 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:TemporalFrame 恰好运行在一个 gmeow:TimeScale 上，因为必需的「哪一种时钟」这一成分是单一的，若一个参照系同时以 TAI 与 UT1 计时，那将是两个参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/freshnessHorizonFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:freshnessHorizon is functional: a freshness guard declares exactly one age ceiling — the single xsd:duration bounding how old the guarded precondition datum may be, measured from its logic:datumRecordedAt to the probe's logic:decisionTime — so the one age comparison is well-defined."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:freshnessHorizon 是函数性的：一个新鲜度守卫恰好声明一个年龄上限——即用于界定被守护前提数据可容许陈旧程度的唯一 xsd:duration，从其 logic:datumRecordedAt 量至探针的 logic:decisionTime——从而使这一年龄比较有明确定义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/freshnessWindowEndFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:freshnessWindowEnd is functional: a freshness guard's explicit valid-time window has exactly one inclusive upper bound, so it carries a single xsd:dateTime end — required exactly once when a window is declared and paired with the single logic:freshnessWindowStart to define the closed interval."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:freshnessWindowEnd 是函数性的：一个新鲜度守卫显式的有效时间窗恰好具有一个闭合的上界，因此它携带唯一一个 xsd:dateTime 终点——在声明窗口时恰好要求出现一次，并与唯一的 logic:freshnessWindowStart 配对以界定该闭区间。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/freshnessWindowStartFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:freshnessWindowStart is functional: a freshness guard's explicit valid-time window has exactly one inclusive lower bound, so it carries a single xsd:dateTime start — required exactly once when a window is declared and paired with the single logic:freshnessWindowEnd to define the closed interval."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:freshnessWindowStart 是函数性的：一个新鲜度守卫显式的有效时间窗恰好具有一个闭合的下界，因此它携带唯一一个 xsd:dateTime 起点——在声明窗口时恰好要求出现一次，并与唯一的 logic:freshnessWindowEnd 配对以界定该闭区间。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/functionSymbolFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:functionSymbol is functional: a function term applies exactly one reified function-symbol (logic:Type) individual over its ordered arguments — mirroring how logic:relation reifies a predication's single relation under the HiLog reflection — so the object level stays first-order and no function variable is admitted."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:functionSymbol 是函数性的：一个函数项恰好在其有序参数之上应用一个被具化的函数符号（logic:Type）个体——这与 logic:relation 在 HiLog 反射下将一个谓词的单一关系加以具化的方式相呼应——从而使对象层保持一阶，且不允许任何函数变量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gateVerdictFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gateVerdict is functional: a gmeow:ConsumerImprovementGate carries exactly one verdict value, since that single held-or-not verdict is what decides whether the gate authorizes activation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gateVerdict 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:ConsumerImprovementGate 恰好携带一个裁定值，正是这唯一的成立与否裁定，决定该关卡是否授权激活。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/genderValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:genderValue is functional: a gmeow:GenderIdentity facet asserts exactly one gender value — bigender or genderfluid persons are modelled as several facets, so multiplicity lives in the facet count and never in a multi-valued edge."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:genderValue 是函数性的：一个 gmeow:GenderIdentity 侧面恰好断言一个性别值——双性别或流性别者被建模为多个侧面，因此多重性体现在侧面的数量上，而绝不体现在某条多值边上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/geocodeFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:geocodeFrame is functional: a geocode is a code within one geocoding system, so it is expressed in exactly one geocoding reference frame and mixing two systems on a single Geocode is disallowed."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:geocodeFrame 是函数性的：一个地理编码是隶属于一个地理编码系统内的代码，因此它恰好以一个地理编码参照系表达，禁止在同一个 Geocode 上混用两种系统。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/geocodeValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:geocodeValue is functional: a single Geocode carries exactly one canonical code string — its literal carrier behind the per-system accessors — so distinct codes require distinct Geocode instances."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:geocodeValue 是函数性的：单个 Geocode 恰好携带一个规范代码字符串——即隐藏在各系统专属访问器背后的字面载体——因此不同的代码需要不同的 Geocode 实例。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/geohashFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:geohash is functional: a Geocode holds one geohash string, the single base32 index for its cell, so a second geohash would denote a different cell and hence a different Geocode."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:geohash 是函数性的：一个 Geocode 持有一个 geohash 字符串，即其所在单元格的唯一 base32 索引，若存在第二个 geohash，便意味着指向不同的单元格，因而也是不同的 Geocode。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/glossaryConceptFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:glossaryConcept is functional: each glossary entry's source evokes exactly one lexical concept, the single sense-aware key the term-consistency invariant groups on, so an entry resolving to two concepts could never be judged for divergent renderings."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:glossaryConcept 是函数性的：每条术语表条目的来源恰好唤起一个词汇概念，即术语一致性不变量据以分组的、唯一具有义项意识的键，因此若一条条目解析出两个概念，就永远无法就其翻译分歧作出判定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/glossaryLanguageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:glossaryLanguage is functional: a glossary renders into exactly one BCP-47 target-language tag, because French and Mandarin consistency are separate functions and each language is its own glossary rather than two tags folded onto one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:glossaryLanguage 是函数性的：一个术语表恰好渲染为一个 BCP-47 目标语言标签，因为法语一致性与普通话一致性是相互独立的功能，每种语言各自构成独立的术语表，而不是把两个标签折叠到一个上面。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/glossaryPredicateFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:glossaryPredicate is functional: each entry renders the literal of exactly one annotation predicate whose CURIE is half of the catalog msgctxt key, so two predicates on one entry would name two different catalog entries."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:glossaryPredicate 是函数性的：每条条目恰好渲染一个注释谓词的字面量，该谓词的 CURIE 构成目录 msgctxt 键的一半，因此若一条条目上有两个谓词，就会指名两条不同的目录条目。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/glossarySenseFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:glossarySense is functional: each entry carries exactly one lang:Sense — the middle corner of its OntoLex Frege triangle, minted once from the (term, source-skeleton) pair independently of target language — so a second sense would fracture the entry's single way of meaning."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:glossarySense 是函数性的：每条条目恰好携带一个 lang:Sense——即其 OntoLex 弗雷格三角的中间顶点，独立于目标语言，由（术语、源骨架）对唯一铸造一次——若存在第二个义项，就会撕裂该条目单一的表意方式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/glossarySliceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:glossarySlice is functional: a glossary gathers the terminology of exactly one slice, the single owl:Ontology whose i18n/*.po catalog it projects, so an unscoped or dual-scoped glossary would belong to no coherent catalog."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:glossarySlice 是函数性的：一个术语表恰好汇集一个切片的术语，即其所投影 i18n/*.po 目录所属的唯一 owl:Ontology，因此一个未限定范围或双重范围的术语表将不属于任何连贯的目录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/glossarySourceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:glossarySource is functional: each entry renders exactly one English source literal — the single @x-gmeow-english value the catalog msgid carries — from which the projection mints the entry's one concept."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:glossarySource 是函数性的：每条条目恰好渲染一个英文源字面量——即目录 msgid 所携带的唯一 @x-gmeow-english 值——投影正是据此铸造该条目的唯一概念。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/glossaryTermFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:glossaryTerm is functional: each entry renders the localizable literal of exactly one GMEOW term, the single term the projected catalog msgctxt names, so an entry cannot render a literal for two terms at once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:glossaryTerm 是函数性的：每条条目恰好渲染一个 GMEOW 术语的可本地化字面量，即所投影目录 msgctxt 所指名的唯一术语，因此一条条目不能同时为两个术语渲染字面量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/glossaryTranslationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:glossaryTranslation is functional: each entry binds its English source to exactly one non-fuzzy target-language msgstr, so a single entry cannot carry two competing renderings of one term — divergence between distinct entries of one concept is the gated inconsistency case, not two values on one entry."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:glossaryTranslation 是函数性的：每条条目将其英文来源恰好绑定到一个非模糊的目标语言 msgstr，因此单条条目不能承载同一术语的两种相互竞争的译法——同一概念不同条目之间的分歧，才是该关卡所把控的不一致情形，而不是一条条目上的两个值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/glossaryUnitFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:glossaryUnit is functional: each entry attaches to exactly one lang:TranslationUnit, the single law-spine carrying its logic:Correspondence and preservation judgment, so the entry reuses one honest preservation grade rather than shadowing a second."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:glossaryUnit 是函数性的：每条条目恰好附着于一个 lang:TranslationUnit，即承载其 logic:Correspondence 与保真判定的唯一法则主干，因此该条目复用同一个如实的保真等级，而不会暗中隐藏第二个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gmnArityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gmnArity is functional: an operator form or symbol candidate has exactly one non-negative operand count, so a glyph naming both unary and binary operations (notably minus) is split into distinct arity-bearing constructors rather than carrying two arities on one form."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gmnArity 是函数性的：一个算符形式或符号候选恰好具有一个非负的操作数计数，因此一个同时表示一元与二元运算的字形（尤其是负号）会被拆分为各自携带不同元数的独立构造符，而不是让一个形式携带两个元数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gmnAsciiFallbackFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gmnAsciiFallback is functional: each audited symbol has exactly one ASCII rendering, since its single pinned BPE cost is the fixed comparator a token-cost disposition measures the Unicode glyph against."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gmnAsciiFallback 是函数性的：每个被审计的符号恰好具有一个 ASCII 渲染形式，因为其唯一被钉定的 BPE 成本正是词元成本判定用以衡量该 Unicode 字形的固定比较基准。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gmnCandidateDenotationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gmnCandidateDenotation is functional: an adopted-glyph or named-key candidate points at exactly one lang:Denotation binding its form to its semantic target, so the candidate-to-sign-to-meaning chain resolves to a single denotation record."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gmnCandidateDenotation 是函数性的：一个已采纳字形或命名键候选恰好指向一个 lang:Denotation，将其形式绑定到其语义目标，因此候选-符号-意义这一链条会解析为单一的指称记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gmnCandidateGlyphFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gmnCandidateGlyph is functional: each symbol audit considers exactly one canonical NFC Unicode rendering, the single measured proposal whose BPE cost and rejection evidence must stay reproducible even when it loses."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gmnCandidateGlyph 是函数性的：每次符号审计恰好考察一个规范的 NFC Unicode 渲染形式，即那唯一被度量的提案，即便它最终落选，其 BPE 成本与驳回证据也必须保持可复现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gmnCandidateTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gmnCandidateTarget is functional: a candidate proposes to render exactly one grounding-plane term, so distinct semantic terms take separate candidates even when they propose the same visible symbol, keeping each decision record bound to a single audited meaning."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gmnCandidateTarget 是函数性的：一个候选恰好提议渲染一个落地层术语，因此即便不同的语义术语提议使用同一个可见符号，它们也各自对应独立的候选，从而使每条决策记录都绑定于单一被审计的含义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gmnDenotationGraphemeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gmnDenotationGrapheme is functional: each executable denotation binds to exactly one lang:Grapheme rendering its denoted form — the single glyph the writer and reader load — so the graph join is an unambiguous symbol binding with no hard-coded symbol table."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gmnDenotationGrapheme 是函数性的：每个可执行的指称恰好绑定到一个渲染其所指形式的 lang:Grapheme——即写入方与读取方所加载的唯一字形——因此该图连接构成一个明确无歧义的符号绑定，不依赖任何硬编码的符号表。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gmnDictionaryEntryAliasFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gmnDictionaryEntryAlias is functional: each dictionary entry mints exactly one compact alias string, the single token a conforming GMN-1 writer emits in place of the full IRI, which underpins the per-dictionary injectivity of the alias table."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gmnDictionaryEntryAlias 是函数性的：每条词典条目恰好铸造一个紧凑的别名字符串，即符合规范的 GMN-1 写入器用以取代完整 IRI 而发出的唯一词元，这正是别名表按词典单射性的基础。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gmnDictionaryEntryTermFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gmnDictionaryEntryTerm is functional: each dictionary entry aliases exactly one full GMEOW term, so the entry's alias stands for a single unambiguous IRI when a writer expands it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gmnDictionaryEntryTerm 是函数性的：每条词典条目恰好为一个完整的 GMEOW 术语设立别名，因此当写入器将其展开时，该条目的别名代表唯一且无歧义的 IRI。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gmnDispositionBasisFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gmnDispositionBasis is functional: a symbol disposition records exactly one machine-readable evidence category — token cost, ambiguity, confusability, or semantic mismatch — so the machine-auditable reason stays a single unambiguous value while the detailed argument lives in the rationale."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gmnDispositionBasis 是函数性的：一项符号判定恰好记录一个机器可读的证据类别——词元成本、歧义性、可混淆性或语义不匹配——因此该可供机器审计的理由保持为单一无歧义的值，而详细论证则存放于理由说明之中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gmnDispositionRationaleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gmnDispositionRationale is functional: each symbol ruling carries exactly one evidence-bearing explanation, the single falsifiable statement of the measured cost comparison or semantic boundary that complements its typed basis and citation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gmnDispositionRationale 是函数性的：每条符号裁决恰好携带一条承载证据的说明，即对所测量成本比较或语义边界的唯一可证伪陈述，用以补充其类型化依据与引用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gmnRingLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gmnRingLevel is functional: each GMN security ring sits at exactly one classification-level coordinate, the single lattice axis gmeow:gmnRingWithin's derivation reads, so the ring is one well-formed lattice point the lattice gate accepts."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gmnRingLevel 是函数性的：每个 GMN 安全环恰好位于一个分类级别坐标上，即 gmeow:gmnRingWithin 推导所读取的唯一格轴，因此该环是格关卡所接受的一个良构格点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gmnSpokenLabelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gmnSpokenLabel is functional: each audited symbol has exactly one spoken label, the single concise phrase a screen reader or speech interface should voice in place of an opaque codepoint name."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gmnSpokenLabel 是函数性的：每个被审计的符号恰好具有一个语音标签，即屏幕阅读器或语音界面应当读出以取代晦涩码点名称的唯一简洁短语。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gmnSymbolDispositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gmnSymbolDisposition is functional: each audited candidate resolves to exactly one of the four disposition outcomes — adopted glyph, named key, structured constructor, or semantic rejection — so uncertainty is confined to the rationale and the audit records a single unambiguous ruling."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gmnSymbolDisposition 是函数性的:每个被审计的候选项恰好解析为四种处置结果之一——采用的字形、命名的键、结构化构造器或语义拒绝——因此不确定性仅限于理由说明,审计记录一个单一且无歧义的裁定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/goalEvaluationStatusFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:goalEvaluationStatus is functional: a goal evaluation carries exactly one logic:GoalEvaluationStatus — whether it is conclusive — a single conclusiveness value (distinct from the engine-computation logic:resultEvaluation) that with satisfaction status logic:Satisfied and logic:GoalEvaluationCompleted gates a gmeow:satisfiedBy edge."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:goalEvaluationStatus 是函数性的:一次目标评估恰好携带一个 logic:GoalEvaluationStatus——即它是否具有结论性——一个单一的结论性取值(不同于引擎计算的 logic:resultEvaluation),该取值与满足状态 logic:Satisfied 及 logic:GoalEvaluationCompleted 一起决定是否放行一条 gmeow:satisfiedBy 边。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/grooveGridUnitFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:grooveGridUnit is functional: a GrooveProfile applies to exactly one metric grid unit, so the grid unit it targets is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:grooveGridUnit 是函数性的:一个 GrooveProfile 恰好适用于一个节拍网格单位,因此它所针对的网格单位是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/grooveKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:grooveKind is functional: a GrooveProfile is of exactly one kind (swing ratio, position offsets, or measured), so its groove kind is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:grooveKind 是函数性的:一个 GrooveProfile 恰好属于一种类型(摇摆比率、位置偏移或实测),因此其律动类型是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/groupLengthDenominatorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:groupLengthDenominator is functional: the rational length of a MetricGroup has exactly one denominator, so this component of its length is single-valued per group."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:groupLengthDenominator 是函数性的:一个 MetricGroup 的有理长度恰好有一个分母,因此其长度的这一分量在每个组中都是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/groupLengthNumeratorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:groupLengthNumerator is functional: the rational length of a MetricGroup has exactly one numerator, so this component of its length is single-valued per group."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:groupLengthNumerator 是函数性的:一个 MetricGroup 的有理长度恰好有一个分子,因此其长度的这一分量在每个组中都是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/groupOperatorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:groupOperator is functional: a condition group combines its members under exactly one operator — all, any, or none — and richer logic is built by nesting further groups rather than by a second operator on one group."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:groupOperator 是函数性的:一个条件组恰好在一个运算符——all、any 或 none——之下组合其成员,更复杂的逻辑通过嵌套更多的组来构建,而不是在同一个组上使用第二个运算符。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gtsHeadIdFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gtsHeadId is functional: a gmeow:GTSSegment has exactly one chain head — the single content-id of its last frame, written 'blake3:<hex>', which transitively commits to the segment's entire frame history."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gtsHeadId 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:GTSSegment 恰好有一个链头——其最后一帧的唯一内容标识,记作 'blake3:<hex>',它以传递方式承诺该分段的整个帧历史。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gtsProfileFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gtsProfile is functional: a gmeow:GTSSegment declares exactly one profile — a single value-vocabulary individual naming its purpose and requirement set, while a multi-segment document's effective requirements are the derived union of its segments' profiles rather than a second value on one segment."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gtsProfile 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:GTSSegment 恰好声明一个配置——一个值词汇表中的单一个体,用于命名其目的和需求集合——而一份多分段文档的有效需求是其各分段配置的派生并集,而不是在单个分段上设置第二个值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gtsSegmentHeadKey|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "a GTS segment is keyed by its chain head"
msgstr "GTS 分段以其链头作为键"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gtsSegmentHeadKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts that a gmeow:GTSSegment is identified by its gmeow:gtsHeadId: the chain head is a BLAKE3 content-id committing transitively to the segment's entire frame history, so two distinct segments sharing a head would be a full-history BLAKE3 collision — impossible by construction. The head therefore uniquely identifies its segment (content-addressing IS the identity), and the native DL consistency gate forces two segments asserted distinct yet sharing a head into owl:Nothing. Stated as a key (the logic: analogue of owl:hasKey, OWL 2 DL) rather than an inverse-functional characteristic, which on the datatype property gmeow:gtsHeadId would be OWL 2 Full."
msgstr "断言一个 gmeow:GTSSegment 由其 gmeow:gtsHeadId 标识:链头是一个 BLAKE3 内容标识,它以传递方式承诺该分段的整个帧历史,因此两个共享同一链头的不同分段将构成一次覆盖全部历史的 BLAKE3 碰撞——依构造而言这是不可能的。因此链头唯一标识其分段(内容寻址即身份),原生 DL 一致性关卡会将两个被断言为不同却共享链头的分段强制归入 owl:Nothing。此处以键(logic: 中 owl:hasKey 的对应物,OWL 2 DL)的形式表述,而非逆函数特性——若用于数据类型属性 gmeow:gtsHeadId 上,逆函数特性将属于 OWL 2 Full。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gtsSegmentIndexFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gtsSegmentIndex is functional: a gmeow:GTSSegment occupies exactly one zero-based position in its document's file order — a single index, the ordered list of which forms the document's composite identity."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gtsSegmentIndex 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:GTSSegment 在其文档的文件顺序中恰好占据一个从零开始的位置——一个单一的索引,这些索引的有序列表构成文档的复合身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/gtsSegmentOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gtsSegmentOf is functional: a gmeow:GTSSegment instance belongs to exactly one document — the same bytes appearing in another file are a different segment instance of the same content, not a second document on one segment."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gtsSegmentOf 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:GTSSegment 实例恰好属于一个文档——同样的字节出现在另一个文件中,是同一内容的另一个分段实例,而不是一个分段对应两个文档。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/guardedByCounterExampleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:guardedByCounterExample is functional: a gmeow:FlagshipScenario is guarded by exactly one counter-example — the single slice-relative negative fixture that raises the scenario's gmeow:enforcesFailureClass, which the discharge harness runs to confirm the gate bites."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:guardedByCounterExample 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:FlagshipScenario 恰好由一个反例来把守——即触发该场景 gmeow:enforcesFailureClass 的、与切片相关的单一负向固件,验证工具运行它以确认关卡确实生效。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/guardsPreconditionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:guardsPrecondition is functional: a freshness guard guards exactly one precondition situation — the single datum whose currency it checks — so a schema guarding several preconditions carries one logic:FreshnessGuard per precondition (the multi-valued logic:freshnessGuard gathers them), never one guard fanning out over many."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:guardsPrecondition 是函数性的:一个新鲜度守卫恰好守卫一个前提情境——即它所核验时效性的单一数据项——因此一个守卫多个前提的模式会为每个前提各携带一个 logic:FreshnessGuard(多值的 logic:freshnessGuard 将它们汇集起来),而绝不是一个守卫扩展覆盖多个前提。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hardConstraintClassFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hardConstraintClass is functional: a gmeow:VerifierVerdict has exactly one gmeow:ConstraintHardness — hard or soft — the single axis the orthogonality gates read to decide winner-eligibility."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hardConstraintClass 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:VerifierVerdict 恰好具有一个 gmeow:ConstraintHardness——硬性或软性——这是正交性关卡读取以判定获胜资格的唯一轴。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hasContentDispositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hasContentDisposition is functional: a body part's Content-Disposition resolves to exactly one presentation value — inline or attachment, never both — so the part points to a single ContentDisposition individual."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hasContentDisposition 是函数性的:正文部分的 Content-Disposition 恰好解析为一个呈现取值——inline 或 attachment,绝不同时为两者——因此该部分指向单一的 ContentDisposition 个体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hasContentTransferEncodingFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hasContentTransferEncoding is functional: a MIME body part is encoded for transport by exactly one mechanism — base64, quoted-printable, 7bit, 8bit, or binary — so it points to a single ContentTransferEncoding value."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hasContentTransferEncoding 是函数性的:一个 MIME 正文部分恰好以一种机制进行传输编码——base64、quoted-printable、7bit、8bit 或 binary——因此它指向单一的 ContentTransferEncoding 取值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hasEndInstantFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hasEndInstant is functional: a gmeow:TimeInterval terminates at a single reified gmeow:Instant, mirroring the singular gmeow:endedAtTime it reifies, and an open-ended interval omits it rather than naming two ends."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hasEndInstant 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:TimeInterval 终止于单一具体化的 gmeow:Instant,与其所具体化的单一 gmeow:endedAtTime 相呼应,一个开放式区间会省略它,而不是指定两个终点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hasManifestationFormatFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hasManifestationFormat is functional: a Manifestation is issued in one publishable form — paperback, EPUB, audiobook, vinyl — so a second format is a second Manifestation rather than a rival format value on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hasManifestationFormat 是函数性的:一个 Manifestation 以一种可出版的形式发行——平装本、EPUB、有声书、黑胶唱片——因此第二种格式意味着第二个 Manifestation,而不是在同一个上设置一个相互竞争的格式取值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hasMetricKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hasMetricKind is functional: a reference frame declares one distance/dissimilarity metric governing every proximity computation expressed in it, so exactly one gmeow:MetricKind applies to the frame."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hasMetricKind 是函数性的:一个参考系声明一种统辖其中所表达的一切邻近度计算的距离/相异度度量,因此恰好有一个 gmeow:MetricKind 适用于该参考系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hasMultipartTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hasMultipartType is functional: a MultipartBodyPart's Content-Type declares exactly one multipart subtype (alternative, mixed, related, signed, encrypted, …), so the container points to a single MultipartType value."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hasMultipartType 是函数性的:一个 MultipartBodyPart 的 Content-Type 恰好声明一种多部分子类型(alternative、mixed、related、signed、encrypted 等),因此该容器指向单一的 MultipartType 取值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hasReferencePositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hasReferencePosition is functional: a celestial reference frame has one origin (topocentric, geocentric, barycentric, or heliocentric) about which its coordinates are reckoned, so exactly one reference position fixes it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hasReferencePosition 是函数性的:一个天球参考系拥有一个原点(站心、地心、质心或日心),其坐标以此为基准计算,因此恰好有一个参考位置来固定它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hasStartInstantFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hasStartInstant is functional: a gmeow:TimeInterval begins at a single reified gmeow:Instant, since an interval bearing two distinct start instants would be two intervals sharing an end rather than one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hasStartInstant 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:TimeInterval 始于单一具体化的 gmeow:Instant,因为一个带有两个不同起始时刻的区间实际上是两个共享一个终点的区间,而不是一个区间。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hasTargetSetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hasTargetSet is functional: a projection's stored matrix realizes exactly one ordered target namespace, so its row mapping resolves to a single content-addressed gmeow:TargetSet; a different subject projection over the same source is a different projection with its own target set, never one projection matrix bearing two."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hasTargetSet 是函数性的:一个投影所存储的矩阵恰好实现一个有序的目标命名空间,因此其行映射解析为单一的、按内容寻址的 gmeow:TargetSet;在同一来源上以不同主体做的投影是拥有各自目标集的另一个投影,绝不是一个投影矩阵携带两个目标集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hasTimeScaleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hasTimeScale is functional: a celestial reference frame is tied to one time standard, so exactly one gmeow:TimeScale governs the temporal reckoning of coordinates expressed in it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hasTimeScale 是函数性的:一个天球参考系绑定于一种时间标准,因此恰好有一个 gmeow:TimeScale 支配其中所表达坐标的时间换算。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hasVectorSpaceContractFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hasVectorSpaceContract is functional: a projection commits to exactly one comparability contract, because vectors obeying two contracts cannot be compared under one metric and so are two projections, never one; the single contract's digest is the join key for cross-projection comparability."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hasVectorSpaceContract 是函数性的:一个投影恰好承诺一份可比性契约,因为遵循两份契约的向量无法在单一度量下比较,因而构成两个投影而绝非一个;这份单一契约的摘要即是跨投影可比性的连接键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hazardBearerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hazardBearer is functional: a hazard inheres in exactly one bearer, per gUFO inherence — the same danger borne by two systems is two hazards, not one shared between them."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hazardBearer 是函数性的:按照 gUFO 的内在依存关系,一个危害恰好内在于一个承载者——同一种危险由两个系统承载即是两个危害,而不是二者共享的一个危害。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/headerNameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:headerName is functional: a reified MessageHeader models one RFC 5322 header field, and a field has exactly one field name, so the header's name is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:headerName 是函数性的:一个具体化的 MessageHeader 建模的是单个 RFC 5322 头部字段,而一个字段恰好有一个字段名,因此该头部的名称是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/headerValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:headerValue is functional: a reified MessageHeader models one RFC 5322 header field, and a field has exactly one field value, so the header's value is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:headerValue 是函数性的:一个具体化的 MessageHeader 建模的是单个 RFC 5322 头部字段,而一个字段恰好有一个字段值,因此该头部的取值是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/holdingAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:holdingAgent is functional: a holding is held by exactly one agent — the single party the holding relator connects to its asset, quantity, and cost basis."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:holdingAgent 是函数性的:一项持仓恰好由一个主体持有——即该持仓关系子将其资产、数量和成本基础相连接的那个唯一一方。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/holdingAssetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:holdingAsset is functional: a holding is of exactly one asset — the single financial instrument the holding relator connects to its holding agent."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:holdingAsset 是函数性的:一项持仓恰好对应一种资产——即该持仓关系子将其持有主体相连接的那个唯一金融工具。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/holdingCostBasisFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:holdingCostBasis is functional: a holding has exactly one canonical cost basis — the single monetary amount originally paid to acquire the asset, with disputed figures kept as separate standpoint-indexed claims rather than extra values."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:holdingCostBasis 是函数性的:一项持仓恰好有一个规范的成本基础——即最初为获取该资产所支付的单一货币金额,存在争议的数字则作为按立场索引的独立主张保留,而不是作为额外的取值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/holdingQuantityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:holdingQuantity is functional: a holding has exactly one quantity — the single xsd:decimal amount of the asset held at a given point in time, with competing figures kept as separate standpoint-indexed statements."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:holdingQuantity 是函数性的:一项持仓恰好有一个数量——即在给定时间点持有该资产的单一 xsd:decimal 数值,相互竞争的数字则作为按立场索引的独立陈述保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/honorificPositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:honorificPosition is functional: a given honorific is rendered in exactly one place relative to the name — either as a prefix or as a suffix, never both — so each gmeow:Honorific fixes a single render position."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:honorificPosition 是函数性的:给定的敬称恰好在相对于姓名的一个位置上呈现——要么作为前缀,要么作为后缀,绝不同时两者——因此每个 gmeow:Honorific 固定一个单一的呈现位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hopOrdinalFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hopOrdinal is functional: a RelayHop occupies one position within a message's delivery path (1 = closest to the origin), so its ordinal is a single integer."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hopOrdinal 是函数性的:一个 RelayHop 在消息传递路径中占据一个位置(1 表示最接近源头),因此其序号是一个单一整数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hsNumberFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:hsNumber is functional: an InstrumentType carries at most one Hornbostel-Sachs classification number, so its HS code is single-valued (optional, since not every instrument type is assigned one)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:hsNumber 是函数性的:一个 InstrumentType 至多携带一个霍恩博斯特尔-萨克斯分类号,因此其 HS 编码是单值的(可选,因为并非每种乐器类型都被分配了该编码)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/identifierSchemeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:identifierScheme is functional: each gmeow:Identifier node names exactly one scheme (such as 'lei', 'ror', or 'wikidata'), the property being carried on the per-identifier node precisely so co-existing identifiers each keep a single scheme instead of cross-pairing."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:identifierScheme 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:Identifier 节点恰好命名一种方案(如 'lei'、'ror' 或 'wikidata'),该属性之所以挂载在各标识符各自的节点上,正是为了让并存的标识符各自保持单一方案,而不是相互交叉配对。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/identifierUrlFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:identifierUrl is functional: a gmeow:Identifier record resolves at exactly one authority URL, the resolvable counterpart of its single scheme-local value, so a second landing page would denote a different identifier record."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:identifierUrl 是函数性的:一条 gmeow:Identifier 记录恰好解析到一个权威 URL,即其单一方案本地取值的可解析对应物,因此第二个落地页将表示一条不同的标识符记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/identifierValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:identifierValue is functional: a gmeow:Identifier node carries exactly one literal value within its scheme, and a different value is a different identifier."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:identifierValue 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Identifier 节点在其方案内恰好携带一个字面值,不同的取值即是不同的标识符。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/imageOrientationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:imageOrientation is functional: a media object has exactly one clockwise rotation from its normal orientation — a single EXIF angle (0, 90, 180, or 270 degrees) the solver applies when rendering — because one manifestation cannot be displayed rotated by two conflicting amounts at once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:imageOrientation 是函数性的:一个媒体对象相对于其正常方向恰好有一个顺时针旋转量——渲染时求解器所应用的单一 EXIF 角度(0、90、180 或 270 度)——因为同一个体现物不能同时以两个相互冲突的角度旋转显示。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/inReferenceAssemblyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:inReferenceAssembly is functional: a sequence-coordinate tuple is meaningful only against one reference assembly (e.g. GRCh38), so it names exactly one assembly and coordinates in another assembly are a distinct SequenceCoordinates instance (Principle 11)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:inReferenceAssembly 是函数性的:一个序列坐标元组只有相对于一个参考组装(例如 GRCh38)才有意义,因此它恰好命名一个组装,而另一组装中的坐标构成一个不同的 SequenceCoordinates 实例(原则 11)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/indexAlgorithmFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:indexAlgorithm is functional: a vector index is built with exactly one approximate-nearest-neighbour structure, a single build-time commitment fixing how that index is searched."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:indexAlgorithm 是函数性的:一个向量索引恰好以一种近似最近邻结构构建,这是构建时确定的单一承诺,决定了该索引的检索方式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/indexOfProjectionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:indexOfProjection is functional: a derived index is built over exactly one embedding projection, so it always resolves to the single authoritative source of the vectors it accelerates; a federated accelerator spanning several projections is several gmeow:DerivedVectorIndex individuals, never one index bound to two projections."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:indexOfProjection 是函数性的:一个派生索引恰好建立在一个嵌入投影之上,因此它总是解析到其所加速向量的唯一权威来源;一个跨越多个投影的联邦式加速器对应多个 gmeow:DerivedVectorIndex 个体,而绝不是一个绑定到两个投影的索引。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/indexOverSpaceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:indexOverSpace is functional: a derived index is built over exactly one effective/prefix vector space, the single space it states what it approximates; an index over a 256-dim prefix and an index over the full family space are distinct gmeow:DerivedVectorIndex individuals even over one projection, never one index over two spaces."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:indexOverSpace 是函数性的:一个派生索引恰好建立在一个有效/前缀向量空间之上,即它声明自己所近似的那个唯一空间;一个建立在 256 维前缀上的索引与一个建立在完整族空间上的索引,即便属于同一个投影,也是不同的 gmeow:DerivedVectorIndex 个体,绝不是一个跨两个空间的索引。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/inferenceModeOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:inferenceModeOf is functional: a gmeow:InferenceCommitment has exactly one Peircean mode, since a step that were both inductive and abductive is two commitments and the single mode scopes which SHACL shapes apply."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:inferenceModeOf 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:InferenceCommitment 恰好有一种皮尔士式模式,因为一个既是归纳又是溯因的步骤实际上是两个承诺,而这个单一模式决定了哪些 SHACL 形状适用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ingestedAtFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:ingestedAt is functional: a gmeow:ImportActivity has a single transaction time — the one instant it recorded its claims into the system — so exactly one xsd:dateTime stamps the activity, keeping the ingest axis distinct from assertion and validity."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:ingestedAt 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:ImportActivity 恰好有一个单一的事务时间——它将其主张记录进系统的那一时刻——因此恰好有一个 xsd:dateTime 为该活动打上时间戳,使摄入轴与断言轴、有效性轴保持区分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/inhabitationLocusKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:inhabitationLocusKind is functional: a gmeow:InhabitationTenure has exactly one locus kind, either gmeow:locusSelf or gmeow:locusVessel, while tenancy cardinality is derived from overlapping tenures rather than set here."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:inhabitationLocusKind 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:InhabitationTenure 恰好有一种场所类型,或为 gmeow:locusSelf,或为 gmeow:locusVessel,而占用的基数是从重叠的租期中派生得出,而非在此设定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/inhabitationSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:inhabitationSubject is functional: a gmeow:InhabitationTenure has exactly one inhabiting subject, and because that single slot has a gmeow:Agent range a contested inhabitation must use gmeow:InhabitationClaim rather than assert a rival subject here."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:inhabitationSubject 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:InhabitationTenure 恰好有一个占用主体,并且由于这个单一槽位的值域为 gmeow:Agent,存在争议的占用必须使用 gmeow:InhabitationClaim,而不是在此断言一个相竞争的主体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/inhabitedHostFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:inhabitedHost is functional: a gmeow:InhabitationTenure has exactly one inhabited host, so the same subject inhabiting a second host is a distinct tenure."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:inhabitedHost 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:InhabitationTenure 恰好有一个被占用的宿主,因此同一主体占用第二个宿主即构成一个不同的租期。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/inscriptionCarrierFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:inscriptionCarrier is functional: an inscription is borne by exactly one physical carrier, and a copy of the same text on a second carrier is a distinct Inscription instance rather than one inscription borne by two objects."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:inscriptionCarrier 是函数性的:一段铭文恰好由一个物理载体承载,同一文本在第二个载体上的副本构成一个不同的 Inscription 实例,而不是一段铭文由两个对象承载。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/instantValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:instantValue is functional: a gmeow:Instant carries at most one crisp xsd:dateTime value, since a zero-duration point has a single machine-computable value and any approximate alternative belongs on gmeow:edtfValue rather than as a second crisp value."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:instantValue 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Instant 至多携带一个精确的 xsd:dateTime 取值,因为一个零持续时长的时间点只有一个可由机器计算的取值,任何近似的替代表述都应归入 gmeow:edtfValue,而不是作为第二个精确取值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/intensityBasisFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:intensityBasis is functional: a derived intensity is the norm OF exactly one vector observation — the single declared basis it is computed from — so it cannot be the norm of two vectors at once without ceasing to be one intensity."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:intensityBasis 是函数性的:一个派生强度恰好是某一个向量观测值的范数——即计算它所依据的那个单一声明基准——因此它不能同时是两个向量的范数,否则就不再是一个单一的强度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/intentBearerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:intentBearer is functional: an intentional mode is an intrinsic moment that inheres in exactly one bearer, so two agents wanting the same outcome are two modes sharing a single gmeow:intentionGoal."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:intentBearer 是函数性的:一个意向模式是内在于恰好一个承载者的内在时刻,因此想要同一结果的两个主体构成共享同一个 gmeow:intentionGoal 的两个模式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/intentionGoalFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:intentionGoal is functional: an intentional moment aims at exactly one goal, so an agent pursuing five goals bears five modes and sharing occurs at the Goal individual rather than the mode."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:intentionGoal 是函数性的:一个意向时刻恰好指向一个目标,因此追求五个目标的主体承载五种模式,共享发生在 Goal 个体层面,而不是模式层面。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/interpolationKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:interpolationKind is functional: a PitchTrajectory uses exactly one interpolation mode between its control points (linearCents, exponential, or stochasticByReference), so its interpolation kind is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:interpolationKind 是函数性的:一个 PitchTrajectory 在其控制点之间恰好使用一种插值方式(linearCents、exponential 或 stochasticByReference),因此其插值类型是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/introducerAmountFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:introducerAmount is functional: a gmeow:TrustAssertion carries exactly one introducer amount, since one trustor assigns one trust-signature weight to its trustee and a different weight is a different assertion."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:introducerAmount 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:TrustAssertion 恰好携带一个介绍人权重,因为一个信任方对其受信方赋予一个信任签名权重,不同的权重即是不同的断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/introducerDepthFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:introducerDepth is functional: a gmeow:TrustAssertion declares exactly one introducer depth, since a single assertion fixes one bound on how many indirect introducer levels the trustor will follow rather than several competing bounds."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:introducerDepth 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:TrustAssertion 恰好声明一个介绍人深度,因为单一断言只固定一个界限,规定信任方将追随多少级间接介绍人,而不是设定若干相互竞争的界限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/invariantFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:invariant is functional: an action schema names exactly one invariant — the single condition that must hold before, during, and after its execution — distinct from logic:precondition (what must hold to begin) and logic:effect (what changes), so the preserved condition is one facet, not a set."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:invariant 是函数性的:一个动作模式恰好命名一个不变量——即在其执行之前、期间和之后都必须成立的单一条件——不同于 logic:precondition(启动所需成立的条件)和 logic:effect(发生的变化),因此被保持的条件是单一层面,而不是一个集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/invitationEventFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:invitationEvent is functional: a reified invitation concerns exactly one event — the single concrete occurrence the invitee is asked to attend, never a recurrence generator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:invitationEvent 是函数性的:一个具体化的邀请恰好涉及一个事件——即受邀者被要求出席的那个单一具体场合,而绝不是一个循环发生器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/invoiceAmountFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:invoiceAmount is functional: an invoice has exactly one canonical total amount — the single MonetaryAmount it requests in payment."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:invoiceAmount 是函数性的:一张发票恰好有一个规范的总金额——即其要求支付的单一 MonetaryAmount。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/issuedAtFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:issuedAt is functional: the instant an attestation was issued is constitutive of the attestation's identity, so a vouching act carries one wall-clock issue time and a different issue instant is a different attestation rather than a second value."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:issuedAt 是函数性的:证明被签发的那一时刻构成了该证明身份的构成要素,因此一次担保行为携带一个墙钟签发时间,不同的签发时刻意味着一个不同的证明,而不是第二个取值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/jurisdictionPlaceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:jurisdictionPlace is functional: a jurisdiction tenure records governance over exactly one place, and the place is constitutive of the tenure's identity, so a second place would be a different tenure."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:jurisdictionPlace 是函数性的:一项管辖权租期恰好记录对一个地方的治理,且该地方构成该租期身份的构成要素,因此第二个地方将构成一个不同的租期。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/jurisdictionPolityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:jurisdictionPolity is functional: a jurisdiction tenure records one governing polity holding jurisdiction during that period, and competing sovereignty is captured as separate standpoint-indexed tenures rather than multiple polities on one (Principle 9)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:jurisdictionPolity 是函数性的:一项管辖权租期恰好记录在该期间持有管辖权的一个治理政体,相互竞争的主权主张被捕捉为按立场索引的独立租期,而不是在一个租期上设置多个政体(原则 9)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/keyClass|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "key class"
msgstr "键类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/keyClass|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates a logic:KeyAssertion to the class its key identifies — the class whose instances the key value uniquely picks out. Read together with logic:keyProperty, it tells the native DL consistency gate which class bears the key: two instances of this class agreeing on every key value are the same individual. Domain logic:KeyAssertion; single-valued."
msgstr "将一个 logic:KeyAssertion 关联到其键所标识的类——即键值唯一挑出其实例的那个类。与 logic:keyProperty 一并阅读时,它告诉原生 DL 一致性关卡哪个类承载该键:该类的两个实例若在每个键值上都一致,则为同一个体。定义域 logic:KeyAssertion;单值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/keyProperty|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "key property"
msgstr "键属性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/keyProperty|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates a logic:KeyAssertion to the property whose value keys the class — the single key property whose value uniquely identifies a logic:keyClass instance. Co-present with logic:keyClass: a key assertion carrying one without the other names no enforceable key. A record naming several logic:keyProperty values states a COMPOSITE key (the tuple of values is unique, not each part), which has no single-path uniqueness shape; the seeded keys are single-property. Domain logic:KeyAssertion; single-valued for a single-property key."
msgstr "将一个 logic:KeyAssertion 关联到其取值为该类提供键的属性——即其取值唯一标识一个 logic:keyClass 实例的那个单一键属性。与 logic:keyClass 共同出现:一个键断言若只携带其中之一而无另一个,则未命名任何可强制执行的键。一条记录若命名多个 logic:keyProperty 取值,则表述的是一个复合键(取值元组是唯一的,而非每个部分各自唯一),这种键没有单路径唯一性形状;预置的键均为单属性键。定义域 logic:KeyAssertion;对单属性键而言为单值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/keySchemeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:keyScheme is functional: a gmeow:CryptographicKey has exactly one scheme — OpenPGP, X.509, SSH, or Nostr — since a key of a different format is a different key."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:keyScheme 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:CryptographicKey 恰好具有一种方案——OpenPGP、X.509、SSH 或 Nostr——因为格式不同的密钥即是不同的密钥。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/knowerAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:knowerAgent is functional: one reified gmeow:KnowledgeClaim has exactly one knowing agent — the single subject the locally-factive knowing relation is anchored on, so the claim reifies one agent's knowing, not a collective."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:knowerAgent 是函数性的:一个具体化的 gmeow:KnowledgeClaim 恰好有一个认知主体——即局部实然的认知关系所锚定的那个单一主体——因此该主张具体化的是一个主体的认知,而不是一个集体的认知。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/knowledgeProficiencyAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyAgent is functional: a gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency expresses the knowledge depth of exactly one agent, whose identity is constitutive of the reified proficiency."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyAgent 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency 恰好表达一个主体的知识深度,该主体的身份构成了这一具体化熟练度的构成要素。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/knowledgeProficiencyLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyLevel is functional: a gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency records exactly one attained ordinal depth on the knowledgeAware to knowledgeMastered ladder."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyLevel 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency 恰好记录在从 knowledgeAware 到 knowledgeMastered 的阶梯上所达到的一个序数深度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/knowledgeProficiencyScaleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyScale is functional: a gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency's level is read against exactly one scale, the native gmeow:KnowledgeLevel or a Bloom's / SOLO / Dreyfus alternate."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:knowledgeProficiencyScale 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency 的水平恰好依据一种量表来解读,即原生的 gmeow:KnowledgeLevel,或布鲁姆分类法/SOLO/德雷福斯模型中的一种替代量表。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/knowledgeProficiencySubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:knowledgeProficiencySubject is functional: a gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency concerns exactly one subject entity — a topic, person, place, or event — constitutive of which proficiency it is."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:knowledgeProficiencySubject 是函数式的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeProficiency 恰好涉及一个主体实体——一个主题、人物、地点或事件——它构成了该项能力究竟是关于什么的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/knownInWorldFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:knownInWorld is functional: one gmeow:KnowledgeClaim is locally factive in exactly one gmeow:EpistemicContext — the single belief-world its known proposition holds in, since factivity is world-relative and a second world would be a second knowing claim."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:knownInWorld 是函数式的:一个 gmeow:KnowledgeClaim 恰好在一个 gmeow:EpistemicContext 中具有局部真实性——即其已知命题成立的那个唯一信念世界,因为真实性是相对于世界而言的,第二个世界将构成第二个知识断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/knownPropositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:knownProposition is functional: one reified gmeow:KnowledgeClaim is about exactly one known gmeow:Proposition — the single propositional content the knowing relation ranges over, so one claim reifies knowing one proposition in its world under its standard."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:knownProposition 是函数式的:一个被具体化的 gmeow:KnowledgeClaim 恰好关于一个已知的 gmeow:Proposition——即该知晓关系所涉及的唯一命题内容——因此一个断言在其世界中、依据其标准,具体化了对一个命题的知晓。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/labelSetDecisionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:labelSetDecision is functional: a registered label set carries exactly one decision structure — argmax-exclusive or independent-threshold — because a set that was simultaneously single-label and multi-label would make its exclusivity, and hence whether a second label crossing is a violation, undecidable."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:labelSetDecision 是函数式的:一个已注册的标签集恰好携带一种决策结构——argmax 互斥式或独立阈值式——因为一个同时既是单标签又是多标签的集合,会使其互斥性、进而使第二个标签越界是否构成违规都变得不可判定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ledgerAccountTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:ledgerAccountType is functional: a ledger account has exactly one canonical type — a single LedgerAccountType (asset, liability, equity, revenue, expense) fixing its role in the accounting equation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:ledgerAccountType 是函数式的:一个总账科目恰好拥有一种规范类型——单一的 LedgerAccountType(资产、负债、权益、收入、费用)——它确定了该科目在会计等式中的角色。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/leftOperandFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:leftOperand is functional: an atomic constraint tests exactly one dimension — dateTime, spatial, count, purpose, recipient, … — because it is a single comparison over one operand; testing a second dimension is a second atomic constraint combined via a gmeow:LogicalConstraint, not two operands on one atom."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:leftOperand 是函数式的:一个原子约束恰好检验一个维度——日期时间、空间、计数、目的、接收者等——因为这是对单一操作数的单一比较;检验第二个维度是通过 gmeow:LogicalConstraint 组合的第二个原子约束,而不是在一个原子上使用两个操作数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/levelScaleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:levelScale is functional: a proficiency-level individual belongs to exactly one scale, so cefrB2 sits on the CEFR framework alone and is never simultaneously a level of ILR or ACTFL."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:levelScale 是函数式的:一个能力等级个体恰好属于一个量表,因此 cefrB2 只归属于 CEFR 框架,绝不会同时又是 ILR 或 ACTFL 的等级。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/lexicalItemLanguageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:lexicalItemLanguage is functional: a lexical item has exactly one primary language, a polyglot or borrowed item being modeled as separate items linked by translation or derivation rather than as one item in several languages."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:lexicalItemLanguage 是函数式的:一个词汇项恰好只有一种主要语言,多语或借用的词项被建模为通过翻译或派生关系连接的多个独立词项,而不是一个跨越多种语言的单一词项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/licenseFamilyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:licenseFamily is functional: a licence belongs to exactly one coarse family — public-domain, Creative Commons, permissive, copyleft, proprietary, or dual — a single classification of the one licence document; even a multi-licence offer is captured by the single 'dual' family value rather than by two family assignments."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:licenseFamily 是函数式的:一份许可证恰好属于一个粗粒度类别——公共领域、知识共享、宽松式、著佐权式、专有式或双重式——是对单一许可文档的单一分类;即使是双重许可的方案,也用单一的 'dual' 类别值来表示,而不是赋予两个类别。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/licensedWorkFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:licensedWork is functional: a License relator grants rights in exactly one work, so several works under the same terms each carry their own License relator (or reference one shared SPDX-identified licence per work) rather than crowding two works onto a single grant."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:licensedWork 是函数式的:一个 License 关系体恰好为一部作品授予权利,因此在相同条款下的多部作品各自携带自己的 License 关系体(或各自引用同一份 SPDX 标识的共享许可证),而不是把两部作品挤进同一次授权中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/lifecycleStatusFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:lifecycleStatus is functional: a goal evaluation carries exactly one logic:LifecycleStatus — the lifecycle axis of the factored outcome — a single value that varies independently of the satisfaction, feasibility, and goal-evaluation axes yet is itself one-valued per evaluation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:lifecycleStatus 是函数式的:一次目标评估恰好携带一个 logic:LifecycleStatus——即已分解结果中的生命周期轴——它是一个独立于满足度、可行性和目标评估各轴而变化的单一值,但就每次评估而言本身仍是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/linkAntecedentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:linkAntecedent is functional: a causal link has exactly one causing kind, the single antecedent event type, held distinct from the consequent so that nothing type-causes itself."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:linkAntecedent 是函数式的:一个因果链接恰好有一个致因种类,即唯一的前因事件类型,它与后果保持区分,以确保没有任何类型在类型层面上导致其自身。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/linkConsequentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:linkConsequent is functional: a causal link has exactly one caused kind, the single consequent event type that the antecedent kind brings about."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:linkConsequent 是函数式的:一个因果链接恰好有一个被致因的种类,即前因种类所导致的唯一后果事件类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/localPartFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:localPart is functional: an email address parses to a single local part before the @, so the person-identifying component queried separately from the whole is one value derived deterministically from the address's addr-spec."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:localPart 是函数式的:一个电子邮件地址在 @ 符号之前只解析出一个本地部分,因此这个可与整体分开查询的、用于识别人的组成部分,是从该地址的 addr-spec 确定性地推导出的单一值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/logEntryIndexFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:logEntryIndex is functional: a transparency-log entry has one stable sequential position within its append-only log, so its log-local index — the identity that survives mirror changes — is single-valued rather than a set of offsets."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:logEntryIndex 是函数式的:一条透明日志条目在其只追加日志中拥有一个稳定的序列位置,因此其日志本地索引——在镜像变化中依然保持不变的身份标识——是单值的,而不是一组偏移量的集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/logIndexFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:logIndex is functional: a ledger event sits at one offset within its containing block or transaction, so the in-block position that disambiguates one emitted log from another is single-valued and, with the transaction hash and block, addresses the event uniquely."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:logIndex 是函数式的:一个账本事件在其所属区块或交易中恰好位于一个偏移位置,因此用以区分不同已发出日志的区块内位置是单值的,并且与交易哈希及区块一起,唯一地定位该事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/mailboxOfAccountFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:mailboxOfAccount is functional: a mailbox is a container held within exactly one online account, so the account that holds it is a single value."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:mailboxOfAccount 是函数式的:一个邮箱是一个恰好由一个在线账户所持有的容器,因此持有它的账户是单一值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/mailboxRoleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:mailboxRole is functional: JMAP assigns a mailbox at most one special-use role (inbox, archive, drafts, sent, trash, junk, templates), so the role is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:mailboxRole 是函数式的:JMAP 最多为一个邮箱分配一种特殊用途角色(收件箱、归档、草稿、已发送、垃圾箱、垃圾邮件、模板),因此该角色是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/mapRatioDenominatorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:mapRatioDenominator is functional: the rational ratio carried by a TimeMapping has exactly one denominator, so this component of the ratio is single-valued per mapping."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:mapRatioDenominator 是函数式的:一个 TimeMapping 所携带的有理比例恰好有一个分母,因此该比例的这一分量对每个映射而言都是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/mapRatioNumeratorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:mapRatioNumerator is functional: the rational ratio carried by a TimeMapping has exactly one numerator, so this component of the ratio is single-valued per mapping."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:mapRatioNumerator 是函数式的:一个 TimeMapping 所携带的有理比例恰好有一个分子,因此该比例的这一分量对每个映射而言都是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/markTextFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:markText is functional: a mark has one canonical word form — its brand name as registered or used — so a single gmeow:Mark carries exactly one mark-text string; a differently-worded sign is a distinct mark with its own gmeow:Mark rather than a second text on the same one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:markText 是函数式的:一个商标只有一个规范的文字形式——即其注册或使用的品牌名称——因此单一的 gmeow:Mark 恰好携带一个商标文字字符串;措辞不同的标识是一个拥有自己 gmeow:Mark 的独立商标,而不是同一商标上的第二个文字。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/materializationDepthFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:materializationDepth is functional: a repository carries exactly one materialization-depth setting — the single non-negative integer fixing how many levels of its Merkle source tree are projected as triples."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:materializationDepth 是函数式的:一个仓库恰好携带一个物化深度设置——即固定其 Merkle 源树有多少层被投影为三元组的单一非负整数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/matrixShapeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:matrixShape is functional: a coordinate matrix carries exactly one shape descriptor, the single dimension string (such as '4×1' or '640×480×3') the solver layer parses its serialised value against."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:matrixShape 是函数式的:一个坐标矩阵恰好携带一个形状描述符,即求解层据以解析其序列化值的单一维度字符串(例如 '4×1' 或 '640×480×3')。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/matrixValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:matrixValue is functional: a coordinate matrix carries exactly one serialised numeric payload, the single vector, matrix, or tensor literal the solver layer interprets under the matrix's declared frame and shape."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:matrixValue 是函数式的:一个坐标矩阵恰好携带一个序列化的数值负载,即求解层依据该矩阵所声明的参照系和形状来解释的单一向量、矩阵或张量字面量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/matryoshkaPolicyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:matryoshkaPolicy is functional: an effective vector space commits to exactly one prefix policy that folds into its identity digest, because the full-space (fixed) reading and a leading-prefix reading are distinct effective spaces with distinct digests; a single space cannot be both, so it fixes one gmeow:MatryoshkaPolicy."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:matryoshkaPolicy 是函数式的:一个有效向量空间恰好确定一种前缀策略,并将其纳入身份摘要之中,因为完整空间(固定)读法与前导前缀读法是具有不同摘要的不同有效空间;单一空间不能同时是两者,因此它固定一个 gmeow:MatryoshkaPolicy。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/measuredAgeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:measuredAge is functional: a single gmeow:TemporalMeasurement yields one numeric age in its declared unit, since one dating act under one vantage produces one result and a second age figure is a distinct standpoint-indexed measurement."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:measuredAge 是函数式的:单个 gmeow:TemporalMeasurement 以其声明的单位得出一个数值年龄,因为在单一视角下的一次测年行为只产生一个结果,而第二个年龄数值将是以不同立场为索引的另一次测量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/measuredDateFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:measuredDate is functional: a single gmeow:TemporalMeasurement resolves to one absolute date gmeow:Instant, since one dating act yields one result and a competing date is a separate standpoint-indexed measurement rather than a second date on this one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:measuredDate 是函数式的:单个 gmeow:TemporalMeasurement 解析为一个绝对日期 gmeow:Instant,因为一次测年行为只产生一个结果,而一个相竞争的日期是以不同立场为索引的另一次独立测量,而不是这次测量上的第二个日期。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/measurementMethodFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:measurementMethod is functional: a gmeow:TemporalMeasurement is produced by exactly one gmeow:DatingMethod, since the technique behind an age is singular and a result obtained by a different method is a different measurement."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:measurementMethod 是函数式的:一个 gmeow:TemporalMeasurement 恰好由一种 gmeow:DatingMethod 产生,因为得出某个年龄背后的技术是单一的,由不同方法得出的结果即为不同的测量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/measurementUncertaintyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:measurementUncertainty is functional: a gmeow:TemporalMeasurement carries one uncertainty figure paired with its single measured age, since a second error bar would describe a different measurement rather than the same one twice."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:measurementUncertainty 是函数式的:一个 gmeow:TemporalMeasurement 携带一个与其单一测得年龄配对的不确定度数值,因为第二个误差范围将描述的是另一次测量,而不是同一次测量被重复两次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/mediaTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:mediaType is functional: a concrete content carrier — an email body part, a Manifestation, a Distribution — has exactly one IANA media (MIME) type, since one artifact is encoded in a single format and distinct encodings are modelled as distinct carrier objects rather than two media types on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:mediaType 是函数式的:一个具体的内容载体——一个电子邮件正文部分、一个 Manifestation、一个 Distribution——恰好拥有一种 IANA 媒体(MIME)类型,因为一件工件以单一格式编码,不同的编码被建模为不同的载体对象,而不是在同一个对象上标注两种媒体类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/meetsThresholdFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:meetsThreshold is functional: one gmeow:AdequacyAssessment carries exactly one solver-set gmeow:AdequacyVerdict — met, unmet, or undetermined — since a single assessment against one standard resolves to one verdict, never to conflicting outcomes at once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:meetsThreshold 是函数式的:一个 gmeow:AdequacyAssessment 恰好携带一个由求解器设定的 gmeow:AdequacyVerdict——已满足、未满足或未确定——因为针对一项标准的单次评估只解析为一个裁定,绝不会同时得出相互矛盾的结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/membershipCollectionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:membershipCollection is functional: a PitchCollectionMembership relator belongs to exactly one PitchCollection — one collection per membership — so the collection it joins is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:membershipCollection 是函数式的:一个 PitchCollectionMembership 关系体恰好属于一个 PitchCollection——每个成员关系对应一个集合——因此它所加入的集合是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/membershipDegreeIndexFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:membershipDegreeIndex is functional: a membership pins its member pitch to at most one zero-based degree index within the collection, so the degree index is single-valued (optional, present only when the collection has a conventional ordering)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:membershipDegreeIndex 是函数式的:一个成员关系在集合内最多将其成员音高固定到一个从零开始的级数索引,因此该级数索引是单值的(可选,仅当集合具有约定的排序时才存在)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/membershipMemberFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:membershipMember is functional: a gmeow:Membership relator reifies the membership of exactly one member agent, filling a single member-role slot, while the flat gmeow:memberOf shortcut carries the many-to-many agent-to-organization relation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:membershipMember 是函数式的:一个 gmeow:Membership 关系体恰好具体化了一个成员主体的成员身份,填充单一的成员角色槽位,而扁平化的 gmeow:memberOf 快捷方式则承载主体与组织之间多对多的关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/membershipOrganizationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:membershipOrganization is functional: a gmeow:Membership relator is in exactly one organization (which may be a department that is a sub-organization of a larger org), so joining a second organization is a second membership."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:membershipOrganization 是函数式的:一个 gmeow:Membership 关系体恰好归属于一个组织(该组织可以是隶属于更大组织的一个部门),因此加入第二个组织即构成第二个成员关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/membershipPitchFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:membershipPitch is functional: a PitchCollectionMembership carries exactly one member pitch — one pitch per membership — so the pitch it admits is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:membershipPitch 是函数式的:一个 PitchCollectionMembership 恰好携带一个成员音高——每个成员关系对应一个音高——因此它所接纳的音高是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/membershipRoleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:membershipRole is functional: a PitchCollectionMembership assigns exactly one role to its pitch (tonic/finalis, vadi, samvadi, ghammaz, ascent-only, descent-only, ornamental, or generic member) — one role per membership — so the role is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:membershipRole 是函数式的:一个 PitchCollectionMembership 恰好为其音高分配一个角色(主音/结束音、vadi、samvadi、ghammaz、仅上行、仅下行、装饰性,或普通成员)——每个成员关系对应一个角色——因此该角色是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/memoryKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:memoryKind is functional: a memory item sits in exactly one cognitive register — episodic, semantic, working, or procedural — so a single item takes one register and salience or recency ride the statement layer rather than a competing second register."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:memoryKind 是函数式的:一个记忆项恰好归属于一种认知类别——情景性、语义性、工作性或程序性——因此单一记忆项只采用一种类别,而显著性或时近性由陈述层承载,而不是构成一个相竞争的第二类别。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/mergeTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:mergeTarget is functional: a merge event has exactly one target ref — the single branch or tag into which the source is merged, in contrast to its possibly many merge sources."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:mergeTarget 是函数式的:一个合并事件恰好有一个目标引用——即源被合并进入的单一分支或标签——这与其可能存在的多个合并源形成对比。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/meterCarrierFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:meterCarrier is functional: a MeterAssignment names exactly one carrying entity (voice, performer, or part) for its meter, so the carrier is single-valued per assignment."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:meterCarrier 是函数式的:一个 MeterAssignment 恰好为其节拍指定一个承载实体(声部、演奏者或部分),因此每次指定的承载体都是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/metricGramFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:metricGram is functional: a scale profile declares at most one metric tensor — the single positive-definite Gram matrix G whose induced norm ‖x‖=√(xᵀGx) is intensity over its core-affect basis — so it cannot carry two competing Gram matrices for one frame."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:metricGram 是函数式的:一个量表画像最多声明一个度量张量——即唯一的正定 Gram 矩阵 G,其诱导范数 ‖x‖=√(xᵀGx) 就是在其核心情感基上的强度——因此它不能为同一参照系携带两个相互竞争的 Gram 矩阵。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/metricGroupOrderFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:metricGroupOrder is functional: a MetricGroup occupies exactly one zero-based position within its MetricStructure, so its order index is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:metricGroupOrder 是函数式的:一个 MetricGroup 在其 MetricStructure 中恰好占据一个从零开始的位置,因此其顺序索引是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/metricProfileFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:metricProfile is functional: a derived intensity is computed under exactly one declared scale-normalization profile for the whole vector, so a second metric profile would leave the normalization of that one intensity ambiguous."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:metricProfile 是函数式的:一个派生强度是在整个向量恰好一个已声明的量表归一化画像下计算得出的,因此第二个度量画像会使该强度的归一化变得含糊不清。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/metricStructureOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:metricStructureOf is functional: a MetricStructure defines the metric cycle of exactly one entity (a work, section, or voice), so the entity it structures is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:metricStructureOf 是函数式的:一个 MetricStructure 恰好定义一个实体(一部作品、一个部分或一个声部)的节拍循环,因此它所构造的实体是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/mgrsFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:mgrs is functional: a Geocode holds one Military Grid Reference System coordinate string locating a single grid cell, so a second MGRS value would identify a different location and thus a different Geocode."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:mgrs 是函数式的:一个 Geocode 携带一个军事格网参照系统(MGRS)坐标字符串,定位单一的网格单元,因此第二个 MGRS 值将标识不同的位置,从而是不同的 Geocode。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/mileMarkerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:mileMarker is functional: a Geocode carries one linear-referencing mile-marker — a single distance-along-the-line position on a road, railway, or pipeline — so one value fixes the location."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:mileMarker 是函数式的:一个 Geocode 携带一个线性参照的里程标——即沿道路、铁路或管道的单一线上距离位置——因此一个值即可确定该位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/minimumPopulationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:minimumPopulation is functional: a spatial aggregation carries exactly one k-anonymity threshold, the single minimum population size below which its result is suppressed at projection time."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:minimumPopulation 是函数式的:一个空间聚合恰好携带一个 k-匿名阈值,即在投影时若结果所涉人口规模低于该单一最小值便会被抑制的那个数值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/modelIdentifierFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:modelIdentifier is functional: an inference run executes exactly one pinned model repository id, so a run naming two model ids would not identify a single reproducible execution."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:modelIdentifier 是函数式的:一次推理运行恰好执行一个被锁定的模型仓库标识,因此一次运行若指名两个模型标识,就无法标识出单一的可复现执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/modelRevisionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:modelRevision is functional: a run pins exactly one model revision/commit — the single most drift-prone coordinate of its reproducible identity — so two revisions on one run would name two different models rather than one execution."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:modelRevision 是函数式的:一次运行恰好锁定一个模型修订版本/提交——这是其可复现身份中最易漂移的坐标——因此同一次运行上的两个修订版本将指向两个不同的模型,而不是一次执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/modulationFromFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:modulationFromFrame is functional: a MetricModulation pivots away from exactly one source MusicalTimeFrame, so its origin frame is uniquely determined."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:modulationFromFrame 是函数式的:一个 MetricModulation 恰好从一个源 MusicalTimeFrame 转出,因此其起始参照系是唯一确定的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/modulationToFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:modulationToFrame is functional: a MetricModulation resolves into exactly one target MusicalTimeFrame, so its destination frame is uniquely determined."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:modulationToFrame 是函数式的:一个 MetricModulation 恰好解析进入一个目标 MusicalTimeFrame,因此其目的参照系是唯一确定的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/monetaryValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:monetaryValue is functional: a gmeow:MonetaryAmount has exactly one numeric value — a single xsd:decimal amount."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:monetaryValue 是函数式的:一个 gmeow:MonetaryAmount 恰好拥有一个数值——单一的 xsd:decimal 金额。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/mythFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:mythFrame is functional: a Myth holds its in-myth claims true under exactly one narrative reference frame, the single standpoint every accordingTo-scoped claim of that myth is measured against."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:mythFrame 是函数式的:一个 Myth 恰好在一个叙事参照系下将其神话内部的断言视为真,该神话中每一个由 accordingTo 界定范围的断言都依据这一唯一立场来衡量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/nameLanguageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:nameLanguage is functional: an appellation's surface form is in exactly one gmeow:Language, because co-equal multilingual names are modelled as separate co-equal gmeow:Appellation instances (one per language) rather than by multi-tagging a single name — the discipline that keeps naming anti-colonial and symmetric."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:nameLanguage 是函数式的:一个称谓的表层形式恰好属于一种 gmeow:Language,因为地位平等的多语言名称被建模为各自独立、地位平等的 gmeow:Appellation 实例(每种语言一个),而不是对单一名称进行多重标注——正是这一约束使命名保持反殖民性与对称性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/namePartTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:namePartType is functional: a single gmeow:NamePart has exactly one kind, since a component that is at once a surname and a patronymic is modelled as two distinct parts rather than one part bearing two types."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:namePartType 是函数式的:单个 gmeow:NamePart 恰好只有一种类型,因为一个同时既是姓氏又是父名的成分会被建模为两个不同的部分,而不是一个承载两种类型的部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/narrationSegmentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:narrationSegment is functional: a NarrationUsage reifies a single (segment, subject) seam, so it carries exactly one content segment — the one piece of carrying text whose narration the relator records."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:narrationSegment 是函数式的:一个 NarrationUsage 恰好具体化一个(片段,主体)接合点,因此它恰好携带一个内容片段——即该关系体所记录其叙述行为的那一段承载文本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/narrationSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:narrationSubject is functional: a NarrationUsage is minted one per (segment, subject) pair, so it names exactly one narrated diegetic subject — a chapter narrating four events with modes is four relators, never one relator with four subjects."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:narrationSubject 是函数式的:一个 NarrationUsage 是按每个(片段,主体)对创建一次的,因此它恰好指名一个被叙述的故事内主体——一个以多种模式叙述四个事件的章节对应四个关系体,绝不是一个承载四个主体的单一关系体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/narrativeFrameLinkRelationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:narrativeFrameLinkRelation is functional: a NarrativeFrameLink reifies one directed source-to-target binding, so it pins exactly one relation type — two frames standing in several relations (canon and adaptation from different standpoints) are several links, not one link carrying several relation types, which is precisely how the reified relator differs from the non-functional flat gmeow:hasNarrativeFrameRelation shortcut."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:narrativeFrameLinkRelation 是函数式的:一个 NarrativeFrameLink 恰好具体化一个从源到目标的有向绑定,因此它固定恰好一种关系类型——两个参照系之间存在多种关系(例如从不同立场出发的正典关系与改编关系)对应多个链接,而不是一个链接携带多种关系类型,这正是被具体化的关系体与非函数式的扁平快捷方式 gmeow:hasNarrativeFrameRelation 的区别所在。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/narrativeFrameLinkSourceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:narrativeFrameLinkSource is functional: a NarrativeFrameLink binds a single directed frame-to-frame relation, so it has exactly one source frame — the reified relator would lose its directionality if one link admitted several sources."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:narrativeFrameLinkSource 是函数式的:一个 NarrativeFrameLink 绑定单一的有向参照系到参照系关系,因此它恰好有一个源参照系——如果一个链接允许多个源,被具体化的关系体就会失去其方向性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/narrativeFrameLinkTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:narrativeFrameLinkTarget is functional: a NarrativeFrameLink binds a single directed frame-to-frame relation, so it has exactly one target frame — a source frame relating to several targets is several links, each pinning its own target."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:narrativeFrameLinkTarget 是函数式的:一个 NarrativeFrameLink 绑定单一的有向参照系到参照系关系,因此它恰好有一个目标参照系——一个源参照系关联多个目标即对应多个链接,每个链接各自固定自己的目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/narrativeRoleBearerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:narrativeRoleBearer is functional: a RoleInNarrative reifies one character's role within one scope, so it has exactly one bearer — two characters sharing a role are two relators, never one relator with two bearers."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:narrativeRoleBearer 是函数式的:一个 RoleInNarrative 恰好在一个范围内具体化一个角色的作用,因此它恰好有一个承担者——两个共享同一作用的角色对应两个关系体,绝不是一个拥有两个承担者的单一关系体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/narrativeRoleScopeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:narrativeRoleScope is functional: a RoleInNarrative is relative to exactly one scope — protagonist-of-the-trilogy and protagonist-of-one-chapter are different relators — because protagonist-of-what is half the claim, and a single relator cannot straddle two scopes."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:narrativeRoleScope 是函数式的:一个 RoleInNarrative 恰好相对于一个范围而言——三部曲的主角与单一章节的主角是不同的关系体——因为主角之于何物正是断言的一半内容,单一关系体不能同时跨越两个范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/narrativeRoleValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:narrativeRoleValue is functional: a RoleInNarrative bears exactly one role value, so a character who is both mentor and foil within one scope carries two separate relators rather than one relator holding two roles."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:narrativeRoleValue 是函数式的:一个 RoleInNarrative 恰好承载一个角色值,因此在同一范围内既是导师又是衬托角色的人物,携带两个独立的关系体,而不是一个持有两种角色的单一关系体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/narrativeTimeAxisFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:narrativeTimeAxis is functional: a NarrativeTimeFrame measures exactly one axis kind, either discourse time or story time, so a telling work and its fabula are two frames rather than one frame with two moods."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:narrativeTimeAxis 是函数式的:一个 NarrativeTimeFrame 恰好度量一种轴类型,要么是话语时间,要么是故事时间,因此一部叙述作品与其故事素是两个参照系,而不是一个具有两种模式的参照系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/networkAddressFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:networkAddressFrame is functional: a network address is stated in one topology-only reference frame (IPv4, IPv6, MAC, …), so exactly one frame situates it within the network."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:networkAddressFrame 是函数式的:一个网络地址是在一个仅涉及拓扑的参照系中(IPv4、IPv6、MAC 等)陈述的,因此恰好一个参照系将其定位于网络之中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/networkAddressValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:networkAddressValue is functional: a NetworkAddress denotes one endpoint and carries a single literal string (an IP, MAC, DNS name, URL, or port), so distinct addresses are distinct NetworkAddress instances."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:networkAddressValue 是函数式的:一个 NetworkAddress 表示一个端点,并携带一个单一的字面字符串(IP、MAC、DNS 名称、URL 或端口),因此不同的地址对应不同的 NetworkAddress 实例。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/normFunctionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:normFunction is functional: a derived intensity is computed under exactly one declared math:Norm — a single Gram-induced ‖x‖=√(xᵀGx) — so two norms on one intensity would yield two incompatible magnitudes for the same reading."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:normFunction 是函数式的:一个派生强度是在恰好一个已声明的 math:Norm 下计算的——单一的由 Gram 矩阵导出的 ‖x‖=√(xᵀGx)——因此同一强度上的两个范数会为同一读数得出两个不相容的量值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/normalizationKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:normalizationKind is functional: an effective vector space commits to exactly one postprocessing/normalization strategy that folds into its digest identity, because normalized and un-normalized vectors are not one comparable space; a single gmeow:VectorSpaceContract therefore fixes one gmeow:NormalizationKind, never two."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:normalizationKind 是函数式的:一个有效向量空间恰好确定一种被纳入其摘要身份的后处理/归一化策略,因为已归一化与未归一化的向量并非同一个可比较的空间;因此单一的 gmeow:VectorSpaceContract 只固定一个 gmeow:NormalizationKind,绝不会是两个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/notFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:not is functional: a strong-negation formula negates exactly one sub-formula — explicit classical negation over a single operand — kept distinct from negation-as-failure, which is a body-literal flag (logic:negatedBody) and never a formula-level connective."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:not 是函数式的:一个强否定公式恰好否定一个子公式——即对单一操作数施加的显式经典否定——它与失败即否定保持区分,后者是一个体字面量标志(logic:negatedBody),绝非公式层面的联结词。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/notationSystemOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:notationSystemOf is functional: a gmeow:NotationProjectionProfile describes exactly one notation system."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:notationSystemOf 是函数式的:一个 gmeow:NotationProjectionProfile 恰好描述一种记谱系统。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/notationUsageIntervalFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:notationUsageInterval is functional: a gmeow:NotationSystemUsage relator holds over exactly one time interval, and a different interval is a distinct usage episode."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:notationUsageInterval 是函数式的:一个 gmeow:NotationSystemUsage 关系体恰好在一个时间区间内成立,不同的区间构成一个独立的使用事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/notationUsageNotationSystemFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:notationUsageNotationSystem is functional: a gmeow:NotationSystemUsage records the use of exactly one notation system."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:notationUsageNotationSystem 是函数式的:一个 gmeow:NotationSystemUsage 恰好记录一种记谱系统的使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/notationUsageRoleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:notationUsageRole is functional: a gmeow:NotationSystemUsage plays exactly one role (transcription, encoding, representation, communication, expression, shorthand, or cipher), and a different role is a distinct usage."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:notationUsageRole 是函数式的:一个 gmeow:NotationSystemUsage 恰好扮演一种角色(转写、编码、表示、交流、表达、速记或密码),不同的角色构成不同的使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/notationUsageTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:notationUsageTarget is functional: a gmeow:NotationSystemUsage has exactly one target entity that uses the notation system."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:notationUsageTarget 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:NotationSystemUsage 恰好有一个使用该记谱系统的目标实体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/objectiveValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:objectiveValue is functional: a goal evaluation carries exactly one objective value — the single measured quantity an optimization goal extremizes, read against the direction and unit-frame on logic:objectiveDirection — never folded together with a truth value or an uncertainty measure."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:objectiveValue 是函数性的:一次目标评估恰好携带一个目标值——即优化目标要极值化的单一测量量,依据 logic:objectiveDirection 上的方向和单位框架来解读——绝不与真值或不确定性度量混为一谈。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/obligationForbiddenPredicateFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:obligationForbiddenPredicate is functional: a non-entailment obligation forbids exactly one predicate — the single xsd:anyURI the closure must never contain and no rule head may produce — so the discharge check reads one IRI to prove unreachable over the strata or absent from the materialized closure."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:obligationForbiddenPredicate 是函数性的:一项非蕴含义务恰好禁止一个谓词——即闭包绝不能包含、且任何规则头都不得产生的单一 xsd:anyURI——因此履行检查只需读取一个 IRI,以证明其在各层级中不可达或不存在于物化闭包中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/observationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:observation is functional: an action schema reveals exactly one observation — the single seam to the cognitive layer whose logic:reveals a policy branches on — so the value a later action's branch is conditioned upon is one facet per schema, not a set."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:observation 是函数性的:一个动作模式恰好揭示一个观察——即通向认知层的单一接缝,策略据其 logic:reveals 进行分支——因此后续动作分支所依据的值,每个模式只有一个方面,而非一个集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/observationMethodFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:observationMethod is functional: a gmeow:Observation was produced by exactly one method — a single protocol, with a compound procedure modelled as one fused method individual (for example 'GPS-RTK survey with ground control') rather than several method values."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:observationMethod 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Observation 恰好由一种方法产生——单一协议,复合流程被建模为一个融合后的方法个体(例如 'GPS-RTK survey with ground control'),而非多个方法值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/observedAtFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:observedAt is functional: a dated gmeow:Observation has exactly one time index — a single reading of its quality is taken at one moment, which is what orders a quality's observations into a value-history."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:observedAt 是函数性的:一个带日期的 gmeow:Observation 恰好有一个时间索引——其质量的单次读数是在某一时刻获取的,正是这一点将某一质量的诸观察排列成一个数值历史。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/observedFeatureFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:observedFeature is functional: a gmeow:Observation concerns exactly one feature of interest — the single individual whose property or state that observation records, even though the feature's type is left open."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:observedFeature 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Observation 恰好涉及一个关注特征——该观察所记录其属性或状态的唯一个体,即便该特征的类型仍未限定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/occupancyOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:occupancyOf is functional: an occupancy measurement is constitutively about exactly one location, since the count it reports belongs to a single locus, so a second location would be a different measurement."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:occupancyOf 是函数性的:一次占用量测在构成上恰好关于一个地点,因为它所报告的计数属于单一场所,若涉及第二个地点则将是另一次不同的量测。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/opacityReasonFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:opacityReason is functional: a gmeow:OpaqueFrame has exactly one reason for its opacity — a single cause, an encrypt-class codec without a key, a codec the reader lacks, or damage, since opacity without a stated reason would be indistinguishable from data loss."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:opacityReason 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:OpaqueFrame 恰好有一个不透明原因——单一成因,可能是缺少密钥的加密类编解码器、读取方所不具备的编解码器,或是损坏,因为没有说明原因的不透明将与数据丢失无法区分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/opaqueFrameInFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:opaqueFrameIn is functional: a gmeow:OpaqueFrame belongs to exactly one segment — a frame occupies a single position in one segment's chain."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:opaqueFrameIn 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:OpaqueFrame 恰好属于一个片段——一帧在某一个片段的链中占据单一位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/opensAtFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:opensAt is functional: a gmeow:OpeningHoursSpecification window has exactly one opening time, a single xsd:time that bounds where the window starts."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:opensAt 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:OpeningHoursSpecification 时间窗恰好有一个开始时间,即界定该窗口起点的单一 xsd:time。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/orderAmountFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:orderAmount is functional: an order has exactly one canonical total amount — the single MonetaryAmount agreed between the buyer and the seller."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:orderAmount 是函数性的:一个订单恰好有一个规范总额——买卖双方约定的单一 MonetaryAmount。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ornamentProfileKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:ornamentProfileKind is functional: an OrnamentProfile is classified under exactly one ornament-profile kind, so a single kind fixes its gestural family (gamaka, baroque agrément, and the like)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:ornamentProfileKind 是函数性的:一个 OrnamentProfile 恰好归类于一种装饰音型类型,单一类型即确定其手势家族(如 gamaka、巴洛克 agrément 等)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ornamentReferenceFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:ornamentReferenceFrame is functional: an OrnamentProfile's pitch gestures are expressed relative to exactly one TuningSystem reference frame, so a single frame anchors them (Principle 11)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:ornamentReferenceFrame 是函数性的:一个 OrnamentProfile 的音高手势恰好相对于一个 TuningSystem 参照系表达,单一参照系为其提供锚定(原则11)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/overVectorSpaceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:overVectorSpace is functional: a similarity observation's proximity is meaningful only within a single vector space, since a proximity stated across two contracts is ill-formed; the observation therefore names exactly one gmeow:VectorSpaceContract its vectors share, never two."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:overVectorSpace 是函数性的:相似度观察的邻近度只有在单一向量空间内才有意义,因为跨两份契约陈述的邻近度是不良形式的;因此该观察恰好指明其向量所共享的一个 gmeow:VectorSpaceContract,绝不指明两个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/overlayAuthorityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:overlayAuthority is functional: a regulatory overlay is imposed by one authority, and overlapping claims by different bodies are modelled as separate standpoint-indexed overlays, so exactly one authority imposes each (Principle 9)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:overlayAuthority 是函数性的:一个监管叠加层由一个权威机构施加,不同机构相互重叠的主张被建模为按立场分别索引的独立叠加层,因此每个叠加层恰好由一个权威机构施加(原则9)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/overlayDesignatorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:overlayDesignator is functional: the authority's code for an overlay (an ICAO airspace identifier, a NOTAM number, a fisheries-zone code) is constitutive of its administrative identity, so an overlay bears exactly one designator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:overlayDesignator 是函数性的:权威机构为某叠加层赋予的代码(ICAO 空域标识符、NOTAM 编号、渔业区代码)构成其行政身份,因此一个叠加层恰好带有一个指定标识符。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/overlayPlaceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:overlayPlace is functional: a regulatory overlay applies over exactly one place that carries its geometry, and the place is constitutive of the overlay's identity, so a second place would be a different overlay."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:overlayPlace 是函数性的:一个监管叠加层恰好作用于一个承载其几何形状的地点,该地点构成叠加层的身份,因此第二个地点将构成另一个不同的叠加层。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/pagePrincipalSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pagePrincipalSubject is functional: a web page is primarily about exactly one entity — the single principal subject it represents — even though it may mention many others through the broader gmeow:isAbout it specialises."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pagePrincipalSubject 是函数性的:一个网页恰好主要关于一个实体——它所代表的唯一主要主题——即便它通过其所特化的更广泛的 gmeow:isAbout 可能提及许多其他实体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/parameterEntityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:parameterEntity is functional: a condition parameter resolves to exactly one bound entity, and a parameter carries at most one of an entity binding or a literal binding, never two."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:parameterEntity 是函数性的:一个条件参数恰好解析为一个绑定实体,且一个参数至多携带实体绑定或字面量绑定二者之一,绝不同时携带两者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/parameterNameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:parameterName is functional: a condition parameter has exactly one name — the single key by which the condition text or its expressions reference the binding."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:parameterName 是函数性的:一个条件参数恰好有一个名称——条件文本或其表达式据以引用该绑定的唯一键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/parameterValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:parameterValue is functional: a condition parameter resolves to exactly one bound literal, and a parameter carries at most one of a literal binding or an entity binding, never two."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:parameterValue 是函数性的:一个条件参数恰好解析为一个绑定字面量,且一个参数至多携带字面量绑定或实体绑定二者之一,绝不同时携带两者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/parentFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:parentFrame is functional: a reference frame nests under a single parent in its frame hierarchy (a TF transform tree or Internet topology), so it has exactly one parent frame and the hierarchy forms a tree rather than a tangle."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:parentFrame 是函数性的:一个参照系在其参照系层级(TF 变换树或互联网拓扑)中嵌套于单一父级之下,因此它恰好有一个父参照系,该层级构成一棵树而非纠缠的网络。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/partOrderFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:partOrder is functional: a gmeow:NamePart occupies exactly one 0-based position in its appellation's surface order — a component has a single place as actually written in its culture."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:partOrder 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:NamePart 在其称谓的表层顺序中恰好占据一个从0开始的位置——一个组成部分在其文化中实际书写时只有一个位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/participantAddressFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:participantAddress is functional: a MessageParticipant reifies a single occurrence of one address in a header or envelope context, so the normalized address that appears in that occurrence is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:participantAddress 是函数性的:一个 MessageParticipant 具体化了在报头或信封语境中某一地址的单次出现,因此该次出现中呈现的规范化地址是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/participantHeaderFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:participantHeader is functional: a MessageParticipant reifies one address occurrence parsed from a single RFC 5322 header field, so the source header of that occurrence is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:participantHeader 是函数性的:一个 MessageParticipant 具体化了从单一 RFC 5322 报头字段解析出的一次地址出现,因此该次出现的来源报头是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/participantMessageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:participantMessage is functional: a MessageParticipant reifies an address occurrence that belongs to exactly one message, so the message the occurrence belongs to is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:participantMessage 是函数性的:一个 MessageParticipant 具体化了恰好属于一条消息的地址出现,因此该次出现所属的消息是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/participantOrdinalFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:participantOrdinal is functional: a MessageParticipant occupies one zero-based position among the address occurrences of its header, so its ordinal is a single value."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:participantOrdinal 是函数性的:一个 MessageParticipant 在其报头的诸地址出现中占据一个从零开始的位置,因此其序号是单一值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/participantRoleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:participantRole is functional: a MessageParticipant reifies one address occurrence that plays exactly one header or envelope role, so the role of that occurrence is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:participantRole 是函数性的:一个 MessageParticipant 具体化了恰好扮演一种报头或信封角色的地址出现,因此该次出现的角色是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/participationConfigurationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:participationConfiguration is functional: a single PerformanceParticipation relator records exactly one InstrumentConfiguration, so the configuration used is uniquely determined per relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:participationConfiguration 是函数性的:单个 PerformanceParticipation 关系元恰好记录一个 InstrumentConfiguration,因此每个关系元所用的配置都是唯一确定的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/participationEventFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:participationEvent is functional: a gmeow:Participation is part of exactly one event, so participation in another event is a distinct participation relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:participationEvent 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Participation 恰好是一个事件的一部分,因此参与另一事件将构成一个不同的参与关系元。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/participationInstrumentItemFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:participationInstrumentItem is functional: each PerformanceParticipation relator names exactly one specific instrument item — the particular instrument, plugin, or kit played — so the item is uniquely fixed per relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:participationInstrumentItem 是函数性的:每个 PerformanceParticipation 关系元恰好指明一个具体的乐器项——所演奏的特定乐器、插件或乐器组——因此该项在每个关系元中都是唯一确定的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/participationPartFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:participationPart is functional: a PerformanceParticipation relator captures exactly one part or role the participant performed, so the part is uniquely fixed per relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:participationPart 是函数性的:一个 PerformanceParticipation 关系元恰好捕获参与者所演绎的一个声部或角色,因此该声部在每个关系元中都是唯一确定的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/participationTechniqueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:participationTechnique is functional: a PerformanceParticipation relator records exactly one PlayingTechnique, so the technique used is uniquely fixed per relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:participationTechnique 是函数性的:一个 PerformanceParticipation 关系元恰好记录一个 PlayingTechnique,因此每个关系元所用的技巧都是唯一确定的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/penaltyPoleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:penaltyPole is functional: a criterion has exactly one penalty pole — the single named low end it penalizes — which must further be a different pole from the one it rewards."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:penaltyPole 是函数性的:一个准则恰好有一个惩罚极——它所惩罚的唯一命名低端——该极还必须不同于其奖励的那一极。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/perceptionEnvironmentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:perceptionEnvironment is functional: a sensory perception is about exactly one sensory environment, its single observed feature of interest."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:perceptionEnvironment 是函数性的:一次感官知觉恰好关于一个感官环境,即其唯一被观察的关注特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/perceptionModalityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:perceptionModality is functional: a sensory perception is made through exactly one sensory channel, the single modality on which that perceived value is registered."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:perceptionModality 是函数性的:一次感官知觉恰好通过一个感官通道进行,即记录该感知值的唯一模态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/periodEndFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:periodEnd is functional: a gmeow:NamedPeriod closes at a single boundary gmeow:Instant, since an era with two distinct end instants would be two periods and a still-ongoing period omits it rather than naming several."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:periodEnd 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:NamedPeriod 恰好终止于一个边界 gmeow:Instant,因为具有两个不同结束时刻的纪元将构成两个时期,而仍在进行中的时期则省略该值,而非指定多个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/personaBearerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:personaBearer is functional: a persona is the reified expression policy of exactly one agent — an agent may bear many co-equal personas, but each persona traces to a single bearer."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:personaBearer 是函数性的:一个人设是恰好一个主体的具体化表达策略——一个主体可以承载多个地位平等的人设,但每个人设都可追溯到唯一一个承载者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/pitchAnchorOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pitchAnchorOf is functional: a PitchAnchor is defined for exactly one TuningSystem, so its owning system is uniquely determined."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pitchAnchorOf 是函数性的:一个 PitchAnchor 恰好为一个 TuningSystem 定义,因此其所属系统是唯一确定的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/pitchDegreeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pitchDegree is functional: a PitchValue carries at most one tuning-system degree index, so its degree is a single integer (degree 0 origin, degree 7 the fifth in 12-EDO)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pitchDegree 是函数性的:一个 PitchValue 至多携带一个调音系统度数索引,因此其度数是单一整数(0度为起点,7度为十二平均律中的五度)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/pivotSourceValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pivotSourceValue is functional: a MetricModulation's pivot equivalence has exactly one source-side rational value, so its source string is single."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pivotSourceValue 是函数性的:一个 MetricModulation 的枢轴等价关系恰好有一个源端有理数值,因此其源字符串是唯一的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/pivotTargetValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pivotTargetValue is functional: a MetricModulation's pivot equivalence has exactly one target-side rational value, so its target string is single."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pivotTargetValue 是函数性的:一个 MetricModulation 的枢轴等价关系恰好有一个目标端有理数值,因此其目标字符串是唯一的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/pixelHeightFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pixelHeight is functional: a media object has exactly one height in pixels, since a single raster manifestation has one vertical dimension and distinct renditions are distinct gmeow:MediaObject carriers rather than two heights on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pixelHeight 是函数性的:一个媒体对象恰好有一个像素高度,因为单一栅格呈现只有一个纵向尺寸,不同的呈现形式是不同的 gmeow:MediaObject 载体,而非在同一载体上有两个高度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/pixelWidthFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pixelWidth is functional: a media object has exactly one width in pixels, since a single raster manifestation has one horizontal dimension and distinct renditions are distinct gmeow:MediaObject carriers rather than two widths on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pixelWidth 是函数性的:一个媒体对象恰好有一个像素宽度,因为单一栅格呈现只有一个横向尺寸,不同的呈现形式是不同的 gmeow:MediaObject 载体,而非在同一载体上有两个宽度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/planGoalFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:planGoal is functional: a plan has exactly one success criterion — the single gmeow:Goal its steps, invoking action schemas, are arranged to reach — against which its success over nondeterministic outcomes is quantified by logic:planSuccessMode."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:planGoal 是函数性的:一个计划恰好有一个成功准则——其调用动作模式的各步骤被安排以达成的唯一 gmeow:Goal——计划在非确定性结果上的成功程度依据 logic:planSuccessMode 相对该目标进行量化。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/planSuccessModeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:planSuccessMode is functional: a plan declares exactly one logic:PlanSuccessMode quantifying its success over the nondeterministic outcomes of its action schemas — a single choice of whether some, every, or every fair execution must reach the goal, never two quantifications at once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:planSuccessMode 是函数性的:一个计划恰好声明一个 logic:PlanSuccessMode,用以量化其在动作模式非确定性结果上的成功程度——即在某些执行、所有执行或所有公平执行必须达成目标之间做出的单一选择,绝不同时存在两种量化方式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/plusCodeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:plusCode is functional: a Geocode holds one Open Location Code identifying a single cell on Earth, so a different Plus Code would denote a different location and thus a different Geocode."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:plusCode 是函数性的:一个 Geocode 持有一个 Open Location Code,用以标识地球上唯一一个单元格,因此不同的 Plus Code 将指代不同的地点,从而也是不同的 Geocode。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/poolingKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:poolingKind is functional: an embedding family commits to exactly one token-to-sequence pooling strategy as a generation-contract choice, because differently-pooled vectors are not one family even under one model; the family therefore fixes a single gmeow:PoolingKind that folds into its digest identity."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:poolingKind 是函数性的:一个嵌入族作为生成契约的选择,恰好确定一种从词元到序列的池化策略,因为即便在同一模型下,以不同方式池化得到的向量也不属于同一个族;因此该族固定唯一一个 gmeow:PoolingKind,并将其纳入摘要身份之中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/positionFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:positionFrame is functional: a NarrativePosition is expressed in exactly one narrative time frame — the single coordinate system that gives its ordinal and label meaning — since a position without its one frame is the bare-integer anti-pattern the class exists to forbid."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:positionFrame 是函数性的:一个 NarrativePosition 恰好在一个叙事时间框架中表达——赋予其序数和标签意义的唯一坐标系统——因为没有其唯一框架的位置正是该类存在的目的所要禁止的裸整数反模式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/positionOrdinalFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:positionOrdinal is functional: a NarrativePosition has exactly one ordinal coordinate within its frame, so a chapter index and a fabula sequence number for the same diegetic moment live on different positions in different frames, never as two ordinals on one position."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:positionOrdinal 是函数性的:一个 NarrativePosition 在其框架内恰好有一个序数坐标,因此同一叙事内时刻的章节索引与故事(fabula)序号分别存在于不同框架中的不同位置,而绝不作为同一位置上的两个序数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/postInFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:postIn is functional: a gmeow:Post belongs to exactly one organization, and the same post in another organization would be a distinct post."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:postIn 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Post 恰好属于一个组织,同一职位若在另一组织中则构成一个不同的职位。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/postalAddressFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:postalAddressFrame is functional: a postal address is expressed in exactly one postal/administrative reference frame against which its coordinate components are read, so the frame is single-valued — a value asserted without its one frame is ill-formed under CONSTITUTION P11."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:postalAddressFrame 是函数性的:一个邮政地址恰好在一个邮政/行政参照系中表达,其坐标分量据此参照系解读,因此该参照系是单值的——在 CONSTITUTION P11 之下,断言一个值而不带其唯一参照系是不良形式的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/postingAccountFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:postingAccount is functional: a posting affects exactly one ledger account — the single book-keeping account its amount debits or credits."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:postingAccount 是函数性的:一笔过账恰好影响一个总账账户——其金额借记或贷记的唯一记账账户。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/postingAmountFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:postingAmount is functional: a posting has exactly one amount — the single MonetaryAmount, in one explicit currency frame, that it debits or credits its ledger account."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:postingAmount 是函数性的:一笔过账恰好有一个金额——在一个明确货币框架下,借记或贷记其总账账户的单一 MonetaryAmount。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/postingDirectionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:postingDirection is functional: a posting is exactly one direction — a single debit or credit, never both, as the atomic unit of double-entry bookkeeping requires."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:postingDirection 是函数性的:一笔过账恰好是一个方向——单一的借方或贷方,绝不两者兼具,这正是复式记账法原子单位所要求的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/postingJournalEntryFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:postingJournalEntry is functional: a posting belongs to exactly one journal entry — the single balanced double-entry event it is one line of."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:postingJournalEntry 是函数性的:一笔过账恰好属于一条日记账分录——它作为其中一行所属的唯一一个平衡的复式记账事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/precedenceHigherFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:precedenceHigher is functional: a precedence tenure names exactly one prevailing norm — the single norm that took priority over the interval it records."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:precedenceHigher 是函数性的:一个优先权任期恰好指明一项优胜规范——在其所记录的区间内取得优先地位的唯一规范。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/precedenceLowerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:precedenceLower is functional: a precedence tenure names exactly one yielding norm — the single norm that gave way over the interval — which must further be a different norm from the one that prevailed."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:precedenceLower 是函数性的:一个优先权任期恰好指明一项让位规范——在该区间内让步的唯一规范——该规范还必须不同于取得优先地位的那项规范。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/precedenceScopeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:precedenceScope is functional: a precedence tenure holds within exactly one normative system, because a system orders only the norms it issues and cannot scope precedence over the world's."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:precedenceScope 是函数性的:一个优先权任期恰好在一个规范系统内成立,因为一个系统只能对其自身发布的规范排序,而不能将其优先权范围扩展到世界上所有规范之上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/premiseUsedFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:premiseUsed is functional: a gmeow:PremiseUse rests on exactly one premise, since the basing relation ties one use to the single fact it actually leans on and drawing on a second premise is a second premise-use."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:premiseUsed 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:PremiseUse 恰好依据一个前提,因为奠基关系将一次使用与其实际所依赖的唯一事实相联系,若依赖第二个前提则构成第二次前提使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/primeLimitFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:primeLimit is functional: a just-intonation TuningSystem admits exactly one largest prime factor bounding its interval ratios, so its prime limit is a single integer."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:primeLimit 是函数性的:一个纯律 TuningSystem 恰好承认一个限定其音程比的最大质因数,因此其质数极限是单一整数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/processKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:processKind is functional: a GenerativeProcess is of exactly one process kind, so a single kind classifies it as phasing, stochastic, verbal-score, rule-based, or algorithmic."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:processKind 是函数性的:一个 GenerativeProcess 恰好属于一种过程类型,单一类型将其归类为相位型(phasing)、随机型、口头乐谱型、基于规则型或算法型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/producedByFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:producedBy is functional: a classifier output is generated by exactly one inference run — its single provenance source (prov:wasGeneratedBy) — so it cannot be attributed to two producing runs."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:producedBy 是函数性的:一个分类器输出恰好由一次推理运行生成——其唯一的来源出处(prov:wasGeneratedBy)——因此它不能归因于两次生成运行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/proficiencyAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:proficiencyAgent is functional: a language-proficiency relator expresses the proficiency of exactly one agent, the identity-constituting party whose command of the language the reified proficiency is about."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:proficiencyAgent 是函数性的:一个语言能力关系元恰好表达一个主体的能力——该被具体化的能力所关乎的、构成其身份的对语言掌握程度的那一方。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/proficiencyLanguageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:proficiencyLanguage is functional: a language-proficiency relator concerns exactly one language, the constitutive subject the reified proficiency is a proficiency in."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:proficiencyLanguage 是函数性的:一个语言能力关系元恰好关乎一种语言——该被具体化的能力所属的构成性主题。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/proficiencyLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:proficiencyLevel is functional: a language-proficiency relator records exactly one attained level, the single gmeow:ProficiencyLevel value (such as cefrB2 or levelNative) it has reached."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:proficiencyLevel 是函数性的:一个语言能力关系元恰好记录一个已达到的等级——其所达到的唯一 gmeow:ProficiencyLevel 值(如 cefrB2 或 levelNative)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/proficiencyModalityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:proficiencyModality is functional: a language-proficiency relator rates exactly one skill modality, since a distinct proficiency is minted per (agent, language, modality) so that per-skill levels coexist rather than crowding one relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:proficiencyModality 是函数性的:一个语言能力关系元恰好评定一种技能模态,因为每个(主体、语言、模态)三元组都会创建一个独立的能力实例,从而使各技能等级并存,而不是挤在同一个关系元上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/proficiencyScaleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:proficiencyScale is functional: a language-proficiency relator measures its level on exactly one framework, the single gmeow:ProficiencyScale (CEFR, ILR, ACTFL, or self-reported) against which the attained level is read."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:proficiencyScale 是函数性的:一个语言能力关系元恰好依据一个框架衡量其等级——据以解读所达到等级的唯一 gmeow:ProficiencyScale(CEFR、ILR、ACTFL 或自我报告)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/profileMidpointFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:profileMidpoint is functional: an affect scale has at most one neutral/reference point, so a profile cannot declare two distinguished midpoints (and declares none when a tradition names no neutral point)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:profileMidpoint 是函数性的:一个情感量表至多有一个中性/参照点,因此一个量表画像不能声明两个不同的中点(而当某一传统未命名中性点时,则不声明任何中点)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/profilePolarityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:profilePolarity is functional: an affect scale is either bipolar (signed, with a neutral midpoint) or unipolar (a one-sided magnitude) but never both, so it carries exactly one polarity value."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:profilePolarity 是函数性的:一个情感量表要么是双极的(带符号,具有中性中点),要么是单极的(单向量值),但绝不能两者兼具,因此它恰好携带一个极性值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/profileRangeMaxFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:profileRangeMax is functional: an affect scale has exactly one upper bound to its range, so a second maximum would leave the interval the scale spans ill-defined."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:profileRangeMax 是函数性的:一个情感量表的取值范围恰好有一个上界,若存在第二个最大值,则该量表所覆盖的区间将变得定义不清。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/profileRangeMinFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:profileRangeMin is functional: an affect scale has exactly one lower bound to its range, so a second minimum would leave the interval the scale spans ill-defined."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:profileRangeMin 是函数性的:一个情感量表的取值范围恰好有一个下界,若存在第二个最小值,则该量表所覆盖的区间将变得定义不清。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/profileSurfaceKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:profileSurfaceKind is functional: a profile surface is exactly one view kind — container or manifest — so that the agreement constraints can pick out a projection's container operand and manifest operand unambiguously; a surface that were two kinds at once would collapse the very operands the container/manifest cross-check compares."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:profileSurfaceKind 是函数性的:一个配置文件表面恰好是一种视图类型——容器或清单——这样一致性约束才能明确地识别出投影的容器操作数和清单操作数;如果一个表面同时是两种类型,就会使容器/清单交叉检查所比较的操作数本身发生塌缩。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/profileSurfaceOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:profileSurfaceOf is functional: a profile surface is a view of exactly one embedding projection, so the container and manifest agreement constraints join two surfaces precisely through the single projection they share; a surface viewing two projections would have no well-defined projection to be cross-checked against."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:profileSurfaceOf 是函数性的:一个配置文件表面恰好是某一个内嵌投影的视图,这样容器与清单的一致性约束才能通过它们共享的唯一投影精确地连接两个表面;若一个表面对应两个投影,就没有明确定义的投影可供交叉检查。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/profileTransformFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:profileTransform is functional: a scale declares exactly one normalization/transform spec, so a profile cannot name two conflicting transforms for the same axis without making its declared normalization ambiguous."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:profileTransform 是函数性的:一个刻度恰好声明一个归一化/变换规范,因此一个配置文件不能为同一轴指定两个相互冲突的变换,否则其声明的归一化将变得含糊不清。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/programQueryFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:programQuery is functional: a reasoning program declares exactly one goal atom it resolves against its clause set — a single query whose logic:termVariable carriers are the answer variables the engine binds — distinct from the multi-valued logic:verdictProbe atoms and required to be present exactly once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:programQuery 是函数性的:一个推理程序恰好声明一个目标原子,该程序针对其子句集对其求解——这是一个单一查询,其 logic:termVariable 载体即引擎所绑定的答案变量——它不同于可多值的 logic:verdictProbe 原子,且要求恰好出现一次。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/projectHomepageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:projectHomepage is functional: a project has exactly one canonical homepage IRI — its single doap:homepage / schema:url landing point."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:projectHomepage 是函数性的:一个项目恰好拥有一个规范主页 IRI——即其唯一的 doap:homepage / schema:url 落地点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/projectionDeterminismFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:projectionDeterminism is functional: a gmeow:ProjectionReceipt carries exactly one determinism declaration, positively asserted so that non-determinism is never left silent."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:projectionDeterminism 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:ProjectionReceipt 恰好携带一个确定性声明,并且是正面断言的,以确保非确定性绝不会被默默略过。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/projectionKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:projectionKind is functional: a gmeow:ProjectionReceipt is exactly one projection shape — the single kind that folds into the receipt's content digest and selects which disclosure gates bite."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:projectionKind 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:ProjectionReceipt 恰好是一种投影形态——这一单一类型会折入该回执的内容摘要,并决定哪些披露门限生效。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/projectionSourceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:projectionSource is functional: a projection is generated over exactly one source artifact, so 'from which exact source?' resolves to a single content-addressed pack carrying its own gmeow:contentDigest; a projection bound to two sources would have no verifiable provenance anchor."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:projectionSource 是函数性的:一个投影恰好由一个源工件生成,因此「究竟来自哪个源?」这个问题会归结到唯一一个携带自身 gmeow:contentDigest 的内容寻址包;若一个投影绑定两个源,就没有可验证的来源锚点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/promptRoleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:promptRole is functional: a prompt occupies one conversational role — system, user, assistant, or tool — so a single prompt takes one role and a multi-role turn is modelled as several prompts rather than one prompt bearing several roles."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:promptRole 是函数性的:一条提示只占据一个对话角色——系统、用户、助手或工具——因此单条提示只承担一个角色,而多角色的一个回合会被建模为多条提示,而不是一条提示承担多个角色。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/pronounObjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pronounObject is functional: a gmeow:PronounSet has exactly one object (accusative) form — the single word that fills that one grammatical slot."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pronounObject 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:PronounSet 恰好拥有一个宾格(直接宾语)形式——填入该唯一语法槽位的那一个词。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/pronounPossessiveDeterminerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pronounPossessiveDeterminer is functional: a gmeow:PronounSet has exactly one possessive determiner form — the single word that fills that one grammatical slot."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pronounPossessiveDeterminer 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:PronounSet 恰好拥有一个物主限定词形式——填入该唯一语法槽位的那一个词。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/pronounPossessiveFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pronounPossessive is functional: a gmeow:PronounSet has exactly one possessive pronoun form — the single word that fills that one grammatical slot."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pronounPossessive 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:PronounSet 恰好拥有一个物主代词形式——填入该唯一语法槽位的那一个词。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/pronounReflexiveFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pronounReflexive is functional: a gmeow:PronounSet has exactly one reflexive form — the single word that fills that one grammatical slot."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pronounReflexive 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:PronounSet 恰好拥有一个反身形式——填入该唯一语法槽位的那一个词。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/pronounSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:pronounSubject is functional: a gmeow:PronounSet has exactly one subject (nominative) form — the single word that fills that one grammatical slot."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:pronounSubject 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:PronounSet 恰好拥有一个主格形式——填入该唯一语法槽位的那一个词。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/prototypeForFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:prototypeFor is functional: a gmeow:AffectPrototype names exactly one gmeow:EmotionType — the single emotion it is the typical signature of — since a prototype's identity is carried by that one type link, not by a stored classification verdict."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:prototypeFor 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:AffectPrototype 恰好指向一个 gmeow:EmotionType——它是该唯一情绪的典型特征——因为原型的身份由这唯一的类型链接承载,而不是由存储的分类判定承载。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/proximityToFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:proximityTo is functional: a proximity measurement is a relator between a source and one target entity, and the target is constitutive of the relator's identity, so measuring to a different target is a different measurement."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:proximityTo 是函数性的:一次邻近度测量是源与唯一目标实体之间的关系项(relator),而该目标构成该关系项身份的组成部分,因此针对不同目标的测量即为不同的测量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/quantityUncertaintyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:quantityUncertainty is functional: a math:Quantity carries exactly one epistemic uncertainty — a single figure (for example ±1σ) expressed in the same unit as its value."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:quantityUncertainty 是函数性的:一个 math:Quantity 恰好携带一个认知不确定度——一个以与其数值相同单位表示的单一数字(例如 ±1σ)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ratioDenominatorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:ratioDenominator is functional: an exact pitch or interval ratio has exactly one denominator, so a single positive integer fixes it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:ratioDenominator 是函数性的:一个精确的音高或音程比恰好有一个分母,因此由单一的正整数确定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ratioNumeratorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:ratioNumerator is functional: an exact pitch or interval ratio has exactly one numerator, so a single integer fixes it in the canonical rational form paired with ratioDenominator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:ratioNumerator 是函数性的:一个精确的音高或音程比恰好有一个分子,因此由单一整数在与 ratioDenominator 配对的规范有理形式中确定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/readingOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:readingOf is functional: an inscription reading observes exactly one source inscription, the single sign-bearing feature the reading interprets (rival readings of that inscription are separate InscriptionReading relators)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:readingOf 是函数性的:一次铭文释读恰好观察一个源铭文,即该释读所解读的唯一承载符号的特征(对同一铭文的不同释读是各自独立的 InscriptionReading 关系项)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/realizationModeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:realizationMode is functional: an Expression realizes its Work in one mode — notated, performed, improvised, oral, or machine-generated — so a notated and a performed rendition of the same Work are two Expressions, each with its single mode, rather than one Expression bearing several modes."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:realizationMode 是函数性的:一个「表达」以一种模式实现其「作品」——记谱、演奏、即兴、口传或机器生成——因此同一作品的记谱版本与演奏版本是两个各自只有一种模式的「表达」,而不是一个「表达」承载多种模式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/receiptKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:receiptKind is functional: a gmeow:LifecycleReceipt records exactly one decision kind."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:receiptKind 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:LifecycleReceipt 恰好记录一种决策类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/recoveryTransformFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:recoveryTransform is functional: a recovery case executes exactly one ordered source-to-view logic:Formula — the single universally-quantified implication whose antecedent is the complete source graph pattern and consequent the projected view pattern — where reversing the one implication would change which information must be recovered."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:recoveryTransform 是函数性的:一个恢复案例恰好执行一个有序的「源到视图」logic:Formula——这是唯一一个全称量化蕴含式,其前件是完整的源图模式,后件是投影视图模式——若反转这一蕴含式,就会改变必须恢复的信息内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/recurrenceRuleTextFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:recurrenceRuleText is functional: a gmeow:RecurrenceRule carries exactly one RFC 5545 RRULE string, projected directly to a single iCalendar RRULE."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:recurrenceRuleText 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:RecurrenceRule 恰好携带一个 RFC 5545 RRULE 字符串,直接投影为唯一的一个 iCalendar RRULE。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/referenceAuthorityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:referenceAuthority is functional: a cadastral reference is issued by one registry, land titles office, or surveying authority, so exactly one issuing authority stands behind it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:referenceAuthority 是函数性的:一个地籍参照由某一个登记机构、地契办公室或测量当局签发,因此恰好有一个签发权威机构支持它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/referenceJurisdictionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:referenceJurisdiction is functional: a cadastral reference is valid under one jurisdiction's legal framework (a country, state, province, or territory), so exactly one governing jurisdiction applies to it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:referenceJurisdiction 是函数性的:一个地籍参照在唯一一个司法辖区(一个国家、州、省或地区)的法律框架下有效,因此恰好有一个管辖司法辖区适用于它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/referenceValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:referenceValue is functional: a cadastral reference is one registry identifier string (a folio, title, lot, or parcel ID), so it carries exactly one value and a further identifier is a distinct CadastralReference."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:referenceValue 是函数性的:一个地籍参照就是一个登记标识符字符串(卷宗号、产权号、地块号或宗地编号),因此它恰好携带一个值,而另一个标识符则是一个不同的 CadastralReference。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/regionOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:regionOf is functional: a gmeow:ImageRegion is part of exactly one image — a bounded region belongs to the single gmeow:MediaObject it was cut from."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:regionOf 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:ImageRegion 恰好是某一张图像的一部分——一个有边界的区域属于其所裁切出的唯一一个 gmeow:MediaObject。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/regionSelectorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:regionSelector is functional: a gmeow:ImageRegion is described by exactly one selector — the single boundary specification that fixes its extent."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:regionSelector 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:ImageRegion 恰好由一个选择器描述——即确定其范围的唯一边界规范。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/registrationNumberFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:registrationNumber is functional: a trademark right carries the single registration number its issuing registry assigned, so one gmeow:Trademark relator bears exactly one; a mark registered separately in another registry (CIPO, USPTO, WIPO) is a distinct trademark right with its own number and its own relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:registrationNumber 是函数性的:一项商标权恰好携带其签发登记机构所分配的唯一注册号,因此一个 gmeow:Trademark 关系项恰好携带一个;在另一个登记机构(CIPO、USPTO、WIPO)单独注册的商标是一项不同的商标权,拥有自己的编号和自己的关系项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/relationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:relation is functional: an atomic-predication formula predicates exactly one reified relation (logic:Type) over its ordered arguments — predicating over a single relation individual per the HiLog reflection keeps the object level first-order rather than admitting a predicate variable."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:relation 是函数性的:一个原子谓词公式恰好针对其有序参数谓述一个具体化的关系(logic:Type)——按照 HiLog 反射方式对单一关系个体进行谓述,使对象层保持一阶,而不必引入谓词变量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/relationshipChildFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:relationshipChild is functional: a reified parent-child relationship names exactly one child, the single younger party of the dyadic relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:relationshipChild 是函数性的:一个具体化的亲子关系恰好指向一个子女——该二元关系项中唯一的年轻一方。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/relationshipParentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:relationshipParent is functional: a reified parent-child relationship names exactly one parent, so a child's two parents are two ParentChildRelationship relators rather than one relator carrying two parents."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:relationshipParent 是函数性的:一个具体化的亲子关系恰好指向一个父母,因此一个孩子的两个父母是两个 ParentChildRelationship 关系项,而不是一个承载两个父母的关系项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/relationshipSourceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:relationshipSource is functional: an extracted relationship has exactly one entity description at its tail, the single source endpoint of the directed edge."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:relationshipSource 是函数性的:一个抽取出的关系在其尾部恰好有一个实体描述——即该有向边唯一的源端点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/relationshipTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:relationshipTarget is functional: an extracted relationship has exactly one entity description at its head, the single target endpoint of the directed edge."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:relationshipTarget 是函数性的:一个抽取出的关系在其头部恰好有一个实体描述——即该有向边唯一的目标端点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/relayAtFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:relayAt is functional: a RelayHop is recorded by one Received header carrying a single server timestamp, so the time recorded for the hop is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:relayAt 是函数性的:一个 RelayHop 由携带单一服务器时间戳的一个 Received 头记录,因此该跳记录的时间是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/relayByFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:relayBy is functional: a RelayHop is the delivery action of a single relaying server, so the server that performed the hop is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:relayBy 是函数性的:一个 RelayHop 是单一中继服务器的投递动作,因此执行该跳的服务器是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/relayFromFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:relayFrom is functional: a RelayHop received the message from exactly one host, so the from-host it records is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:relayFrom 是函数性的:一个 RelayHop 恰好从一个主机接收消息,因此其记录的来源主机是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/relayProtocolFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:relayProtocol is functional: a RelayHop transported the message over one protocol (e.g. ESMTP, ESMTPS), so the protocol used for the hop is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:relayProtocol 是函数性的:一个 RelayHop 通过单一协议(例如 ESMTP、ESMTPS)传输消息,因此该跳所使用的协议是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/releaseOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:releaseOf is functional: a release event belongs to exactly one project — the single endeavour whose software that release ships."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:releaseOf 是函数性的:一个发布事件恰好属于一个项目——即该发布所交付软件所属的唯一项目。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/reminderActionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:reminderAction is functional: a reminder fires exactly one action — a single iCalendar ACTION (display, email, or audio) when it triggers."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:reminderAction 是函数性的:一个提醒触发时恰好执行一个动作——一个单一的 iCalendar ACTION(显示、电子邮件或音频)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/reminderTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:reminderTarget is functional: a reminder is attached to exactly one event — the single concrete occurrence whose start an offset trigger is measured from."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:reminderTarget 是函数性的:一个提醒恰好附着于一个事件——即偏移触发器据以计算的那个唯一具体发生实例的起始时间。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/repositoryTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:repositoryType is functional: a repository is managed by exactly one version-control system — a single RepositoryType value (git, hg, svn, fossil, …), never two VCSes at once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:repositoryType 是函数性的:一个仓库恰好由一个版本控制系统管理——一个单一的 RepositoryType 值(git、hg、svn、fossil 等),绝不会同时使用两个版本控制系统。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/reproducibilityLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:reproducibilityLevel is functional: a projection sits at exactly one point on the get-leg determinism axis — bit-exact, within-tolerance, or merely regenerable — drawn from a closed value set; regeneration cannot be simultaneously two of these, so a projection declares one level, not two."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:reproducibilityLevel 是函数性的:一个投影在取值(get 端)确定性轴上恰好处于一个点——逐位精确、在容差范围内,或仅可重新生成——取自一个封闭取值集合;重新生成不能同时处于其中两种状态,因此一个投影只声明一个层级,而非两个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/reproducibilityToleranceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:reproducibilityTolerance is functional: a within-tolerance projection is deemed reproduced under exactly one numeric bound, the single math:Quantity that makes gmeow:reproducibleWithinTolerance checkable; two competing tolerances would leave the within-tolerance claim ambiguous, so a projection carries one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:reproducibilityTolerance 是函数性的:一个「容差内」投影被认定为在恰好一个数值边界下得以重现,即使 gmeow:reproducibleWithinTolerance 可被核验的唯一 math:Quantity;两个相互竞争的容差会使「容差内」这一主张变得含糊,因此一个投影只携带一个容差。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/requiresHostFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:requiresHost is functional: the requirement is a single yes/no fact about a frame — whether its existence is bound to a hosting entity — so exactly one boolean flag holds for the frame."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:requiresHost 是函数性的:该要求是关于一个框架的单一是/否事实——即其存在是否依附于一个宿主实体——因此该框架恰好持有一个布尔标志。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/residenceMailboxFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:residenceMailbox is functional: a MailboxResidence reifies the time-scoped membership of a message in exactly one mailbox, so the mailbox the residence concerns is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:residenceMailbox 是函数性的:一个 MailboxResidence 具体化了某消息在恰好一个邮箱中、限定时间范围的归属关系,因此该驻留所涉及的邮箱是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/residentMessageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:residentMessage is functional: a MailboxResidence reifies the time-scoped residence of exactly one message, so the message the residence concerns is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:residentMessage 是函数性的:一个 MailboxResidence 具体化了恰好一条消息、限定时间范围的驻留关系,因此该驻留所涉及的消息是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/rewardPoleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:rewardPole is functional: a criterion has exactly one reward pole — the single named high end it rewards — which must further be a different pole from the one it penalizes."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:rewardPole 是函数性的:一个标准恰好有一个奖励极——它所奖励的唯一命名高端——并且该极必须不同于它所惩罚的那个极。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/rfcMessageIdFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:rfcMessageId is functional: a message bears exactly one canonical RFC 5322 Message-ID (generated by gmeow when the original lacks one), so its Message-ID is single-valued even where distinct bodies collide on the same identifier."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:rfcMessageId 是函数性的:一条消息恰好携带一个规范的 RFC 5322 Message-ID(当原始消息缺失该字段时由 gmeow 生成),因此即使不同的正文在同一标识符上发生冲突,其 Message-ID 也是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/rightOperandFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:rightOperand is functional: an atomic constraint compares its one dimension against exactly one literal value, so it carries a single tested value; a set of acceptable values is expressed with an isAnyOf-style gmeow:constraintOperator over one operand rather than by two right-operand literals."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:rightOperand 是函数性的:一个原子约束将其单一维度与恰好一个字面值进行比较,因此它携带单一的被测值;一组可接受的值应通过对一个操作数使用 isAnyOf 风格的 gmeow:constraintOperator 来表达,而不是使用两个右操作数字面值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/romanticOrientationValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:romanticOrientationValue is functional: a gmeow:RomanticOrientation facet names exactly one romantic-orientation value — a change of orientation is modelled as a new facet rather than a second value on this functional edge."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:romanticOrientationValue 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:RomanticOrientation 切面恰好指定一个浪漫取向值——取向的变化被建模为一个新的切面,而不是这条函数性边上的第二个值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/routeEndFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:routeEnd is functional: a route terminates at exactly one end node, the single destination that closes the path."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:routeEnd 是函数性的:一条路线恰好终止于一个终点节点——即封闭该路径的唯一目的地。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/routeKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:routeKind is functional: a route is classified by exactly one RouteKind value, the single domain (transit, flight, citation, dependency, and so on) in which its path is traversed."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:routeKind 是函数性的:一条路线恰好由一个 RouteKind 值分类——即其路径所遍历的唯一领域(交通、航班、引用、依赖等等)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/routeStartFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:routeStart is functional: a route originates at exactly one start node, the single point from which the path departs."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:routeStart 是函数性的:一条路线恰好起始于一个起点节点——即该路径出发的唯一起点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ruleActionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:ruleAction is functional: a deontic rule regulates exactly one action, so a permission, prohibition, or duty points at a single gmeow:RightsAction value; several regulated actions are modelled as several rules rather than as several actions crowded onto one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:ruleAction 是函数性的:一条道义规则恰好规制一个行为,因此一项许可、禁止或义务指向唯一一个 gmeow:RightsAction 值;多个受规制的行为应建模为多条规则,而不是将多个行为挤在一条规则上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ruleTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:ruleTarget is functional: when a rule overrides the target it inherits from its enclosing statement, it narrows to exactly one asset, so the target — where set — is a single entity; a permission covering several distinct assets is several rules rather than several targets on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:ruleTarget 是函数性的:当一条规则覆盖它从外层语句继承的目标时,它恰好收窄到一个资产,因此该目标(若已设定)是单一实体;涵盖多个不同资产的许可应建模为多条规则,而不是一条规则上的多个目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/samplePositionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:samplePosition is functional: an ArcSample reads at exactly one narrative position — the single WHERE that fixes the sample — since a sample without a position is not a sample, and a reading taken at another position is another sample."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:samplePosition 是函数性的:一个 ArcSample 恰好在一个叙事位置进行读取——即确定该样本的唯一「何处」——因为没有位置的样本不是样本,而在另一个位置读取的则是另一个样本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sampleStateFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sampleState is functional: an ArcSample records exactly one read state by IRI, so a blended reading at one position resolves into several samples sharing a vantage rather than one sample carrying several states — one cell, one state."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:sampleState 是函数性的:一个 ArcSample 恰好以一个 IRI 记录一个读取状态,因此在同一位置的混合读数会被分解为共享同一视角的多个样本,而不是一个样本携带多个状态——一格,一态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sampleSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sampleSubject is functional: an ArcSample reads exactly one subject — the single frame-scoped character or diegetic entity it observes — so a joint reading of two characters is two samples, not one sample with two subjects."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:sampleSubject 是函数性的:一个 ArcSample 恰好针对一个主体进行读取——即它所观察的、限定于某帧场景的唯一角色或叙事内实体——因此对两个角色的联合读取是两个样本,而不是一个具有两个主体的样本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/satisfactionDegreeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:satisfactionDegree is functional: a goal evaluation carries exactly one satisfaction degree — the single unit-interval measure of how much of the goal is achieved — distinct from the uncertainty measures, from logic:objectiveValue, and from logic:utility, none of which it substitutes for."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:satisfactionDegree 是函数性的:一次目标评估恰好携带一个满足度——即目标达成程度在单位区间上的唯一度量——它不同于不确定性度量、logic:objectiveValue 以及 logic:utility,也不能替代其中任何一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/satisfactionStatusFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:satisfactionStatus is functional: a goal evaluation carries exactly one logic:SatisfactionStatus — the satisfaction axis of the factored outcome — a single value that varies independently of the feasibility, lifecycle, and goal-evaluation axes yet is itself one-valued per evaluation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:satisfactionStatus 是函数性的:一次目标评估恰好携带一个 logic:SatisfactionStatus——即分解结果中的满足轴——这是一个独立于可行性、生命周期与目标评估各轴变化的单一值,但就每次评估而言其本身是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/scaleMaxFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:scaleMax is functional: a score scale has exactly one upper bound — a single maximum that must exceed the minimum — and a second maximum would leave the scale's ceiling undefined."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:scaleMax 是函数性的:一个评分刻度恰好有一个上界——一个必须大于最小值的单一最大值——若存在第二个最大值,该刻度的上限就会变得未定义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/scaleMinFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:scaleMin is functional: a score scale has exactly one lower bound — a single minimum that must sit below the maximum — and a second minimum would leave the scale's floor undefined."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:scaleMin 是函数性的:一个评分刻度恰好有一个下界——一个必须低于最大值的单一最小值——若存在第二个最小值,该刻度的下限就会变得未定义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/scaleStepFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:scaleStep is functional: a score scale has at most one granularity step — a single discrete increment when present, whose absence marks the scale as continuous."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:scaleStep 是函数性的:一个评分刻度至多有一个粒度步长——若存在,则为单一的离散增量;若不存在,则表明该刻度是连续的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sceneConfidenceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sceneConfidence is functional: a gmeow:SceneGraphEdge carries exactly one confidence value — a single decimal in [0.0, 1.0] quantifying that one asserted relation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:sceneConfidence 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SceneGraphEdge 恰好携带一个置信度值——一个位于 [0.0, 1.0] 区间内、量化该唯一被断言关系的单一小数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sceneObjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sceneObject is functional: a gmeow:SceneGraphEdge points at exactly one object region — the single gmeow:ImageRegion toward which its relation is directed."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:sceneObject 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SceneGraphEdge 恰好指向一个客体区域——即其关系所指向的唯一 gmeow:ImageRegion。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sceneRelationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sceneRelation is functional: a gmeow:SceneGraphEdge asserts exactly one relation — the single spatial or semantic tie it represents between its subject and object regions."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:sceneRelation 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SceneGraphEdge 恰好断言一种关系——即它在主体区域与客体区域之间所表示的唯一空间或语义联系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sceneSubjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sceneSubject is functional: a gmeow:SceneGraphEdge originates at exactly one subject region — the single gmeow:ImageRegion from which its relation proceeds."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:sceneSubject 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SceneGraphEdge 恰好源自一个主体区域——即其关系所出发的唯一 gmeow:ImageRegion。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/scheduleTemplateEventFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:scheduleTemplateEvent is functional: a schedule clones exactly one template event — the single anchor carrying the title, location, participants, and duration every generated occurrence inherits."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:scheduleTemplateEvent 是函数性的:一个日程恰好克隆一个模板事件——即每个生成的发生实例都继承其标题、地点、参与者和时长的唯一锚点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/scheduleTimeZoneFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:scheduleTimeZone is functional: a schedule expands its recurrence in exactly one time zone — the single IANA offset the occurrence engine reads when turning the rule into dated occurrences across DST boundaries."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:scheduleTimeZone 是函数性的:一个日程恰好在一个时区中展开其重复规则——即发生实例引擎在将规则转换为跨越夏令时边界的带日期发生实例时所读取的唯一 IANA 偏移量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/scoreSemanticsFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:scoreSemantics is functional: a classifier score has exactly one declared meaning — sigmoid, softmax probability, calibrated probability, logit, or margin — because one number cannot be two of those at once without becoming uninterpretable."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:scoreSemantics 是函数性的:一个分类器分数恰好具有一种声明的含义——sigmoid、softmax 概率、校准概率、logit 或间隔(margin)——因为同一个数字若同时是其中两种,就会变得无法解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/segmentIndexFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:segmentIndex is functional: a content segment occupies exactly one structural position within its containing whole — a single 1-based index locating it in that one container's ordering — while perspectival reorderings ride a separate gmeow:ReadingOrder standpoint rather than a second index."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:segmentIndex 是函数性的:一个内容片段在其所属整体中恰好占据一个结构位置——一个基于 1 的单一索引,用于在该容器的排序中定位它——而视角性的重新排序则依赖于独立的 gmeow:ReadingOrder 视点,而不是第二个索引。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/segmentKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:segmentKind is functional: a MusicalSegment is of exactly one kind (riff, motif, phrase, section, talea, color), with contested categorisations modelled as coexisting standpoints rather than multiple values (Principle 9)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:segmentKind 是函数性的:一个 MusicalSegment 恰好属于一种类型(riff、motif、phrase、section、talea、color),有争议的分类被建模为共存的立场而非多个值(原则 9)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/segmentMapRatioDenominatorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:segmentMapRatioDenominator is functional: a TempoMapSegment's constant mapping ratio has exactly one denominator, so a single positive integer fixes it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:segmentMapRatioDenominator 是函数性的:TempoMapSegment 的恒定映射比恰好只有一个分母,因此单个正整数即可将其确定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/segmentMapRatioNumeratorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:segmentMapRatioNumerator is functional: a TempoMapSegment's constant mapping ratio has exactly one numerator of musical units per clock unit, so a single integer fixes it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:segmentMapRatioNumerator 是函数性的:TempoMapSegment 的恒定映射比恰好只有一个以每时钟单位的音乐单位数表示的分子,因此单个整数即可将其确定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/segmentSpanFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:segmentSpan is functional: a segment applies over exactly one MusicalTimeSpan, so the span it covers is uniquely determined whether the subject is a TempoMapSegment or a MusicalSegment."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:segmentSpan 是函数性的:一个 segment 恰好作用于一个 MusicalTimeSpan,因此无论主体是 TempoMapSegment 还是 MusicalSegment,它所覆盖的时间跨度都被唯一确定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/segmentTempoMapKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:segmentTempoMapKind is functional: a TempoMapSegment follows exactly one curve kind, so a single kind fixes its tempo shape as constant, linear ramp, curve, or measured."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:segmentTempoMapKind 是函数性的:TempoMapSegment 恰好遵循一种曲线类型,因此单一类型即可将其速度形态确定为恒定、线性渐变、曲线或按小节测定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/segmentTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:segmentType is functional: a content segment is of exactly one structural kind — a single gmeow:ContentSegmentType value such as chapter, section, or scene — because the kind axis is carried as a property value rather than a subclass (Principle 9) and one segment cannot simultaneously be two structural kinds."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:segmentType 是函数性的:一个内容段落恰好属于一种结构类型——单一的 gmeow:ContentSegmentType 值,例如 chapter、section 或 scene——因为该类型轴是作为属性值而非子类来承载的(原则 9),一个段落不能同时属于两种结构类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/selectorTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:selectorType is functional: a gmeow:RegionSelector has exactly one encoding kind — the single gmeow:SelectorType telling a reader how to decode its boundary coordinates."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:selectorType 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:RegionSelector 恰好有一种编码类型——即告知读取者如何解码其边界坐标的唯一 gmeow:SelectorType。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sequenceEndFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sequenceEnd is functional: a sequence-coordinate tuple has one 1-based inclusive end position on its sequence, so exactly one integer end pins the feature's boundary within its assembly (Principle 11)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:sequenceEnd 是函数性的:一个序列坐标元组在其序列上只有一个从 1 开始计数的包含性结束位置,因此恰好一个整数结束值就能将该特征在其组装体中的边界确定下来(原则 11)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sequenceStartFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sequenceStart is functional: a sequence-coordinate tuple has one 1-based inclusive start position on its sequence, so exactly one integer start pins the feature's boundary within its assembly (Principle 11)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:sequenceStart 是函数性的:一个序列坐标元组在其序列上只有一个从 1 开始计数的包含性起始位置,因此恰好一个整数起始值就能将该特征在其组装体中的边界确定下来(原则 11)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sequenceStrandFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sequenceStrand is functional: a feature reads from one strand of a double-stranded biological sequence, so exactly one gmeow:StrandOrientation fixes its read direction."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:sequenceStrand 是函数性的:一个特征只从双链生物序列的一条链上读取,因此恰好一个 gmeow:StrandOrientation 就能确定其读取方向。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/serviceShutdownDateFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:serviceShutdownDate is functional: a historical online service ceases operation once, so the flat shutdown date that projects to schema:dissolutionDate is a single dissolution timestamp per service, with any evidence- or standpoint-bearing dispute promoted to a destruction LifeEvent instead of a rival flat date."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:serviceShutdownDate 是函数性的:一项历史性在线服务只会停止运营一次,因此投影到 schema:dissolutionDate 的这个扁平关闭日期对每项服务而言是单一的解散时间戳,任何带有证据或立场的争议都应升级为一个销毁类 LifeEvent,而不是一个与之竞争的扁平日期。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sessionConfigurationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sessionConfiguration is functional: an agent session runs under exactly one active configuration, the single session → configuration hop an output traces through to resolve the configuration it was generated under."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:sessionConfiguration 是函数性的:一个智能体会话恰好在一种活动配置下运行,即输出用以追溯并解析其生成时所依据配置的那唯一的会话→配置跳转。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sessionSubjectStageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sessionSubjectStage is functional: an agent session acts on behalf of exactly one subject stage, the single session → subject hop that lets an output resolve to its durable subject."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:sessionSubjectStage 是函数性的:一个智能体会话恰好代表一个主体阶段行事,即让输出得以解析到其持久主体的那唯一的会话→主体跳转。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sexualOrientationValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sexualOrientationValue is functional: a gmeow:SexualOrientation facet names exactly one sexual-orientation value — a change of orientation is modelled as a new facet rather than a second value on this functional edge."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:sexualOrientationValue 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SexualOrientation 切面恰好指明一个性取向值——取向的改变被建模为一个新的切面,而不是在这条函数性边上添加第二个值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/signatureAlgorithmFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:signatureAlgorithm is functional: a gmeow:CryptographicSignature was produced with exactly one algorithm, since one signing act uses one algorithm and a signature made with a different algorithm is a different signature."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:signatureAlgorithm 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:CryptographicSignature 恰好是用一种算法生成的,因为一次签名行为只使用一种算法,用不同算法生成的签名是另一份不同的签名。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/signingDomainFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:signingDomain is functional: a gmeow:CryptographicSignature asserts exactly one signing domain, since a single signature carries one claimed signing authority such as one DKIM d= tag."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:signingDomain 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:CryptographicSignature 恰好声明一个签名域,因为单一签名只承载一个所声称的签名机构,例如一个 DKIM d= 标签。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/signingKeyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:signingKey is functional: a gmeow:CryptographicSignature is produced by exactly one gmeow:CryptographicKey, since one signing act uses the one specific key whose binding to the signer a certification vouches for."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:signingKey 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:CryptographicSignature 恰好由一个 gmeow:CryptographicKey 生成,因为一次签名行为使用的是那唯一一把特定密钥,其与签名者之间的绑定由某项认证担保。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/similarityScoreFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:similarityScore is functional: a similarity observation carries exactly one magnitude — the graded proximity of its one operand pair under its one metric, grounded as a single math:Quantity; a second score would describe a different observation, not one claim with two proximities."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:similarityScore 是函数性的:一次相似度观测恰好携带一个量值——即其唯一一对操作数在其唯一一种度量下的分级接近度,以单一的 math:Quantity 为基础;第二个分数将描述另一次不同的观测,而不是同一断言携带两种接近度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/skillProficiencyAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:skillProficiencyAgent is functional: a gmeow:SkillProficiency expresses the proficiency of exactly one agent, whose identity is constitutive of the reified proficiency."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:skillProficiencyAgent 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SkillProficiency 恰好表达一个主体的技能水平,该主体的身份是这个具化技能水平记录的构成性要素。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/skillProficiencyLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:skillProficiencyLevel is functional: a gmeow:SkillProficiency records exactly one attained level (a single gmeow:ProficiencyLevel such as dreyfusExpert or assessedCompetent), and a second level would be a separate assessment."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:skillProficiencyLevel 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SkillProficiency 恰好记录一个已达到的等级(单一的 gmeow:ProficiencyLevel,例如 dreyfusExpert 或 assessedCompetent),第二个等级将构成一次独立的评估。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/skillProficiencyOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:skillProficiencyOf is functional: a gmeow:SkillProficiency concerns exactly one skill, constitutive of which proficiency it is."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:skillProficiencyOf 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SkillProficiency 恰好涉及一项技能,这正是它所记录之技能水平身份的构成性要素。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/skillProficiencyScaleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:skillProficiencyScale is functional: a gmeow:SkillProficiency's level is measured on exactly one scale (Dreyfus, NIH, assessed, or self-reported), so the same attainment read on another scale is a distinct proficiency record."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:skillProficiencyScale 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SkillProficiency 的等级恰好按一种量表(Dreyfus、NIH、经评估或自我报告)来衡量,因此同一成就若按另一种量表解读,便构成一条不同的技能水平记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/spanOfChunkFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:spanOfChunk is functional: an evidence span pins into exactly one retrieved chunk, so the seam joining the evidence layer to the retrieval substrate carries a single chunk per span and the exact evidentiary bytes stay recoverable through one span-to-chunk anchor."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:spanOfChunk 是函数性的:一个证据跨度恰好锚定在一个被检索到的分块上,因此连接证据层与检索基底的接缝对每个跨度只承载一个分块,确切的证据字节得以通过唯一一个跨度到分块的锚点保持可还原。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sparseAxisCompletionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:sparseAxisCompletion is functional: a profile declares exactly one boolean missing-axis policy — whether absent core-affect axes are zero-completed against the full basis — so it cannot both zero-complete and not."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:sparseAxisCompletion 是函数性的:一个画像恰好声明一个布尔型的缺失轴策略——即缺失的核心情感轴是否相对完整基向对齐做零值补全——因此它不能既做零值补全又不做。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/spdxLicenseIdFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:spdxLicenseId is functional: a licence has one canonical SPDX List identifier, so the property binds exactly one machine-readable id per licence; a dual or compound grant is a single SPDX licence expression carried within that one literal, not two separate ids on the same licence."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:spdxLicenseId 是函数性的:一项许可恰好拥有一个规范的 SPDX 列表标识符,因此该属性对每项许可只绑定一个机器可读的 id;双重或复合授权是承载在那一个字面量内的单一 SPDX 许可表达式,而不是同一许可上的两个独立 id。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/spelledNameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:spelledName is functional: a PitchSpelling produces exactly one note-name string, so its spelled name is single per relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:spelledName 是函数性的:一个 PitchSpelling 恰好产生一个音名字符串,因此每个关系体的拼写名称都是单一的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/spellingPitchFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:spellingPitch is functional: a PitchSpelling names exactly one frame-relative pitch value, so its pitch is single per relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:spellingPitch 是函数性的:一个 PitchSpelling 恰好指明一个相对于参照系的音高值,因此每个关系体的音高都是单一的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/spellingSystemFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:spellingSystem is functional: a PitchSpelling expresses its name in exactly one spelling system (CMN staff, sargam, Johnston), so its system is single per relator."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:spellingSystem 是函数性的:一个 PitchSpelling 恰好以一种拼写体系(CMN 五线谱、sargam、Johnston)表达其名称,因此每个关系体的体系都是单一的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/stageImplFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:stageImpl is functional: each gmeow:PipelineStage binds to exactly one Rust Stage implementation in the STAGE_REGISTRY and the loader hard-fails when the key resolves to no implementation, so a stage carries a single registry-key value."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:stageImpl 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:PipelineStage 恰好绑定到 STAGE_REGISTRY 中的一个 Rust Stage 实现,当该键无法解析出任何实现时加载器将硬性失败,因此一个阶段只携带一个注册表键值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/standpointClaimFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:standpointClaim is functional: a standpoint-tenure generates exactly one StandpointClaim observation of its time-scoped fact, so the bridge from the tenure situation to its observation carries a single claim and a free-standing claim with no tenure is minted as a bare observation instead."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:standpointClaim 是函数性的:一个立场保有恰好生成一个针对其限定时间之事实的 StandpointClaim 观测,因此从保有情境到其观测之间的桥梁只承载一个断言,没有保有的独立断言则改为铸造成一个纯粹的观测。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/startedAtTimeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:startedAtTime is functional: a gmeow:TimeInterval opens at a single crisp dateTime, since an interval with two start timestamps would be two intervals, making the inline start bound single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:startedAtTime 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:TimeInterval 恰好在单一确定的 dateTime 处开始,因为具有两个起始时间戳的区间实际上是两个区间,这使得内联的起始边界只能取单一值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/stateLanguageFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:stateLanguage is functional: a LanguageState relator describes the state of exactly one subject language, variety, or version — the single language whose status the reified claim is about."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:stateLanguage 是函数性的:一个 LanguageState 关系体恰好描述一种主体语言、变体或版本的状态——即该具化断言所关乎其状态的那唯一一种语言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/stateOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:stateOf is functional: a location state describes the presence, pose, and velocity of exactly one moving entity, so a state belongs to a single entity and one LocationState is never shared across entities."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:stateOf 是函数性的:一个位置状态恰好描述一个运动实体的存在、姿态与速度,因此一个状态归属于单一实体,一个 LocationState 绝不会在多个实体之间共享。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/stateReferenceFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:stateReferenceFrame is functional: a location state's pose and velocity are expressed against one frame, so exactly one reference frame situates it while nested-frame transformations remain a solver concern (Principle 12)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:stateReferenceFrame 是函数性的:一个位置状态的姿态与速度恰好相对于一个参照系表达,因此恰好一个参照系为其定位,而嵌套参照系之间的变换仍属于求解器要处理的问题(原则 12)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/storageMediumFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:storageMedium is functional: the medium of a storage location is constitutive of it — a different medium is a different store — so exactly one gmeow:StorageMedium classifies each, unlike the descriptive, multi-source gmeow:placeType."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:storageMedium 是函数性的:存储位置的介质是其构成性要素——不同的介质即是不同的存储体——因此恰好一个 gmeow:StorageMedium 对每个存储位置进行分类,这与描述性的、多来源的 gmeow:placeType 不同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/storyTimeOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:storyTimeOf is functional: a story-time frame coordinatizes the in-universe chronology of exactly one narrative reference frame, and a competing continuity carries its own story-time frame rather than a second anchoring on this one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:storyTimeOf 是函数性的:一个故事时间参照系恰好为一个叙事参照系的宇宙内编年史提供坐标,竞争性的连续性设定会携带其自身的故事时间参照系,而不是在这一个参照系上添加第二个锚定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/streamIntervalFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:streamInterval is functional: a gmeow:Stream was produced over exactly one time interval — the interval is constitutive of the stream's identity, so a different interval is a different stream."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:streamInterval 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Stream 恰好是在一个时间区间内产生的——该区间是该数据流身份的构成性要素,因此不同的区间即是不同的数据流。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/streamOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:streamOf is functional: a gmeow:Stream contains the observations of exactly one entity — a single moving feature, device, or tracked thing."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:streamOf 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Stream 恰好包含一个实体的观测数据——即单一的移动特征、设备或被跟踪对象。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/summarizesCommunityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:summarizesCommunity is functional: a community summary condenses exactly one community, the single cluster whose members and chunks the summary was generated from."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:summarizesCommunity 是函数性的:一份社区摘要恰好浓缩自一个社区,即该摘要据以生成的那唯一一个簇的成员与分块。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/supportGroundFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:supportGround is functional: one gmeow:SupportAssessment weighs exactly one gmeow:JustificationGround — the single ground whose warranting strength it measures under one standard, so a second ground would be a separate support assessment."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:supportGround 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SupportAssessment 恰好权衡一个 gmeow:JustificationGround——即它在一种标准下衡量其担保强度的唯一依据,第二个依据将构成一次独立的支持评估。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/supportPolarityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:supportPolarity is functional: an evidence span holds a single NLI/AIS verdict toward the claim it grounds — supports, refutes, or neutral — so faithfulness and contradiction audits read one stance per span rather than reconciling conflicting polarities on the same span."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:supportPolarity 是函数性的:一个证据跨度对其所支撑的断言只持有一个 NLI/AIS 判定——supports、refutes 或 neutral——因此忠实性与矛盾审计每个跨度只读取一种立场,而不必在同一跨度上调和相互冲突的极性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/supportTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:supportTarget is functional: a gmeow:Support instance backs exactly one gmeow:Argument, since keeping support singular lets independent supports for the same argument accrue as separate Support instances (Principle 9)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:supportTarget 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Support 实例恰好支持一个 gmeow:Argument,因为保持支持关系单一使得针对同一论点的各独立支持能够作为多个不同的 Support 实例累积(原则 9)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/supportUnderStandardFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:supportUnderStandard is functional: one gmeow:SupportAssessment measures support relative to exactly one named gmeow:EpistemicStandard — the single bar its strength is indexed to, so assessing the same ground under a second standard is a distinct assessment."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:supportUnderStandard 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:SupportAssessment 恰好相对于一个具名的 gmeow:EpistemicStandard 衡量支持度——即其强度所参照的唯一标杆,因此在第二种标准下评估同一依据将构成一次不同的评估。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/taggingSchemeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:taggingScheme is functional: a gmeow:Tagging act is performed within exactly one scheme — even though the applied tag may itself be cross-listed in several schemes via gmeow:tagInScheme, the act names a single scheme context."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:taggingScheme 是函数性的:一次 gmeow:Tagging 行为恰好在一个方案内进行——即便所应用的标签本身可能通过 gmeow:tagInScheme 被交叉列入多个方案,该行为也只指明一个方案语境。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/taggingTagFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:taggingTag is functional: a gmeow:Tagging relator applies exactly one tag — several tags on a resource are several relators, not multiple values on one Tagging."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:taggingTag 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Tagging 关系体恰好应用一个标签——一项资源上的多个标签对应多个关系体,而非一个 Tagging 上的多个值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/taggingTaggedFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:taggingTagged is functional: each gmeow:Tagging relator applies to exactly one tagged entity, with a fresh relator minted per distinct tagging act."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:taggingTagged 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:Tagging 关系体恰好作用于一个被标记的实体,每一次不同的打标行为都会铸造一个新的关系体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/targetsResourceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:targetsResource is functional: one vector row embeds exactly one resource — the single term, document, chunk, summary, or statement reifier the row stands for, which is that row's identity; a row targeting two resources would be two distinct rows, never one slot bound to both."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:targetsResource 是函数性的:一个向量行恰好嵌入一个资源——即该行所代表的唯一术语、文档、分块、摘要或语句具化体,这正是该行的身份;若一行指向两个资源,那将是两个不同的行,绝不是一个同时绑定二者的槽位。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/taskDueDateFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:taskDueDate is functional: a task has exactly one due date — the single xsd:dateTime deadline, the iCalendar VTODO DUE moment, by which it should be completed."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:taskDueDate 是函数性的:一项任务恰好有一个到期日——即唯一的 xsd:dateTime 截止时刻,亦即 iCalendar VTODO 的 DUE 时刻,任务应在此之前完成。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/taskPriorityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:taskPriority is functional: a task carries exactly one priority — a single value on the iCalendar PRIORITY scale (0 undefined, 1 highest, 9 lowest)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:taskPriority 是函数性的:一项任务恰好携带一个优先级——即 iCalendar PRIORITY 量表上的单一数值(0 表示未定义,1 为最高,9 为最低)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/taskRecurrenceUntilDoneFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:taskRecurrenceUntilDone is functional: a task bears exactly one until-done recurrence flag — the single boolean deciding whether it re-arms until marked completed rather than ending at a fixed count or date."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:taskRecurrenceUntilDone 是函数性的:一项任务恰好携带一个直至完成的重复标志——即那唯一的布尔值,决定它是重新武装直至被标记完成,而不是在固定次数或日期处终止。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/teacherFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:teacher is functional: one gmeow:Teaching relator has exactly one instructing agent — co-teaching is several Teaching relators sharing a subject and learner set, never two teachers on one relation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:teacher 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:Teaching 关系体恰好有一位授课主体——协同教学表现为多个共享同一学科与学习者集合的 Teaching 关系体,而绝不是在一个关系上出现两位教师。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/tempoMapSegmentOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tempoMapSegmentOf is functional: a TempoMapSegment belongs to exactly one parent TempoMap, so its owning map is uniquely determined."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tempoMapSegmentOf 是函数性的:一个 TempoMapSegment 恰好属于一个父级 TempoMap,因此其所属的映射被唯一确定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/tempoRatioExpressionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tempoRatioExpression is functional: a TimeMapping's irrational tempo ratio has exactly one canonical symbolic expression, so its stored literal is single and never reasoner-parsed."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tempoRatioExpression 是函数性的:一个 TimeMapping 的无理速度比恰好只有一个规范的符号表达式,因此其存储的字面量是单一的,并且从不由推理机解析。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/tenureAgentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tenureAgent is functional: a gmeow:IntentionTenure records the intentional mode of exactly one agent."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tenureAgent 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:IntentionTenure 恰好记录一个主体的意向模式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/tenureInquirerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tenureInquirer is functional: a gmeow:InquiryTenure records the open question of exactly one agent — two agents holding the same question open are two tenures sharing one gmeow:tenureQuestion, not two inquirers on one tenure."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tenureInquirer 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:InquiryTenure 恰好记录一个主体的悬而未决问题——两个主体共同悬置同一个问题时,是两个共享同一个 gmeow:tenureQuestion 的保有,而不是一个保有上的两个探询者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/tenureIntentionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tenureIntention is functional: a gmeow:IntentionTenure records exactly one intrinsic desire or intention over its interval, so adopting another mode opens a separate tenure."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tenureIntention 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:IntentionTenure 在其区间内恰好记录一种内在欲望或意向,采用另一种模式则会开启一个独立的保有。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/tenureOfDoxasticStateFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tenureOfDoxasticState is functional: one gmeow:DoxasticTenure scopes exactly one gmeow:DoxasticState — the single believing whose holding interval it records — so a revised belief opens a fresh state and a fresh tenure rather than re-pointing this one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tenureOfDoxasticState 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:DoxasticTenure 恰好限定一个 gmeow:DoxasticState——即它所记录其持有区间的那唯一一种信念——因此经修订的信念会开启一个新的状态与一个新的保有,而不是重新指向这一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/tenureOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tenureOf is functional: a gmeow:InferenceTenure time-scopes exactly one gmeow:InferenceCommitment, since one tenure opens and later closes the acceptance of a single commitment's conclusion and a second commitment gets its own tenure."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tenureOf 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:InferenceTenure 恰好为一个 gmeow:InferenceCommitment 划定时间范围,因为一次保有开启并随后终止对单一承诺之结论的接受,第二个承诺会拥有它自己的保有。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/tenurePartyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tenureParty is functional: a land tenure records the rights held by one party, and joint ownership is modelled as multiple co-equal LandTenure instances rather than several parties on one, so exactly one party holds each tenure (Principle 9)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tenureParty 是函数性的:一项土地保有权恰好记录一方所持有的权利,共同所有权被建模为多个地位对等的 LandTenure 实例,而不是一个保有上的多方,因此每项保有恰好由一方持有(原则 9)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/tenurePlaceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tenurePlace is functional: a land tenure's rights apply over exactly one place (parcel, lot, or spatial unit) that is constitutive of the tenure's identity, so a second place would be a different tenure."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tenurePlace 是函数性的:一项土地保有权的权利恰好作用于一个地点(地块、宗地或空间单元),该地点是该保有权身份的构成性要素,因此第二个地点将构成一项不同的保有权。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/tenureQuestionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tenureQuestion is functional: a gmeow:InquiryTenure records exactly one held-open question — an agent holding five questions open bears five tenures, and sharing happens at a single gmeow:Question individual rather than by multi-valuing this edge."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tenureQuestion 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:InquiryTenure 恰好记录一个被悬置的问题——一个主体同时悬置五个问题就拥有五个保有,共享发生在单一的 gmeow:Question 个体层面,而不是通过给这条边赋多个值来实现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/tenureStandpointFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tenureStandpoint is functional: a standpoint-tenure records exactly one frame's position, so it names a single standpoint that becomes the vantage of the generated claim, and a different frame's position is a separate tenure rather than a second — never privileged — standpoint on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tenureStandpoint 是函数性的:一个立场保有恰好记录一个参照系的立场,因此它指明了成为所生成断言之视角的那唯一一个立场,不同参照系的立场是一个独立的保有,而不是在这一个保有上添加第二个——绝不享有特权的——立场。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/tenuredContactPointFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tenuredContactPoint is functional: an address-tenure is about a single contact-point channel held over its interval, so the tenure names one contact point and a different channel is a distinct tenure rather than a second point on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tenuredContactPoint 是函数性的:一项地址保有权针对的是在其区间内持有的单一联系点渠道,因此该保有权只指明一个联系点,不同的渠道构成一项独立的保有权,而不是在这一个保有权上添加第二个点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/termApplicationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:termApplication is functional: a term-carrier bears exactly one term value, so when that value is a compound function term the carrier points at a single logic:FunctionTerm sub-tree — the fifth of the five mutually exclusive term-value properties, exactly one of which is present on each carrier."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:termApplication 是函数性的:一个术语载体恰好携带一个术语值,因此当该值是一个复合函数项时,该载体指向单一的 logic:FunctionTerm 子树——这是五个互斥的术语值属性中的第五个,每个载体上恰好存在其中一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/termIndexFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:termIndex is functional: a term-carrier occupies exactly one position in its ordered list — argument or bound variable — so it fixes a single zero-based ordinal, the explicit position that makes variadic, order-significant lists round-trip independent of RDF statement order."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:termIndex 是函数性的:一个术语载体在其有序列表(实参或约束变量)中恰好占据一个位置,因此它确定了唯一一个从零开始计数的序数,这个显式位置使得可变元且顺序敏感的列表能够独立于 RDF 语句顺序而完整往返。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/termIriFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:termIri is functional: a term-carrier bears exactly one term value, so an IRI-constant carrier names a single IRI — the one individual, reified relation, or type it stands for — as one of the mutually exclusive term-value properties, exactly one of which is present on each carrier."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:termIri 是函数性的:一个术语载体恰好携带一个术语值,因此一个 IRI 常量载体只指明一个 IRI——即它所代表的那唯一一个个体、具化关系或类型——这是彼此互斥的术语值属性之一,每个载体上恰好存在其中一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/termLiteralDatatypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:termLiteralDatatype is functional: a literal term-carrier has exactly one datatype, so it carries a single datatype IRI held separately from the lexical form on logic:termLiteral, letting the typed-literal term round-trip losslessly — absent for a plain literal, and one datatype when present."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:termLiteralDatatype 是函数性的:一个字面量术语载体恰好有一种数据类型,因此它携带的是与 logic:termLiteral 上的词法形式分开保存的单一数据类型 IRI,使带类型的字面量项能够无损地完整往返——对于普通字面量则不存在,存在时只有一种数据类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/termLiteralFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:termLiteral is functional: a term-carrier bears exactly one term value, so a literal carrier holds a single lexical form — its datatype riding on the companion logic:termLiteralDatatype — as one of the mutually exclusive term-value properties, exactly one of which is present on each carrier."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:termLiteral 是函数性的:一个术语载体恰好携带一个术语值,因此一个字面量载体持有单一的词法形式——其数据类型由伴随属性 logic:termLiteralDatatype 承载——这是彼此互斥的术语值属性之一,每个载体上恰好存在其中一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/termSequenceMarkerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:termSequenceMarker is functional: a term-carrier bears exactly one term value, so a sequence-marker carrier holds a single authored marker name — the one logic:SequenceMarker binding a sequence of terms rather than a single one — as one of the mutually exclusive term-value properties."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:termSequenceMarker 是函数性的:一个术语载体恰好携带一个术语值,因此一个序列标记载体持有一个撰写好的单一标记名称——即绑定一串术语而非单个术语的那唯一的 logic:SequenceMarker——这是彼此互斥的术语值属性之一。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/termVariableFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:termVariable is functional: a term-carrier bears exactly one term value, so a variable carrier holds a single authored variable name (without a sigil) — one variable bound by an enclosing quantifier or free — as one of the mutually exclusive term-value properties, exactly one of which is present on each carrier."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:termVariable 是函数性的:一个术语载体恰好携带一个术语值,因此一个变量载体持有一个撰写好的单一变量名(不带符号前缀)——一个被外层量词约束的变量,或是自由变量——这是彼此互斥的术语值属性之一,每个载体上恰好存在其中一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/thresholdFloorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:thresholdFloor is functional: each gmeow:AxisThreshold pairing pins exactly one normalized score floor for its tier, so a second floor would leave the scorer without a single bar to compare the measured axis score against."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:thresholdFloor 是函数性的:每一对 gmeow:AxisThreshold 恰好为其分层确定一个归一化的分数下限,第二个下限将使评分器失去唯一一条可用来比较所测轴分数的基准线。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/thresholdTierFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:thresholdTier is functional: each gmeow:AxisThreshold pairing gates exactly one tier rung, so a second tier would dissolve the reified (tier, floor) cell into an ambiguous mapping."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:thresholdTier 是函数性的:每一对 gmeow:AxisThreshold 恰好把关一个分层等级,第二个分层将使这个具化的 (tier, floor) 单元瓦解为一种含混不清的映射。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/tierRankFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tierRank is functional: each gmeow:QualityTier occupies exactly one position in the ladder's total order, so a tier bearing two ranks would make that order ill-defined and break the lattice meet (least rank) the roll-up depends on."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tierRank 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:QualityTier 在该阶梯的全序中恰好占据一个位置,若某一分层同时带有两个等级,将使该顺序变得不明确,并破坏汇总所依赖的格论交(最小等级)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/timbreObservationResultFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:timbreObservationResult is functional: a single Observation assigns exactly one timbre descriptor to the ToneEvent it observes, so its result is uniquely determined per observation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:timbreObservationResult 是函数性的:单个 Observation 只为其观察的 ToneEvent 赋予恰好一个音色描述符,因此其结果在每次观察中都是唯一确定的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/timeDurationDenominatorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:timeDurationDenominator is functional: a MusicalTimeSpan's rational duration has exactly one denominator in its frame, so a single positive integer fixes it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:timeDurationDenominator 是函数性的:MusicalTimeSpan 的有理数时长在其参照系中恰好只有一个分母,因此单个正整数即可确定它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/timeDurationNumeratorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:timeDurationNumerator is functional: a MusicalTimeSpan's rational duration has exactly one numerator in its frame, so a single integer fixes it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:timeDurationNumerator 是函数性的:MusicalTimeSpan 的有理数时长在其参照系中恰好只有一个分子,因此单个整数即可确定它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/timeMappingKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:timeMappingKind is functional: a TimeMapping is of exactly one kind (tuplet, tempo canon, metric modulation, groove), so a single kind classifies it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:timeMappingKind 是函数性的:TimeMapping 恰好属于一种类型(连音、速度卡农、节拍调制、律动),因此单一类型即可对其分类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/timeStartDenominatorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:timeStartDenominator is functional: a MusicalTimeSpan's rational start position has exactly one denominator in its frame, so a single positive integer fixes it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:timeStartDenominator 是函数性的:MusicalTimeSpan 的有理数起始位置在其参照系中恰好只有一个分母,因此单个正整数即可确定它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/timeStartNumeratorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:timeStartNumerator is functional: a MusicalTimeSpan's rational start position has exactly one numerator in its frame, so a single integer fixes it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:timeStartNumerator 是函数性的:MusicalTimeSpan 的有理数起始位置在其参照系中恰好只有一个分子,因此单个整数即可确定它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/timeZoneIanaIdFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:timeZoneIanaId is functional: a time zone is named by exactly one IANA tzid — the single identifier (e.g. America/Toronto) that libraries resolve to its full DST ruleset."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:timeZoneIanaId 是函数性的:一个时区仅由恰好一个 IANA tzid 命名——即各类库据以解析出其完整夏令时规则集的唯一标识符(例如 America/Toronto)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/toneEventArticulationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:toneEventArticulation is functional: a ToneEvent carries exactly one articulation or attack quality, so its articulation is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:toneEventArticulation 是函数性的:一个 ToneEvent 恰好带有一种吐音法或起音特质,因此其吐音法是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/toneEventDynamicsFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:toneEventDynamics is functional: a ToneEvent has exactly one symbolic dynamic level from ppp to fff, so its dynamics marking is single-valued while measured decibels go to the observation layer."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:toneEventDynamics 是函数性的:一个 ToneEvent 恰好具有一个从 ppp 到 fff 的符号力度等级,因此其力度标记是单值的,而实测分贝值则归属于观察层。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/toneEventIsUnpitchedFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:toneEventIsUnpitched is functional: a ToneEvent is either unpitched or not, a single boolean flag that takes exactly one truth value and is mutually exclusive with pitch value and pitch trajectory."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:toneEventIsUnpitched 是函数性的:一个 ToneEvent 要么无音高要么不是,这是一个单一的布尔标志,恰好取一个真值,并与音高值和音高轨迹互斥。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/toneEventPitchTrajectoryFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:toneEventPitchTrajectory is functional: a ToneEvent sounds at most one continuous pitch trajectory, exclusive of a discrete pitch value or the unpitched flag, so its trajectory is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:toneEventPitchTrajectory 是函数性的:一个 ToneEvent 至多发出一条连续的音高轨迹,与离散音高值或无音高标志互斥,因此其轨迹是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/toneEventPitchValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:toneEventPitchValue is functional: a ToneEvent sounds at most one frame-relative pitch value, exclusive of a trajectory or the unpitched flag under the single pitch-content mode, so its pitch value is single-valued."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:toneEventPitchValue 是函数性的:在单一音高内容模式下,一个 ToneEvent 至多发出一个相对于参照系的音高值,与轨迹或无音高标志互斥,因此其音高值是单值的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/toneEventTimbreFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:toneEventTimbre is functional: this shortcut asserts exactly one timbre descriptor on a ToneEvent, with contested or attributed descriptors deferred to coexisting observations rather than multiple values (Principle 9)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:toneEventTimbre 是函数性的:此快捷方式在一个 ToneEvent 上恰好断言一个音色描述符,有争议或需归因的描述符被交由共存的观察处理,而非采用多个值(原则 9)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/toolArgumentsFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:toolArguments is functional: a tool call carries exactly one verbatim arguments payload, the single byte-faithful record (or its content digest) of what was presented to the tool."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:toolArguments 是函数性的:一次工具调用恰好携带一个逐字参数负载,即呈现给该工具的内容的唯一字节级精确记录(或其内容摘要)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/toolResultFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:toolResult is functional: a tool call returns exactly one verbatim result payload, the single byte-faithful record (or its content digest) of what the tool returned."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:toolResult 是函数性的:一次工具调用恰好返回一个逐字结果负载,即该工具所返回内容的唯一字节级精确记录(或其内容摘要)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/trademarkMarkFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:trademarkMark is functional: a trademark right reifies protection of a single sign, so it points at exactly one gmeow:Mark; protecting a second mark is a second gmeow:Trademark relator rather than two marks bound to the same right."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:trademarkMark 是函数性的:一项商标权具象化了对单一标志的保护,因此它恰好指向一个 gmeow:Mark;保护第二个标志应是第二个 gmeow:Trademark 关系元,而非将两个标志绑定到同一项权利上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/trademarkStatusFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:trademarkStatus is functional: a trademark occupies exactly one registration status at any time — unregistered ™, registered ®, pending, expired, or cancelled — mutually exclusive lifecycle states, so on lapse the single value changes (with gmeow:validUntil recorded) rather than a second status being added."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:trademarkStatus 是函数性的:一个商标在任一时刻恰好处于一种注册状态——未注册 ™、已注册 ®、待审、失效或已撤销——这些是互斥的生命周期状态,因此失效时应更改这一单值(同时记录 gmeow:validUntil),而不是添加第二个状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/trajectoryOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:trajectoryOf is functional: a trajectory traces the space-time path of exactly one entity, so it belongs to a single entity and one Trajectory is never shared across entities."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:trajectoryOf 是函数性的:一条轨迹恰好描摹一个实体的时空路径,因此它归属于单一实体,一个 Trajectory 绝不会在多个实体间共享。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/trajectoryReferenceFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:trajectoryReferenceFrame is functional: all samples of a trajectory are expressed against one frame, so exactly one reference frame situates the path while frame transformation remains a solver concern (Principle 12)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:trajectoryReferenceFrame 是函数性的:一条轨迹的所有采样点都相对于同一个参照系表达,因此恰好一个参照系确定该路径的位置,而参照系变换仍属求解器的关注范畴(原则 12)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/transactionAmountFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:transactionAmount is functional: a financial transaction occurrence has exactly one canonical amount — the single MonetaryAmount of the money moved, with disputed figures kept as separate standpoint-indexed statements rather than extra values on the same transaction."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:transactionAmount 是函数性的:一次金融交易发生恰好只有一个规范金额——即所转移资金的唯一 MonetaryAmount,存在争议的数字应作为按立场索引的独立陈述保存,而非在同一交易上添加额外值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/transactionHashFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:transactionHash is functional: a ledger transaction has one stable on-chain identity hash, so the value used to look up and re-verify it is single, distinct from the hash of its block or the identifier of its network."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:transactionHash 是函数性的:一笔账本交易拥有一个稳定的链上身份哈希,因此用于查找和重新校验它的值是唯一的,不同于其所在区块的哈希或其所在网络的标识符。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/transformationParameterFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:transformationParameter is functional: a SegmentTransformation carries at most one qualifying parameter — a PitchInterval, a MetricStructure, or another entity — so its parameter is single-valued and type-dependently interpreted."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:transformationParameter 是函数性的:一个 SegmentTransformation 至多携带一个限定参数——PitchInterval、MetricStructure 或其他实体——因此其参数是单值的,并依类型作出解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/transformationSourceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:transformationSource is functional: a SegmentTransformation has exactly one source MusicalSegment, so its input segment is uniquely determined."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:transformationSource 是函数性的:一个 SegmentTransformation 恰好有一个来源 MusicalSegment,因此其输入段是唯一确定的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/transformationTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:transformationTarget is functional: a SegmentTransformation produces exactly one target MusicalSegment, so its output segment is uniquely determined."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:transformationTarget 是函数性的:一个 SegmentTransformation 恰好产生一个目标 MusicalSegment,因此其输出段是唯一确定的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/transformationTypeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:transformationType is functional: a SegmentTransformation is of exactly one type relating its source and target (transposition, inversion, retrograde), so a single type classifies it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:transformationType 是函数性的:一个 SegmentTransformation 恰好属于一种连接其来源与目标的类型(移调、倒影、逆行),因此单一类型即可对其分类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/translationOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:translationOf is functional: an inscription translation renders exactly one source inscription into another language, the single text the translation is of."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:translationOf 是函数性的:一次铭文翻译恰好将一篇源铭文转换为另一种语言,即该翻译所对应的唯一文本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/transliterationOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:transliterationOf is functional: an inscription transliteration maps exactly one source inscription into another script, the single text whose sign sequences it re-encodes."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:transliterationOf 是函数性的:一次铭文转写恰好将一篇源铭文映射到另一种文字体系,即其重新编码符号序列所对应的唯一文本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/treeEntryModeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:treeEntryMode is functional: a tree entry carries exactly one git file mode — the single mode field (regular file, executable, directory, submodule, or symlink) on that one line of the tree object."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:treeEntryMode 是函数性的:一个树条目恰好携带一个 git 文件模式——即树对象那一行上唯一的模式字段(普通文件、可执行文件、目录、子模块或符号链接)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/treeEntryNameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:treeEntryName is functional: a tree entry carries exactly one file-or-directory name — the single name on that one line of the git tree object."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:treeEntryName 是函数性的:一个树条目恰好携带一个文件或目录名——即该 git 树对象那一行上唯一的名称。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/treeEntryObjectFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:treeEntryObject is functional: a tree entry points to exactly one content-addressed object — the single Blob or SourceTree that one line of the tree names."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:treeEntryObject 是函数性的:一个树条目恰好指向一个内容寻址对象——即树中那一行所命名的唯一 Blob 或 SourceTree。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/trueQuantityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:trueQuantity is functional: a framed math:Quantity is a reading of exactly one frame-independent gmeow:Magnitude — a single true magnitude underlies it, and that one magnitude is shared across readings taken in different units."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:trueQuantity 是函数性的:一个带参照系的 math:Quantity 恰好是对一个与参照系无关的 gmeow:Magnitude 的读数——其背后只有一个真实的量,且这一个量在以不同单位所取的各读数间是共享的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/trustLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:trustLevel is functional: a gmeow:TrustAssertion expresses exactly one owner-trust degree — ultimate, full, marginal, or none — being one trustor's subjective level toward its trustee and never two degrees on the same assertion."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:trustLevel 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:TrustAssertion 恰好表达一个所有者信任程度——终极、完全、有限或无——是一个信任方对其受信方的主观程度,同一断言上绝不会出现两个程度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/trusteeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:trustee is functional: a gmeow:TrustAssertion names exactly one trustee, since a single assertion expresses one trustor's stance toward one trusted agent and trust in another agent is a separate assertion."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:trustee 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:TrustAssertion 恰好指定一个受信方,因为单一断言只表达一个信任方对一个受信代理的立场,对另一代理的信任则是另一独立断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/trustorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:trustor is functional: a gmeow:TrustAssertion is held from exactly one trustor's standpoint, being the single perspective holder whose subjective trust it expresses, since another agent's trust is a separate assertion (Principle 9)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:trustor 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:TrustAssertion 恰好持自一个信任方的立场,是其所表达主观信任的唯一视角持有者,因为另一代理的信任是另一独立断言(原则 9)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/tuningKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:tuningKind is functional: a TuningSystem is of exactly one kind (equal division, just intonation, well temperament), with hybrid systems modelled as multiple coexisting standpoints rather than multiple values (Principle 9)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:tuningKind 是函数性的:一个 TuningSystem 恰好属于一种类型(等分律、纯律、良好律),混合体系应建模为多个共存的立场,而非多个值(原则 9)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/unLocodeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:unLocode is functional: a Geocode holds one UN/LOCODE — the single five-character code for a transport location (port, airport, rail terminal) — so one value identifies it."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:unLocode 是函数性的:一个 Geocode 持有一个 UN/LOCODE——即某运输地点(港口、机场、铁路终点站)的唯一五字符代码——因此单一值即可标识它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/underSemanticsFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:underSemantics is functional: a gmeow:ArgumentEvaluation is computed under exactly one named acceptability semantics, since the semantics fixes the labelling and the same argument assessed under a second semantics is a distinct evaluation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:underSemantics 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:ArgumentEvaluation 恰好在一种指名的可接受性语义下计算,因为该语义决定了标注结果,同一论证在第二种语义下评估将构成一个不同的评估。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/underStandardFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:underStandard is functional: one reified gmeow:KnowledgeClaim is held to exactly one gmeow:EpistemicStandard — the single ordinary, scientific, or legal bar under which the knowing counts — so the same knowing under a different standard is a separate claim."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:underStandard 是函数性的:一个具象化的 gmeow:KnowledgeClaim 恰好受一个 gmeow:EpistemicStandard 约束——即该项知晓据以成立的唯一日常、科学或法律门槛——因此同一知晓在不同标准下应视为一项独立主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/unitFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:unit is functional: a framed quantitative value is expressed in exactly one QUDT unit — the single unit the reading is stated in, held on the framed math:Quantity and never on the frame-independent gmeow:Magnitude, so a value read in another unit is a distinct framed quantity while a value bearing gmeow:unit but no reference frame is instead the logic:MeasurementFrameMissing violation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:unit 是函数性的:一个带参照系的定量值恰好以一个 QUDT 单位表达——即该读数所依据的唯一单位,承载于带参照系的 math:Quantity 之上,绝不承载于与参照系无关的 gmeow:Magnitude 之上,因此以另一单位读取的值构成一个不同的带参照系量,而带有 gmeow:unit 却没有参照系的值则构成 logic:MeasurementFrameMissing 违规。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/usageAppellationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:usageAppellation is functional: a gmeow:NameUsage relator binds exactly one appellation — the single name by which its subject is called in that reified use, so a different appellation is a different usage."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:usageAppellation 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:NameUsage 关系元恰好绑定一个称谓——即在该具象化用法中其主体被称呼的唯一名称,因此不同的称谓即构成不同的用法。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/usageNamedFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:usageNamed is functional: a gmeow:NameUsage relator names exactly one entity — the single subject called by its appellation in that reified use, so a different named entity is a different usage."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:usageNamed 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:NameUsage 关系元恰好命名一个实体——即在该具象化用法中被其称谓所称呼的唯一主体,因此不同的被命名实体即构成不同的用法。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/usageRegisterFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:usageRegister is functional: a gmeow:NameUsage carries exactly one social register — the single formal, intimate, professional, or casual posture of that one reified use of a name."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:usageRegister 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:NameUsage 恰好携带一种社会语域——即该次具象化姓名用法所独有的正式、亲密、专业或随意姿态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/usageRelationshipScopeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:usageRelationshipScope is functional: a gmeow:NameUsage is scoped by exactly one standing interpersonal relationship — the single tie, such as the aunt-niece bond within which 'Aunt Genny' is used, this being the sharp one-relationship case of gmeow:usageAudience."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:usageRelationshipScope 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:NameUsage 恰好受限于一种持久的人际关系——例如「阿姨-侄女」这一唯一纽带,在其中使用「Genny 姨」,这正是 gmeow:usageAudience 中明确的单一关系情形。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/usedModelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:usedModel is functional: a model invocation called exactly one model agent, so the invocation-to-model link carries a single gmeow:SoftwareAgent and a second model called is a second invocation rather than an added target on one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:usedModel 是函数性的:一次模型调用恰好调用了一个模型代理,因此调用到模型的链接只携带一个 gmeow:SoftwareAgent,调用第二个模型应视为第二次调用,而非在同一次调用上添加目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/usedToolFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:usedTool is functional: a tool call invokes exactly one tool, since tool-ness is the role an agent plays in this one call event and a multi-tool turn is recorded as several ToolCalls."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:usedTool 是函数性的:一次工具调用恰好调用一个工具,因为「工具性」是代理在这一次调用事件中所扮演的角色,一个涉及多个工具的回合应记录为多个 ToolCall。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/usesScaleFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:usesScale is functional: each holder — a rubric as its default or a criterion as an override — uses exactly one score scale, and a criterion-level scale replaces the rubric default rather than adding a second."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:usesScale 是函数性的:每个持有者——作为默认值的评分标准或作为覆盖值的准则——恰好使用一种评分量表,准则层级的量表会取代评分标准的默认量表,而不是再增加一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/utilityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:utility is functional: a goal evaluation carries exactly one utility — the single desirability quantity, where utility and preference are one concept so no separate preference property is minted — distinct from the uncertainty measures, from logic:satisfactionDegree, and from logic:objectiveValue."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:utility 是函数性的:一次目标评估恰好携带一个效用——即唯一的可欲性数量,其中效用与偏好是同一个概念,因此不另设独立的偏好属性——它不同于不确定性度量、logic:satisfactionDegree 以及 logic:objectiveValue。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/utilizationOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:utilizationOf is functional: a utilization measurement is constitutively about exactly one location, since the occupancy-to-capacity ratio it reports belongs to a single locus, so a second location would be a different measurement."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:utilizationOf 是函数性的:一次利用率测量在构成上恰好关于一个位置,因为它所报告的占用与容量之比归属于单一场所,若涉及第二个位置则应视为另一次测量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/vectorByteOrderFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:vectorByteOrder is functional: an embedding family serializes its stored matrix under exactly one byte order that folds into its gmeow:contentDigest identity, so a byte-order difference is a family difference rather than a silent reinterpretation of the same stored bytes; the family therefore fixes a single gmeow:ByteOrder."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:vectorByteOrder 是函数性的:一个嵌入族恰好以一种字节序序列化其所存储的矩阵,该字节序被折叠进其 gmeow:contentDigest 身份,因此字节序的差异构成族的差异,而非对同一存储字节的静默重新解读;该族因而固定为单一的 gmeow:ByteOrder。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/vectorProfileFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:vectorProfile is functional: a vector observation is read against exactly one declared basis/frame for the whole vector — the single metric all its per-axis cells share — so a second basis would make the reading's coordinates ambiguous."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:vectorProfile 是函数性的:一次向量观察恰好相对于为整个向量声明的一个基/参照系来读取——即其各轴分量共享的唯一度量——若存在第二个基,该读数的坐标将变得含糊不清。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/vectorTargetKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:vectorTargetKind is functional: a vector target embeds exactly one kind of resource — a row is a corpus, document, chunk, dataset, graph, statement, reifier, annotation, term, or summary, but one flavour, not two; the target therefore folds in a single gmeow:VectorTargetKind."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:vectorTargetKind 是函数性的:一个向量目标恰好嵌入一种资源类型——一行可以是语料库、文档、分块、数据集、图、陈述、具象化元素、标注、术语或摘要,但只能是一种,不能是两种;因此该目标折入单一的 gmeow:VectorTargetKind。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/verdictProvenanceFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:verdictProvenance is functional: a conjecture's positive/negative cases were either engine-produced or reviewer-asserted but not both, so it carries exactly one logic:VerdictProvenanceKind — the one genuinely-new axis the conjecture library adds over the plain candidate spine, single-valued and required."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:verdictProvenance 是函数性的:一个猜想的正例/反例要么由引擎生成,要么由审阅者断言,二者不可兼得,因此它恰好携带一个 logic:VerdictProvenanceKind——这是猜想库相对于纯粹候选主干新增的唯一真正新维度,单值且必填。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/verificationStatusFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:verificationStatus is functional: a gmeow:CryptographicSignature carries exactly one verification outcome from a given verifier, since a competing verifier's differing result is recorded as a separate signature observation rather than a second status here."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:verificationStatus 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:CryptographicSignature 恰好携带来自某一验证者的一个验证结果,因为竞争验证者给出的不同结果应记录为一次独立的签名观察,而不是在此处增加第二个状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/verifierOutcomeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:verifierOutcome is functional: a gmeow:VerifierVerdict has exactly one outcome value — the single held / not-held / undetermined result the hard-failure gate keys on."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:verifierOutcome 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:VerifierVerdict 恰好具有一个结果值——即硬失败门禁所依据的唯一「成立/不成立/未确定」结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/versionMemberFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:versionMember is functional: each gmeow:VersionMembership is about exactly one concrete version artifact — a different version of the same lineage is its own membership relator, not a second member."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:versionMember 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:VersionMembership 恰好关于一个具体的版本制品——同一谱系的不同版本应有其自己的成员关系元,而不是作为第二个成员。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/versionSetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:versionSet is functional: each gmeow:VersionMembership places its member into exactly one lineage, so a membership belongs to a single gmeow:VersionSet."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:versionSet 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:VersionMembership 恰好将其成员归入一个谱系,因此一个成员关系只属于一个 gmeow:VersionSet。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/vocabularyCountKindFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:vocabularyCountKind is functional: each gmeow:ProjectionVocabulary selects exactly one of the three closed construct-recognition strategies, so a second kind would leave the shared counter's Rust dispatch without a single enumeration path to resolve."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:vocabularyCountKind 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:ProjectionVocabulary 恰好选定三种封闭构造识别策略之一,若存在第二种类型,共享计数器的 Rust 分派就无法解析出唯一的枚举路径。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/vocabularyDefaultCeilingFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:vocabularyDefaultCeiling is functional: each gmeow:ProjectionVocabulary carries exactly one vacuous-case default ceiling for slices lacking an explicit commitment, so a second default would leave every unlisted slice held to an ambiguous fallback and reopen the net-new-vocab loophole."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:vocabularyDefaultCeiling 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:ProjectionVocabulary 恰好携带一个针对缺乏明确承诺切片的空案例默认上限,若存在第二个默认值,每个未列出的切片都将受制于一个含糊的回退值,并重新打开「全新词汇」漏洞。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/vocabularyOwnerFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:vocabularyOwner is functional: each gmeow:ProjectionVocabulary has exactly one grounding slice (logic:, math:, or lang:) holding its external-authoring authority, so a second owner would give the external terms two authoring homes and defeat the very second-source ratchet the owner boundary exists to enforce."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:vocabularyOwner 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:ProjectionVocabulary 恰好有一个基础切片(logic:、math: 或 lang:)持有其外部著录权威,若存在第二个所有者,外部术语将拥有两个著录归属地,从而破坏所有者边界本应强制执行的「防第二来源」棘轮机制。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/vocabularyPrefixFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:vocabularyPrefix is functional: each gmeow:ProjectionVocabulary has exactly one short CURIE prefix serving as the join key ceiling commitments resolve against, so a second prefix would break the unique-key binding between a ceiling commitment and its vocabulary."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:vocabularyPrefix 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:ProjectionVocabulary 恰好有一个简短的 CURIE 前缀,用作上限承诺据以解析的连接键,若存在第二个前缀,将破坏上限承诺与其词汇之间的唯一键绑定关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/vocabularyPreservationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:vocabularyPreservation is functional: each gmeow:ProjectionVocabulary's lowering from logic: carries exactly one loss-ledger preservation polarity, so a second judgment would make the guarantee the projection advertises to the shared loss-ledger ambiguous."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:vocabularyPreservation 是函数性的:每个 gmeow:ProjectionVocabulary 从 logic: 的降阶恰好携带一个损失账本保真极性,若存在第二个判定,该投影向共享损失账本所宣称的保证将变得含糊不清。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/vocabularySubsumedByFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:vocabularySubsumedBy is functional: each guarded gmeow:ProjectionVocabulary is a generated lossy projection of exactly one logic: core, so a second subsumer would contradict Principle 17's premise that the surface projects from a single canonical source."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:vocabularySubsumedBy 是函数性的:每个受保护的 gmeow:ProjectionVocabulary 恰好是某一个 logic: 核心生成出的有损投影,若存在第二个包摄者,将与原则 17「表层由单一规范来源投影而来」的前提相矛盾。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/voiceMetricStructureFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:voiceMetricStructure is functional: a Voice hosts exactly one MetricStructure under its closed-world shape, with coexisting meters deferred to statement-layer claims."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:voiceMetricStructure 是函数性的:一个 Voice 在其闭世界形态下恰好承载一个 MetricStructure,共存的节拍应交由陈述层的主张处理。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/voiceTimeFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:voiceTimeFrame is functional: a Voice hosts exactly one MusicalTimeFrame under its closed-world shape, with coexisting frames deferred to statement-layer claims (Principle 11)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:voiceTimeFrame 是函数性的:一个 Voice 在其闭世界形态下恰好承载一个 MusicalTimeFrame,共存的参照系应交由陈述层的主张处理(原则 11)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/voiceTuningFrameFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:voiceTuningFrame is functional: a Voice hosts exactly one TuningSystem under its closed-world shape, with coexisting tunings deferred to statement-layer claims (Principle 11)."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:voiceTuningFrame 是函数性的:一个 Voice 在其闭世界形态下恰好承载一个 TuningSystem,共存的调律体系应交由陈述层的主张处理(原则 11)。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/walletSchemeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:walletScheme is functional: a crypto wallet operates on exactly one blockchain scheme — a single WalletScheme (Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, Monero, …), since a multi-scheme container is modelled as several wallets."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:walletScheme 是函数性的:一个加密钱包恰好运行在一种区块链方案上——单一的 WalletScheme(比特币、以太坊、Solana、门罗币等等),支持多方案的容器应建模为多个钱包。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/weightingPolicyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:weightingPolicy is functional: a derived intensity combines its axes under exactly one declared weighting policy — the single set of diagonal/off-diagonal Gram weights — so two policies would specify two different metrics for one intensity."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:weightingPolicy 是函数性的:一个派生强度恰好在一种声明的加权策略下组合其各轴——即一组唯一的对角/非对角 Gram 权重——若存在两种策略,将为同一强度指定两种不同的度量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/what3wordsFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:what3words is functional: a Geocode holds one what3words address — the three-word label of a single 3m×3m square — so one value fixes its location."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:what3words 是函数性的:一个 Geocode 持有一个 what3words 地址——即单个 3 米乘 3 米方格的三词标签——因此单一值即可确定其位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/withMetricFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:withMetric is functional: a similarity observation's proximity was computed under exactly one distance metric, because a cosine 0.9 and a dot-product 0.9 are not the same claim; the observation therefore names the single metric its score was measured under, which must in turn agree with its gmeow:overVectorSpace contract's metric."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:withMetric 是函数性的:一次相似度观察的接近程度恰好在一种距离度量下计算得出,因为余弦值 0.9 和点积值 0.9 并非同一种论断;因此该观察指明其分数据以测量的唯一度量,而该度量又必须与其 gmeow:overVectorSpace 契约的度量相一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/witnessIndividualFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:witnessIndividual is functional: a contradiction witness pins exactly one individual — the single entity forced to owl:Nothing under the conjectured formula, identifying precisely where the contradiction bit — so a refutation names one offending individual, not a set."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:witnessIndividual 是函数性的:一个矛盾见证恰好锁定一个个体——即在被猜测的公式下被迫归入 owl:Nothing 的唯一实体,精确指明矛盾发生之处——因此一次反驳只指名一个致错个体,而非一个集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/witnessWorldFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:witnessWorld is functional: a contradiction witness is realized in exactly one world, so it records a single world IRI — the one modal/context world within the conjecture's standpoint where the contradiction was found — keeping the refutation world-scoped rather than asserted across all worlds."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:witnessWorld 是函数性的:一个矛盾见证恰好在一个世界中实现,因此它记录唯一一个世界 IRI——即在该猜想立场之内发现矛盾的那一个模态/语境世界——从而使反驳限定在该世界范围内,而不是宣称适用于所有世界。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/adviceSourceFieldFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "adviceSourceField is functional"
msgstr "adviceSourceField 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/adviceSourceFieldFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that logic:adviceSourceField is functional: a realized advice carrier (an advisory logic:Constraint or a logic:AdviceGuidance) names exactly one logic:ProseField from the closed set (definition, use-when, or avoid-when) — the single field whose prose its logic:message must surface verbatim, so a carrier cannot ambiguously bind to two source fields at once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 logic:adviceSourceField 具有函数性：一个已实现的建议载体（一个咨询性 logic:Constraint 或一个 logic:AdviceGuidance）恰好指定封闭集合（`definition`、`use-when` 或 `avoid-when`）中的一个 logic:ProseField —— 即其 logic:message 必须逐字呈现其散文的那个唯一字段，因此一个载体不能同时含糊地绑定到两个来源字段。"
